window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4501,"title":"Chapter 4501: Unexpected (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4501: Unexpected (7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","As the pill entered her body, the speed of energy circulation in Huang Yueli’s meridians suddenly increased!","Not only that, but the solidified evil Qi stored in her dantian was also stimulated and instantly surged into her meridians.","Huang Yueli tried her best to infuse all the evil energy into the array.","She knew very well that at this moment, she could only advance and not retreat!","If he gave up, not only would all his previous efforts go to waste, but he would also be in danger of being devoured. He could only increase his strength and try to destroy the array formation in one fell swoop!","The sweat on Huang Yueli’s forehead increased and dripped down drop by drop, drenching the ground by her feet.","After a few dozen breaths, her persistence finally showed results. Following a slight vibration from her palm, all the array patterns on the door in front of Huang Yueli lit up instantly.","Moreover, it wasn’t as short-lived as before. This time, after the array pattern lit up, not only did it not extinguish, but it was like an infection. All the surrounding doors lit up at the same time.","In an instant, the entire corridor was illuminated as bright as day. Huang Yueli stood in the middle and her eyes were almost blinded by the light.","Fortunately, this situation did not last long.","At the same time, Huang Yueli could clearly feel that the evil energy that she had injected into the array was slowly returning back into her body.","When the array patterns were completely extinguished, not only had she retracted all the evil qi, but she also felt that her cultivation had faintly improved.","Such a feeling made Huang Yueli’s lips involuntarily curl up.","“As expected, I didn’t guess wrong...There’s still a way to break this devil expert’s formation, but it requires considerable strength. Today, I’m quite lucky.”","In fact, she was a little reckless today. Because she was in a hurry to break the array and was too confident in her own strength, she rashly injected so much evil qi and almost died here.","If she had known earlier, she should have let Li Moying in to protect her...","However, although she took the risk and ate the pill that stimulated her potential, the evil qi in her body had improved. It was a blessing in disguise for her.","Huang Yueli adjusted her breathing and opened her eyes once again to observe the situation around her.","After the illusion array was forcefully broken by her, the cave abode revealed its original appearance in front of her.","It turned out that the place she was in was not a corridor, nor were there many rooms. Instead, it was a very empty hall.","There were twelve high platforms around the hall. According to their positions, they should be where the array cores of the twelve illusion arrays were.","Apart from that, behind each platform, there was a tightly shut door. This door was completely different from the door created by the illusion just now. It was obvious that it existed.","Huang Yueli’s heart stirred as she walked towards one of the doors.","Because the Illusory Formation had been broken and she had experience in breaking formations, it didn’t take long for her to easily destroy the formations and mechanisms outside the door.","Huang Yueli pushed open the door and when she took a look, she almost felt dizzy from the shaking.","This room was actually filled with medicinal pills!","Different from the celestial race’s medicinal pills, these medicinal pills emitted dense demonic qi on the outside. Clearly, they were specially used by the fiend race.","Huang Yueli stood at the door and hesitated for a moment.."]},{"number":4502,"title":"Chapter 4502: Unexpected (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4502: Unexpected (8)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","It was her first time seeing these pills used by the fiend race.","In these two years, she had read quite a number of ancient books in the Divine Realm and already had some understanding of the fiend race’s situation.","It was said that the recovery ability of the Demon race was very strong. Even if they were seriously injured, they could recover in a few days. Therefore, the","Demon race was not as dependent on pills as the Human race and the God race.","It was precisely because of this that fiend race alchemists were very rare, and their skills were not too outstanding either. At least, they could not be compared to the god race’s spirit herb masters at all.","Before this, Huang Yueli had always agreed with the contents recorded in the ancient records. After all, this was already considered common knowledge in the Divine Realm.","However, the pills she saw today had refreshed her understanding.","Even though he had never tested the medicinal effects, just by relying on the dense aura emitted by the medicinal pill, he could clearly sense that this was definitely not an ordinary medicinal pill!","The fiend race’s medicinal pills were clearly not used to treat ordinary saber and sword wounds. What were they used for?","Huang Yueli was instantly moved.","Although she and Li Moying weren’t from the Devil Race, but the evil energy in their bodies was obviously from the same source as the Devil Qi so perhaps these pills would be beneficial to them.","However, this thought only flashed across her mind.","Very soon, Huang Yueli calmed down as she slowly took a few steps back and turned around to leave.","God knows if there were other traps around these pills. She was pressed for time now and could not waste it on these irrelevant things.","It was better to find that talisman first before considering anything else.","Huang Yueli walked around the entire hall and opened every door to take a look.","In every room, there were many rare treasures piled up. Although in terms of grade, there was still a gap between them and the collections of the Phoenix clan, it could not be helped that the treasures of the demon race were rarer!","These treasures were all things that Huang Yueli had never seen before.","However, she still remembered the purpose of her visit. Although she was tempted, she only observed it carefully and did not take anything away.","Soon, she had finished one round. She stopped and frowned.","‘ That’s strange. The Phoenix Feather Array Plate clearly pointed out that the array talisman is in this cave dwelling. I can also sense that there is a powerful secret treasure hidden in this cave dwelling. However, I have already looked through all the rooms, but I still can’t find where the array talisman is hidden...”","Not only did she not see the array talisman, but in fact, after Huang Yueli turned around, she realised that the needle on the Phoenix Feather Array Plate had actually stopped, not moving at all.","Just now, the needle had been spinning with all its might, which meant that the artifact was nearby.","And now, the needle had stopped...","Could it be that the formation talisman was not in the cave abode again?","However, in such a short period of time, the talisman would not disappear for no reason. If there was a teleportation array in the cave, she should be able to sense the changes in the Xuan Qi of heaven and earth.","Huang Yueli couldn’t understand at that moment.","She frowned and pondered for a while, carefully observing the layout and decorations around the hall. She pinched her fingers and kept calculating.","At this moment, she suddenly felt the ground beneath her feet tremble. The vibration was very subtle, as if a child had jumped not far away.","However, the hall was too quiet, and the tremors were too obvious. Huang Yueli suddenly thought of something as her expression changed.."]},{"number":4503,"title":"Chapter 4503: Unexpected (9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4503: Unexpected (9)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Before Huang Yueli could react, the ground started to shake violently.","With an explosive sound, the ground paved with the Glazed Cloud Spirit Rock suddenly split open from the middle and into two halves.","In an instant, countless dust sprayed out as her feet kept shaking. Even Huang Yueli couldn’t maintain her balance as she stretched out her hand to support","herself against the wall, barely managing to stand and not fall onto the ground.","She knew that something was wrong and quickly turned her head. She saw that behind the gray air, there was a bottomless ravine under the split floor. It seemed to be a passage that led to somewhere unknown.","There was another space beneath the ground!","Huang Yueli frowned. Just as she was unsure if she should go forward to investigate, she heard a loud shout from underground: ” Where did this little thief come from? How dare he barge into this Overlord’s cave dwelling? Are you courting death?”","Hearing this voice, Huang Yueli was shocked.","Because this was the voice of the Demon Lord, Pill Light Region Lord Rui Jiang!","‘ Damn it, why is Ruijiang here?!”","Huang Yueli drew in a breath of cold air and in an instant, she understood.","Now that he thought about it, it really couldn’t be more normal for Rui Jiang to appear in this cave abode!","As a relic left behind by a senior expert of the demon race, this cave abode was filled with demonic qi and a large number of cultivation resources. For a demon race like Rui Jiang, it was definitely an excellent place for cultivation.","Even if Rui Jiang didn’t have Huang Yueli’s innate talent in array skills and couldn’t open all the rooms to retrieve the treasures, but as long as he could cultivate in the cave dwelling, he would be able to advance rapidly.","If the cave abode was only used as a warehouse to store talismans, then it would be a reckless waste of heavenly resources.","It was her and Li Moying who had not thought it through, hence they had overlooked this possibility.","Huang Yueli’s thoughts spun like lightning and in a short few breaths, she had figured out the entire sequence of events. At the same time, she immediately turned around and fled in the direction of the secret passage.","She had to make use of the time before Rui Jiang appeared and caught up to her to quickly meet up with Li Moying.","Although Huang Yueli was resolute and fearless, but she wouldn’t be blindly confident in her own abilities.","After all, she was only at the peak of the Heart Profound Realm. Even if her combat ability was several times higher than the Shen clan of the same realm, the possibility of her winning against Rui Jiang, who was at the peak of the Heavenly Demon Realm, was very slim. After all, the difference between the two of them was an entire major realm!","Moreover, Rui Jiang still had that heaven-defying array talisman!","Fighting against such a Rui Jiang alone was simply courting death, and he didn’t even dare to think about formations.","It seemed that he was doomed to not be able to obtain this talisman. After tonight, Auspicious River’s defenses would be even tighter, and it would be even more difficult to obtain the talisman.","Huang Yueli sighed inwardly as her speed increased.","Because she could already clearly feel the demonic energy gathering rapidly in the air, and Rui Jiang’s furious roar was getting closer and closer to her.","“Little thief, you still dare to run? Stop right there! Did you hear that? Hehe, still running? Let me tell you, this cave abode is under my control. You can’t escape. Since you dare to come in, you’re destined to die here today!”","Huang Yueli wasn’t disturbed at all as she turned a deaf ear to Rui Jiang’s words as she gathered a mouthful of Profound Energy and ran wildly outside.","However, just as she was one step away from the secret passage, something unexpected happened!"]},{"number":4504,"title":"Chapter 4504: Unexpected (10)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4504: Unexpected (10)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The surrounding walls suddenly burst out with a golden light. The dazzling light pierced Huang Yueli’s eyes.","After the golden light dissipated, the wall was revealed again.","“I... F * Ck you!”","Huang Yueli took a closer look and almost cursed out loud on the spot.","The entire hall disappeared in an instant, and the surrounding environment returned to how it was before she broke the array. On the long corridor, countless identical doors appeared in front of her.","He didn’t know how Rui Jiang did it, but he actually reactivated the illusion array in the cave abode in a moment.","Of course, Huang Yueli was very clear that this illusion array had just been forcefully broken by her. Even if Auspicious River could be reactivated in a hurry, the illusion array itself was still very unstable.","She only needed to exert a little strength and she could easily break it without having to expend as much effort as before.","However, the problem was that Rui Jiang was chasing after her closely. If she stopped, she would be seriously injured by Rui Jiang. She had no time to break the array.","“Damn it! The demons are truly sinister and cunning!”","Seeing that she was about to crash into the wall if she continued running forward, Huang Yueli didn’t dare to force her way in. She could only forcefully turn a corner and ran wildly along the corridor.","Rui Jiang was still following closely behind her, laughing arrogantly, ” Little thief, you still want to run? Stop right there! In this illusion array, it was impossible for you to escape! Kneel down and beg for mercy earlier, and I’ll give you a quick death! Otherwise...”","Rui Jiang’s words carried the pressure of a Heavenly Demon, and he was incomparably powerful. If it was an ordinary demon, their legs would probably go weak under the influence of his aura.","However, Huang Yueli wasn’t affected at all as she curled her lips into a smile,” Rui Jiang, don’t be too confident with your big talk. Want to catch up with me...","You? You’re still far from it!”","Rui Jiang had been in a position of power for a long time. How many years had it been since he was ridiculed like this? He was so angry that his face turned green. You’re courting death!”","As he roared, the demonic energy in his body erupted.","Evidently, Rui Jiang had already lost his patience and didn’t want to waste too much time on a little thief who had barged in so he didn’t hold back any longer and instead used all his strength to increase his speed, preparing to take down Huang Yueli in one go.","The demon race’s martial arts techniques were not too profound, but the demon race’s physical strength was outstanding. Under full stimulation, Rui Jiang’s speed doubled in an instant.","His figure was like a whirlwind as he pounced towards Huang Yueli’s back.","Seeing that he was only a few feet away from capturing the thief in front of him, a disdainful sneer flashed across Rui Jiang’s eyes.","However, he never expected that his all-out grab would end up in vain.","A few breaths ago, Huang Yueli who was not too far away from him had disappeared from his sight in an instant. When she reappeared, she was already tens of metres away.","Rui Jiang was stunned for a moment. After a long while, he suddenly reacted, and his expression became extremely gloomy.","“This is...The Celestial Race’s mystic skill, Flash Escape! It’s impossible to do it with the demonic qi of the demons. You... You’re not a demon, but... It was a god race!","Damn it, you actually disguised yourself as a demon, even I couldn’t tell!” Huang Yueli stood not far away as she smiled at him,” You just found out? You can’t even tell what race I’m from.. The legendary Heavenly Demon Stage powerhouses are only so-so!”"]},{"number":4505,"title":"Chapter 4505: Who said...l’m running?(l)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4505: Who said...l’m running?(l)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Ruijiang was already very angry when she realized that she had mistook the other party’s identity and missed her attack.","In the end, Huang Yueli was not afraid of death and added fuel to the fire, which made him so angry that he almost exploded on the spot.","Rui Jiang glared angrily at Huang Yueli as his face flushed red as he shouted out in exasperation: ” Little thief, you’ve simply eaten the guts of a bear or a leopard. Do you really think that your disguising skills are so good and you can run a little faster that this Overlord can’t do anything to you? I’ll let you know the strength of a late-stage Skyfiend now!”","Rui Jiang roared angrily and suddenly stopped. He stood still. After a while, his body suddenly emitted a crackling sound.","A black demonic aura emanated from his body, enveloping him in the middle.","The demonic aura became denser and denser and from where Huang Yueli was standing, she couldn’t even see Rui Jiang’s figure clearly.","Seeing this scene, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but shiver.","She had seen this kind of cultivation technique that Rui Jiang used before.","This was the Devil Race cultivation technique that Huang Sanbai had given to the peerless genius of the Sacred Phoenix Race, Huang Beicheng, during the finals of the Divine Realm’s Martial Competition.","At that time, Huang Sanbai was afraid that his scheme would be exposed and wanted Huang Beicheng to kill Huang Yueli on the stage. But he was also worried that Huang Beicheng’s strength wasn’t enough so he tricked him into cultivating the devil race’s cultivation method to stimulate his own potential.","Therefore, Huang Beicheng was almost killed by Huang Sanbai on the spot.","However, for a powerhouse at the peak of the Heavenly Demon Realm like Rui Jiang, although this kind of explosive cultivation technique was harmful to the body, it was not unbearable.","The strength of the demonic aura on his body rose rapidly. Soon, the entire hall was filled with a scorching and violent aura.","Huang Yueli’s expression turned solemn.","Although she had deliberately provoked Rui Jiang, she had not expected Rui Jiang to be so powerful after activating his cultivation technique.","In order to kill a tiny Heart Profound Realm god like her, he actually used such a trump card.","How angry was he?","Why were the demons so petty?","She had only ridiculed him a little and did not even use half of her usual strength. Was there a need for him to be so angry?","Huang Yueli ridiculed in her heart but she didn’t dare to be negligent as she swiftly mobilized all the Profound Energy in her body, fully alert.","She didn’t dare to be careless. In this situation, if she was even the slightest bit careless, she might backfire and fall here!","The process of Rui Jiang activating the cultivation technique was very short. In less than ten breaths, he suddenly opened his eyes.","In the thick black fog formed by demonic Qi, two red lights were emitted from his eyes. They were filled with a bloody aura, making people feel intimidated.","“Damned God Race thief, hand over your life!”","Rui Jiang suddenly stomped his foot and smashed heavily onto the ground.","Following his furious roar, Rui Jiang struck out with his palm and the devil qi that had been raised to its peak surged towards Huang Yueli.","That wild aura and speed far surpassed before.","Even though Huang Yueli had already hidden herself in the furthest corner of the Rui River, she was still caught by the strong and fierce breath, her face felt as though it had been cut by a knife.","Rui Jiang’s attack came very quickly but fortunately Huang Yueli’s speed was even faster.","Her body swayed and she dodged in a split second.."]},{"number":4506,"title":"Chapter 4506: Who said... I’m running away?(2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4506: Who said... I’m running away?(2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Rui Jiang had totally not expected that he had already burst out with such strength, but he still wasn’t able to hit Huang Yueli.","Under the shock and surprise, his expression turned even uglier. Without saying a word, he followed closely behind Huang Yueli and struck out another palm strike.","Huang Yueli’s slender and petite body swayed slightly as she dodged it again.","Rui Jiang was so angry that her face turned pale. She waved her hands and chased after her.","The two of them ran back and forth in the hall.","Although the hall was not small, the two of them were too fast. In just a few blinks of the eye, they could circle the entire hall.","If someone was present, they would probably only be able to see two figures vaguely flashing in the middle of a dense black fog. And every time they flashed, the two people’s positions were far from their original positions, enough to dazzle people.","The chase didn’t last long, but Rui Jiang was so angry that he was about to explode.","Because Huang Yueli’s speed didn’t seem to be very fast and was much weaker than his. But the movement technique she used was really too strange. Every time he almost attacked Huang Yueli’s body, but every time he brushed past her.","Once or twice, it could still be said to be a coincidence but after the number of times, Rui Jiang seriously suspected that Huang Yueli was simply toying with him!","The more Rui Jiang’s anger rose, the more demonic qi condensed on his body.","“Damned thief, stop right there! Where do you want to run to? Let me tell you, no matter how fast you run, don’t even think about escaping from here. When you run out of strength, won’t you still be caught by me? When you fall into my hands...Haha.”","Rui Jiang’s blood-red eyes were filled with a cold light.” Just nice, I’ve been stuck at the peak of the Heavenly Demon Realm for many years. You’re not old, but your strength is not bad. You must be a top genius of the God Race. If I can refine you into a Blood Pill, it might really help me break through the bottleneck of many years and advance to the Demon King!”","Rui Jiang couldn’t help but lick her dry lips after she finished speaking. Her face was filled with desire.","The fiend race had always had the tradition of using the celestial race’s powerhouses to sacrifice and refine blood pills. This kind of blood pill was definitely a great tonic for the fiend race.","Back then when Huang Yueli and Li Moying were in the alliance army, they had seen the Heavenly Devil refining blood pills and the process was extremely cruel.","Up till now, Huang Yueli could still clearly recall the miserable shrieks that came from those pill furnaces.","Hearing this, her heart seemed to waver and her footsteps slowed down.","Rui Jiang’s original intention of saying these words was to disturb Huang Yueli’s emotions. Now that he had achieved his goal, he was instantly delighted as he hurriedly seized the opportunity to gather all the demonic qi in his body and suddenly swept towards Huang Yueli’s direction!","Huang Yueli’s hesitation only lasted for a breath or two but in a showdown between top notch experts, such a short period of time was enough to be fatal.","Thick and surging demonic qi gushed out wildly and was about to collide with Huang Yueli’s back.","Rui Jiang had even started to imagine in his heart how many benefits he would obtain after he controlled Huang Yueli’s divine soul and refined her into a blood pill.","But who knew that in the next moment, he realized that something was wrong.","His aggressive attack had indeed hit something, but it did not seem like a body of flesh and blood at all. Instead, it seemed like...."]},{"number":4507,"title":"Chapter 4507: Who said... I’m running?(3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4507: Who said... I’m running?(3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Kerala...","A sharp and ear-piercing sound rang out, and the ground shook. Countless dust fell from the sky.","The dense black demonic Qi in the hall had also dissipated a lot.","Upon hearing such a sound, Rui Jiang’s heart tightened and he quickly looked up.","The illusion array that originally showed the endless corridor gradually dissipated, and the illusions of the doors dissipated one by one, revealing the real environment that was covered by the array.","These incomparably complicated 12 illusionary formations were actually broken in an instant!","Rui Jiang was a little unable to react for a moment. She stood rooted to the ground with a dumbfounded expression, not knowing why such a situation had occurred.","He had clearly reactivated the array earlier and moreover Huang Yueli had been fleeing everywhere from his pursuit so she had no time to break the array.","Right at this moment, a young girl’s crisp laughter rang out from not far away.","“Lord Rui Jiang, thank you very much. If it weren’t for your help, it wouldn’t have been so easy for me to crack this array with my meager cultivation! Thank you so much!”","He finally realized why Huang Yueli had been bringing him around in circles in the main hall earlier.","It wasn’t that she was stupid and knew that she couldn’t dodge it, but that she was using the demonic qi in his body to attack the illusion array.","She had provoked Ruijiang not because she was quick with her words, but because she wanted to use this method to force Ruijiang to unleash even more power.","The facts proved that Huang Yueli’s scheme was really effective.","Rui Jiang’s final attack was as powerful as a rainbow. He used almost all the demonic qi in his body and smashed right into the weakest point of the illusion array. The entire array collapsed with a bang!","And this...lt was all within Huang Yueli’s calculations!","Thinking of this, besides shock, Rui Jiang’s heart was filled with fear and horror!","To be able to do this, it meant that the little thief in front of her had extremely high attainments in array techniques. Otherwise, she would not have known where the weakness of the array was. It would be impossible to use him.","Where did this monster come from?","Not only did his strength reach the top level among the younger generation of martial artists, but he was also able to crack the array of a demon powerhouse. In the end, he was so sinister and cunning that he played with a peerless powerhouse at the peak of the Heavenly Demon Realm!","If such a genius was allowed to grow, who knew how many losses the fiend race would suffer in the future!","At the thought of this, Rui Jiang’s gaze instantly became even sharper, and the killing intent in his heart became even more determined.","Such a monster...He absolutely could not leave her alive. He had to kill her before she grew up!","“Little thief, stop right there! Do you think that I can’t do anything to you just because you broke the illusion array and escaped from the cave abode? Let me tell you, you’re dead for sure today. This day next year will be your death anniversary! Don’t run if you have the guts!”","Rui Jiang followed closely behind Huang Yueli as he roared in rage.","He was worried that Huang Yueli would use some tricks to escape so he was pondering if he should think of a way to contact the camp so that the army could send people to encircle and suppress this little thief.","Who knew that Huang Yueli’s figure flashed and after she ran out of the cave dwelling from the secret passage, she didn’t flee in a hurry as he had expected. Instead, her footsteps paused and she stopped.","She turned around and smiled..” Who said...” Am I going to run?”"]},{"number":4508,"title":"Chapter 4508: Who said... I’m running?(4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4508: Who said... I’m running?(4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Rui Jiang didn’t expect to hear such words. After being stunned for a moment, she sneered again.” Oh? Not running? Were they waiting to die? If you have the ability, stay there and don’t...”","Before he could finish, he suddenly stopped.","A tall and straight figure had unknowingly appeared behind Huang Yueli.","It was a handsome young man from the Protoss race. His facial features were as perfect as a sculpture, and there were no flaws to be found. However, his pitch-black eyes gave Rui Jiang the illusion that he had seen him somewhere before.","Rui Jiang didn’t have time to think about it when he suddenly felt a hint of warning.","A powerful energy fluctuation suddenly erupted from the young man’s body. Following his movement, an explosive sound came from the sky. A bolt of lightning tore through the pitch-black night and suddenly struck down.","And Huang Yueli also had a tacit understanding with the other party. The moment she saw Li Moying making his move, she turned around and turned from defense to offense. Blazing flames soared into the sky, forming the shape of a pair of wings as they swept towards Rui Jiang body!","This sudden attack was too sudden. Rui Jiang was stunned for a moment and was almost hit.","Fortunately, he was an expert at the peak of the Heavenly Demon Realm after all. At this critical moment, he could still react in time and dodge in a hurry.","However, it was already too late to completely dodge the attack at this time. Rui Jiang could only condense the demonic qi around his body to form a barrier and forcefully withstand the attack of this young man and woman.","Three different energies converged in the air and collided heavily. The resulting energy fluctuations almost flattened all the buildings and trees within a radius of several kilometers.","Ruijiang felt a huge shock in his chest and was completely unable to maintain his balance. He was hit by two huge forces at the same time, and his body was suddenly sent flying.","He flew a few hundred meters before crashing into the ground, creating a human-shaped pit that was half a meter deep.","“Cough, cough, cough! Damn it! You Protoss bastards...Damn it!”","Ruijiang had suffered a heavy blow. Coupled with the impact of the fall, his internal organs seemed to have been shattered. There was not a single part of his body that did not hurt.","However, to Ruijiang, the physical pain was a small matter. The mental trauma was a hundred times more serious!","He couldn’t believe that he, a demon powerhouse at the peak of the Heavenly Demon Realm, was actually injured by two little Protoss fellows who seemed to be underage. Moreover, his injuries were not light, and he fell to the ground in such a sorry state!","Fortunately, they were in a secret mystic realm and no one saw them. Otherwise, from today onwards, he would never have the face to see anyone again!","“Damned little thief, I will definitely tear all of you into pieces...No, that’s not right. I’ll refine both of you into blood pills! That’s right, I’ll refine all of you into blood pills, and I’ll also refine your souls so that you won’t be able to reincarnate forever for me to command!”","He endured the pain and jumped out of the hole.","After losing so much face, the only thought in his mind was to kill the two Gods Race geniuses who had injured him and make them die miserably!","Otherwise, it would be difficult for him to dispel the anger in his heart!","Ruijiang was afraid that the two of them would run away after the attack, so she chased after them impatiently.","However, when he jumped up to take a look, he realized that the two of them did not run at all. They were still standing there waiting.."]},{"number":4509,"title":"Chapter 4509: Who said... I’m running?(5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4509: Who said... I’m running?(5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Moreover, the tall and handsome young man of the God Clan was holding the hand of the girl of the God Clan and staring at her with displeasure. The girl glanced at him guiltily, then smiled at him fawningly.","These two...She actually started flirtinz!","They simply treated him, a peak Heavenly Demon expert, as if he was nothing!","‘ Stop right there!” Rui Jiang was even more agitated by this scene. He was so angry that his face turned red. He roared,” You adulterous couple! Stop right there!” Then, he charged at the two of them.","When Huang Yueli entered the cave dwelling, she assured her husband that there would definitely not be any problems so she persuaded Li Moying to stay outside to keep watch.","In the end, he brought Rui Jiang and escaped from the cave.","This was too much of a slap in the face.","Furthermore, Li Moying hated to see her putting herself in danger the most and he would definitely be unhappy.","As expected, after Li Moying appeared and sent Rui Jiang flying with her, he immediately gave a cold snort and acted tsundere.","Huang Yueli had no choice but to leave her husband behind as she gave Rui Jiang a mocking smile,” How many times have I said that I don’t want to escape so why do you keep telling me to stop? Don’t tell me you want to escape but are too embarrassed to say it?”","“You... Damned little thief, how could this lord think of running away? I will refine all of you into blood pills!”","The demonic qi around Rui Jiang gushed out wildly and attacked the two of them fiercely.","Li Moying gave a light sneer as he pushed Huang Yueli to the side,” Move aside a little, I’ll deal with this devil first before I go back to settle the score with you!”","He waved his long sleeves, and the violent thunder attribute energy condensed into a light screen in an instant, blocking Rui Jiang’s demonic qi outside.","The energy of both sides collided again.","This time, Rui Jiang was prepared. He did not fall like before, but he did not gain any advantage either!","Rui Jiang was shocked.","Earlier when he suffered a loss in Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s hands, he could still say that it was the other party’s sneak attack and he didn’t defend in time which resulted in him falling into the other party’s black hand. Furthermore, Li Moying and Huang Yueli joined hands and it was two against one so his loss could be explained.","But now, the only one who received the blow was Li Moying alone!","The two of them were still facing each other head-on!","Under such circumstances, the other party actually successfully received a move from him, a peak Heavenly Demon Realm powerhouse!","What kind of strength was this?","To put it nicely, the Protoss man in front of him was a youth. In fact, in terms of bone age, he could only be considered a youth in the Protoss. He actually had such strength!","In addition to that little girl who had an astonishingly fast movement technique and a terrifyingly deep scheming mind...","The geniuses of the god clan were actually so terrifying? Moreover, there was not only one such genius, but also a couple of them?","No, these two must not be left alive!","Thinking of this, the killing intent in Rui Jiang’s heart reached an extreme. He steeled his heart and directly took out a small golden token from his pocket.","Huang Yueli fixed her eyes on it and almost cried out,” This...ls this the talisman formation used by the demons in battle?”","When Rui Jiang heard this, he sneered.” Tsk tsk, that little thief has good taste. He actually knows that this is an array talisman!” You came for this talisman, right? That’s good, this lord will let you all experience the power of the formation talisman. This way, your deaths won’t be in vain..”"]},{"number":4510,"title":"Chapter 4510: Who said...l’m running?(6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4510: Who said...l’m running?(6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","As Rui Jiang said that, his wrist moved slightly and his fingers quickly slid across the array talisman, drawing out an array pattern that Huang Yueli had never seen before.","Under the activation of the array pattern formed by the demonic qi, the array talisman suddenly shook and emitted a violent buzzing sound.","At the same time, this small talisman was wrapped in a layer of dazzling golden light.","This golden light began to spread in the blink of an eye, enveloping Rui Jiang’s entire body.","In this short few breaths, Huang Yueli and Li Moying could clearly feel that Rui Jiang’s aura was rising rapidly and the devil aura in his body was also rising crazily.","The extent of this improvement had long surpassed the influence of the array talisman on the demon army in battle.","Ordinary demon soldiers could only increase their strength by 20 to 30 percent at most, but the demonic qi in Rui Jiang’s body had already soared several times, and it was still increasing!","At the moment when Rui Jiang activated the array talisman, Huang Yueli had already sensed that something was wrong and immediately flicked her finger, shooting out a fire arrow, wanting to interrupt Rui Jiang’s hand seals.","However, it was already too late for her to react.","Rui Jiang’s technique had obviously been practiced countless times. He was actually able to complete such a complicated formation pattern in half a breath.","If it wasn’t for Li Moying grabbing her clothes by her waist in time and pulling her to the side, she might have suffered a backlash!","Having missed the best opportunity to interrupt, Huang Yueli and Li Moying could only watch helplessly as Rui Jiang rapidly grew stronger. Furthermore, this kind of strength wasn’t just the change in the aura within her body, even Rui Jiang’s external appearance was also changing!","His height was slowly growing at a speed visible to the naked eye, and his originally handsome facial features seemed to have been refined even more exquisite in the golden light.","“Not good! Could it be that Rui Jiang was about to break through to the Demon King Realm? How is that possible?” Huang Yueli suddenly reacted as she exclaimed.","She had never seen the advancement of the demon race with her own eyes, but she had read about it in ancient books.","The strength and appearance of the mo corresponded to each other.","The stronger the mo, the more perfect their appearance would be.","And every time the fiend race advanced a realm, their appearance would also undergo a corresponding change.","Looking at Ruijiang’s appearance...Huang Yueli immediately matched the scene in front of her with what she had seen in the ancient records.","“This must be the work of that formation talisman! This formation talisman is really too strange. I was already shocked when I saw that it could increase the strength of an entire army. I didn’t expect that the formation engraved on the formation talisman would actually have such a terrifying increase when used on a person!” Li Moying’s brows furrowed together.","“What is it? Is this the power of a talisman?” Huang Yueli drew in a breath of cold air.","But the moment she spoke, she had already realised that what Li Moying said was right.","However, wasn’t this a little too exaggerated?","There were many cultivation methods and medicinal pills in the Divine World that could temporarily increase a martial artist’s strength. However, it was already very exaggerated to be able to increase a martial artist’s strength by one fold at most.","However, the current Rui Jiang’s strength had more than doubled. He was already about to advance!","The Devil King Realm of the Devil Race was equivalent to the Life Profound Realm of the Celestials.. It was the most difficult hurdle!"]},{"number":4511,"title":"Chapter 4511: Live and die together (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4511: Live and die together (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","To 99% of the Skyfiends, the Demon King Realm was a realm that they had pursued their entire lives but could not reach.","Although Rui Jiang was at the peak of the Heavenly Demon Realm and seemed to be only one step away from the Demon King Realm, it was very likely that he would not be able to cross this short step even if he delayed it for a thousand years.","History had already proven that countless Heavenly Demon Realm powerhouses had passed away sadly with the regret of not being able to break through.","Of course, this was also not a bottleneck unique to fiend race martial artists. The probability of the Dao Profound Realm powerhouses of the Celestials being able to break through to the Life Profound Realm was also only one in ten","thousand.","Under such circumstances, Rui Jiang was actually able to break through this natural barrier and enter the Demon King Realm in one fell swoop just by activating the array patterns on the array talisman?","Even if this power was only temporary, it was still shocking enough.","It wasn’t that Huang Yueli hadn’t considered the possibility of Rui Jiang using the array talisman to raise his strength but even in her wildest dreams, she had never imagined that Rui Jiang could raise his strength to such an extent!","This time, wouldn’t she and Li Moying be in trouble?","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment and immediately realised that they definitely couldn’t defeat Rui Jiang so they could only run away quickly.","But Li Moying’s reaction was faster than hers. Before she could make a sound, the man beside her had already grabbed her wrist and tossed her backwards.","Li Moying’s words were exactly the same as her thoughts.","But after Huang Yueli was thrown out by him, her expression changed drastically as she immediately shouted out,” Li Moying, you...” What are you trying to do?”","Li Moying flung her away at the first possible moment but he didn’t follow closely behind to escape, but instead, he stood between Huang Yueli and Rui Jiang.","The aura on his body increased rapidly. Powerful and violent lightning power gathered from all directions in an instant, forming a lightning domain that flickered with light on his body.","“Clang..] ”","The long sword in Li Moying’s hand was suddenly unsheathed as the bright as autumn water sword reflected the lightning, reflecting a blue purple light.","He wanted to use his own body to stop Rui Jiang from pursuing Huang Yueli!","“Li Moying, you’re crazy! If you want to fight, then fight together. Why did you chase me away?","Huang Yueli somersaulted a few times in the air before she landed on the ground.","Earlier when she was completely unprepared, Li Moying directly sealed her pulse and threw her out.","She was thrown several miles away.","The moment Huang Yueli landed, she immediately wanted to run back to support Li Moying.","However, after she turned around and ran for a few steps, she felt as if a huge stone was pressing down on her chest. It was suffocating.","Moreover, the pressure was getting heavier and heavier. With every step she took, the depression in her chest became heavier. Before she had walked 200 meters, she felt that she could not breathe and almost fell to the ground.","“I... Go! Damn it!”","Huang Yueli managed to support her body with great difficulty and relied on her extraordinary willpower to barely stand firm.","Even she could not help but curse.","Li Moying controlled her pulse and sealed the majority of her Profound Energy, especially the aura in her dantian.","Losing this portion of Profound Energy, her own pressure quickly dissipated and along with it, she found it hard to withstand the pressure of others.."]},{"number":4512,"title":"Chapter 4512: Live and die together (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4512: Live and die together (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","In order to fight against Rui Jiang, Li Moying’s aura suddenly burst out and in addition to the thunder attribute which was known for its explosive nature.","She was standing so far away but she was unable to withstand this kind of pressure, let alone taking a step forward, walking to the center of the lightning attribute storm to pull Li Moying out.","‘ Didn’t you say that my loyal dog husband would listen to me?!” Huang Yueli’s face flushed red.","On one hand, it was because of this powerful pressure, and on the other hand, it was because of Li Moying’s anger!","It was obvious that Li Moying had noticed that Rui Jiang’s strength had increased by a huge margin and it was still increasing continuously until now. He realised that even if the two of them were to escape immediately, it would most likely be disastrous.","In order to protect her and allow her to successfully escape, Li Moying had decided to sacrifice himself to give her enough time to escape.","From the time they were in Soaring Heavens Continent, this man was like this. Even if there was only a sliver of hope, he would choose to protect her without the slightest hesitation. He didn’t care about what he would become and also didn’t care about how she would feel when she saw the man she loved die for her...","Ever since the two of them had ascended to the Divine Realm, Huang Yueli had already properly educated her husband, telling him that she didn’t need him to sacrifice himself like this. If he died, she wouldn’t be able to live alone!","Li Moying agreed very well at that time.","However, at the critical moment, when she really encountered danger, this man would instinctively choose to stand in front of her...","She knew that now wasn’t the time to be touched but she had to immediately think of a way to support Li Moying.","No matter how talented Li Moying was, he was merely a Heart Profound Realm practitioner. Crossing a major realm to face off against a late stage Heavenly Devil Devil was already almost impossible to succeed, let alone facing Rui Jiang who had temporarily entered the Devil King Realm?","It was very likely that he would die here!","On one hand, Huang Yueli gritted her teeth and endured the discomfort in her chest as she moved forward. On the other hand, she tried her best to mobilize the Profound Energy in her body, wanting to break through the restriction left behind by Li Moying.","Originally, this kind of unique restriction technique was almost impossible to break through.","The two of them often cultivated together and the Profound Energy in their bodies came from the same source. It was not difficult to break the restriction, but the problem was...lt would still take a certain amount of time!","Whereas the showdown between Li Moying and Rui Jiang was about to start! The speed at which the demonic qi in Rui Jiang’s body increased slowed down after he advanced to the Demon King Realm.","He felt a powerful force penetrating his body and could not help but let out a long laugh!","The feeling of entering the devil king realm was too good. It was completely different from the late-stage heavenly demon realm. That feeling was as if everything around him was under his control.","Rui Jiang had also noticed that the two Protoss little fellows in front of him had already run away. Only the young man was left in front of him, and the other party was quickly gathering the energy in the surroundings.","But Rui Jiang didn’t have any intention of interrupting Li Moying.","From his point of view, after he had advanced into the Devil King Realm, he was already an invincible existence on this battlefield. Wouldn’t squashing Li Moying to death be the same as squashing an ant?","An ant struggling before its death, was there a need for him to be on guard?","At most, it would be a circus.."]},{"number":4513,"title":"Chapter 4513: Live and die together (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4513: Live and die together (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","It was until Li Moying’s accumulation was almost complete that Rui Jiang spoke lazily with a mocking tone,” What’s wrong? Little brat of the god race, is this all you can do? Do you think you can protect your little lover? Do you want some more time?”","If it was in Soaring Heavens Continent or Cloudy Qilin Continent, if anyone dared to speak to Young Master Li like this, they would have long been dead souls under Li Moying’s sword.","But at such a moment, facing the mockery of a powerful Devil King Realm opponent, Li Moying appeared exceptionally calm as his expression didn’t change at all. His thin lips were pursed slightly and he didn’t say a single word.","He knew that he had no time to waste.","He could only grab hold of every breath of time to complete his Storing Power so that he would have a chance to protect his Li ‘er.","Rui Jiang casually said a few words. He originally wanted to see this god clan genius’s enraged appearance to find some fun. Who knew that the other party actually did not get distracted at all and was unexpectedly calm.","This made Rui Jiang unhappy.","‘ Damned little bastard, how dare you ignore me!”","Rui Jiang sneered and raised his right hand again.","Surging demonic qi once again gushed towards Li Moying.","Huang Yueli was still trying to break through the restriction in her body as she used all her strength to move towards Li Moying’s direction.","The moment she saw the black smoke, her heart almost stopped beating.","Ruijiang... He was too strong!","It was so strong that Huang Yueli couldn’t help but feel helpless.","However, she couldn’t do anything now as she could only watch helplessly as Li Moying’s figure was swept into that black aura.","Li Moying’s eyes flashed slightly but he didn’t retreat or dodge, instead taking Rui Jiang’s attack head-on as he charged forward.","Right the moment before Rui Jiang attacked, he successfully completed accumulating power. The profound energy in his body soared to peak Heart","Profound Realm. Just a little more and he could buy into Dao Profound Realm.","This explosive thunder attributed Profound Energy was instantly compressed into a bolt of lightning by Li Moying’s unique cultivation method, as it shot straight towards Rui Jiang’s chest!","Compared to Li Moying’s usual shocking might of heavenly lightning which could destroy the heavens and shake the earth, this lightning bolt was too thin and small, too inconspicuous.","If it was any other practitioner with a lower cultivation, they would probably think that Li Moying’s willpower had completely collapsed and lost the ability to resist under Rui Jiang’s powerful pressure.","However, Rui Jiang’s expression changed slightly.” Merely a Heart Profound Realm brat, and he’s actually able to comprehend lightning concept to such an extent! To be able to condense the power of the heavenly lightning into such purity! If you were to cultivate for a few more years, you might be able to kill a Demon King Realm expert. Unfortunately, you’re still too young!”","From the Intent Profound Realm to the Heart Profound Realm, it was a process of releasing the Profound Energy in one’s body. Through one’s own Profound Energy, one could draw in the Profound Energy between heaven and earth. The more one drew, the more powerful it would be.","But after reaching Dao Profound Realm, continuing to cultivate became a process of condensing toward the inside.","The practitioner no longer paid attention to the amount of Profound Energy, but instead focused on the purity of the Profound Energy.","A little bit of pure power was enough to kill people.","Except, the process of entering was harder than exiting. Many practitioners who had reached Dao Profound Realm Peak were unable to condense their own Profound Energy to Li Moying’s level.","As for Li Moying...He was only at the Profound Heart Realm and was so young, so how could he have done it?"]},{"number":4514,"title":"Chapter 4514: Live and die together (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4514: Live and die together (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Rui Jiang put aside some of his contempt, but still did not take it too seriously. After all, the gap between the two sides was too great.","At this moment, no matter how high Li Moying’s innate talent was, he could only become a dead soul under his demonic aura.","The almost undetectable purple lightning shot out at an extremely high speed. It was like a sharp needle piercing the depths of the black mist. In the blink of an eye, it had already pierced Rui Jiang’s chest.","However, not only was Rui Jiang not nervous, he even smiled faintly.","He slowly raised his hand and was about to wipe the lightning away so that the two little gods could feel the power of the Devil Overlord Realm.","But before he could touch the lightning, his expression changed. “Not good!” He cried out.","Following Rui Jiang’s low growl, Huang Yueli, who was a few thousand metres away, also saw the changes in the middle of the black mist.","The thin, thread-like condensed lightning suddenly split into two after trembling slightly. Then two became four and then eight...","The lightning split at an extremely high speed. In the blink of an eye, it had already formed an entire lightning field that completely covered Rui Jiang’s chest.","He hastily mobilised his devil qi and tried to block the extremely sharp lightning from outside his body.","Rui Jiang’s current level of cultivation was at the Devil Overlord Realm, and his speed was unimaginably fast. Even though Li Moying’s lightning speed was already celestial enough, Rui Jiang still managed to retract some of his Devil Qi in time, forming a protective shield in front of him.","This time... He was safe!","Before Rui Jiang could finish exhaling, a chill suddenly rose from his back.","A purple light shadow with a low roar that shook the world leapt towards his back. Its sharp claws reflected the lightning and suddenly grabbed his head!","Rui Jiang’s body trembled, but he instinctively sensed danger.","He quickly turned around to see a huge Qilin Divine Beast appear behind him. The scales on its body emitted a dark blue cold light under the illumination of the lightning, and its power was shocking.","“Qi... Qilin? Where did this Qilin come from? Wasn’t it said that the Divine Beasts of the Twelve Continents of the Divine World were already extinct?","This... ”","Where did it come from? That child... Who is it from the Cloudy Qilin Clan?","Rui Jiang was shocked, but he didn’t have time to think about it.","In the situation of being attacked from both sides, he could only forcefully disperse the limited devil qi and defend against attacks from both sides. But this way, the defensive effect would be greatly reduced.","Rui Jiang thought that the attack from the divine beast behind him would be more dangerous, so when he defended, he used a lot of demonic energy on the shield behind him.","However, reality proved him wrong.","The earth-shattering claw of Qilin’s divine beast seemed indestructible, but it immediately let out a scream of pain when its claw came in contact with the devil qi.","Although it still left a claw mark on Rui Jiang’s back, the little Qilin quickly retracted its claw the next moment.","There were faint traces of corrosion and burns on her claws.","The Devil Overlord Realm’s devil qi actually had such a strong corrosive power against divine beasts!","However, Rui Jiang couldn’t rejoice because on the other side, Li Moying’s lightning had also passed by his chest!","“Ughhh-!”","Rui Jiang suddenly let out a muffled grunt and looked at his chest in disbelief.","The lightning was like a sharp blade, cutting through the devil qi barrier in front of his chest and stabbed straight into his chest!"]},{"number":4515,"title":"Chapter 4515: Live and die together (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4515: Live and die together (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Rui Jiang felt a sharp pain followed by an indescribable numbness.","For a moment, he couldn’t even feel the flow of Devil Qi in his meridians, as if his senses had been numbed by Li Moying’s lightning.","Rui Jiang’s expression changed to one of shock as he hastily pressed the Devil Qi in his body with all his might, enduring the pain of the reverse flow of his meridians and forcing out the Profound Energy that Li Moying had injected into his body.","However, this was tantamount to harming himself. His meridians were severely damaged, causing him to involuntarily spit out a mouthful of blood on the spot.","“Damned brat! You... You actually dared to hurt me! You actually dare...!” Li Moying sneered, but didn’t answer.","However, the shock in his heart was actually no less than Rui Jiang’s.","He had used more than ninety percent of his strength in that attack earlier. Whether it was the Little Qilin, the secret treasure of the magic tool level in his hand, or the secret technique of the Cloudy Qilin Clan that he used to accumulate power, they were all his life-saving trump cards.","After using so many trump cards, he was only able to cause Rui Jiang minor injuries in the end. He could not even seriously injure him... There was no way to defeat Rui Jiang!","Li Moying’s thoughts turned quickly, and the moment Rui Jiang spat out blood, he had already clearly assessed the situation.","The speed of a lightning ascribed practitioner was originally very fast. When he added the exquisite movement technique of Profound Skill, he was practically like a bolt of lightning as he shot out.","In Li Moying’s entire life, he rarely had such a miserable moment.","Even when he encountered a strong enemy, his first choice was often to fight at all costs instead of fleeing in a hurry.","But today was different.","Huang Yueli was still behind him, and if he was killed here, you could imagine that the first thing Rui Jiang would do next would be to turn around and grab Huang Yueli!","In order to give Huang Yueli enough time to escape, he could only try his best to lure Rui Jiang away.","Rui Jiang had just been injured by him, and in his rage, he would not notice Huang Yueli, and would just follow his instincts and follow closely behind Li Moying until he killed him to vent his anger.","The reality was exactly what Li Moying had expected.","Rui Jiang was so angry that her face turned red as she waved the huge hammer in her hand while chasing after Li Moying.","“Damned race thief, stop right there! Today, I’ll definitely tear you to pieces... I want to refine your soul into a living soul so that even if you die, you won’t be able to escape...”","The demon expert’s cold voice seemed to come from hell. Just hearing it made people break out in a cold sweat.","But Li Moying’s face didn’t show any expression and his heart didn’t fluctuate.","His only thought now was to stall Rui Jiang as long as possible!","The two of them, one chasing and the other fleeing, were shockingly fast. In the blink of an eye, they had covered more than ten miles.","However, the gap between Li Moying’s cultivation and Rui Jiang’s was still too big. Even though he had already done his best, the gap between him and Rui Jiang was still getting smaller and smaller...","“Little thief, let’s see where you can run to!”","Seeing that Li Moying was less than a hundred metres in front of him, Rui Jiang’s bloodshot eyes flashed with a hint of ruthlessness as the demonic aura around him instantly rose!","Li Moying was already prepared as his figure flashed and he drew a shield from his interspatial ring and blocked in front of him.","The surging devil qi crashed into the shield with a loud bang. ‘ Stop!” A young girl’s voice came from behind Rui Jiang.."]},{"number":4516,"title":"Chapter 4516: Live and die together (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4516: Live and die together (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","After this scream, an extremely powerful fire of Profound Energy had already shot towards Rui Jiang’s back.","This burst of Profound Energy had gathered almost all of Huang Yueli’s energy, and its momentum was extremely huge.","Searing air currents swirled around, setting the surrounding trees and grass ablaze. The desolate forest was instantly transformed into a sea of fire.","Rui Jiang’s entire attention was on Li Moying, totally unprepared for a sneak attack from behind.","Although he had heard Huang Yueli’s voice, it was already too late to change his move at the last minute.","“Damn it! That wretched girl is actually still alive!”","Rui Jiang’s expression changed.","Huang Yueli’s full-strength attack was no small matter. Even though he possessed the strength of a Devil Overlord, if he were to receive this move without any precautions, he would most definitely be seriously injured.","He... He couldn’t afford to take that risk!","Huang Yueli’s attack was very fast, and the air wave condensed from the raging flames was about to hit Rui Jiang’s back. Not daring to be careless, Rui Jiang could only grit his teeth as he gave up on the idea of killing Li Moying with one blow, as he diverted most of his Devil Qi to his back to defend against Huang Yueli’s attack.","The raging flames were blocked by Rui Jiang and exploded in mid-air, forming a fiery light that soared into the sky.","“Ughhhhh!”","Huang Yueli’s chest was hit by the rebound energy, and the huge impact caused her body to fly out in an instant.","She had just broken through Li Moying’s restriction, and her energy channels were originally in a relatively weak state. Later, she was in a hurry to save her husband’s life and didn’t care about her defenses at all as she used all her power for her attacks.","Were it not for the fact that she was still wearing the high quality armour she had received from Zhao Lin, she would have been crippled even if she had not died.","However, her current situation was not any better.","Rui Jiang’s power was simply too much. Her defenses could only last for a few breaths before being broken by a Devil Overlord.","Huang Yueli fell heavily to the ground as she spat out a mouthful of fresh blood.","” Li ‘er!!” Li Moying saw her spit out blood and let out a cry of shock.","Although Huang Yueli had interrupted him, causing Rui Jiang’s attack to weaken quite a bit, his injuries were still more severe than Huang Yueli’s. His internal organs seemed to have been shattered as the intense pain penetrated every inch of his bones.","He used all his strength to support himself on the ground, wanting to stand up to see Huang Yueli’s condition, but since his meridians were severely damaged, he couldn’t even use that little bit of strength. As long as he propped himself up, he would instantly lose all his strength and fall back to the ground.","When Rui Jiang saw that Li Moying wasn’t dead, he felt a little happy in his heart.","Earlier, in his anger, he almost killed Li Moying, and that was a great loss. He was the top genius of the Ancient God Clan, and refining the Blood Pill would help him the most.","Besides, he had already found a better way to torture Li Moying...","Rui Jiang glanced at Huang Yueli, who wasn’t far away, and turned his gaze to Li Moying as he let out a cold sneer.","“Tsk tsk, stinky brat, your little lover is really affectionate. She even risked her life to rush over and save you. That is very touching...Besides, when you think about it, this little girl is not bad at all. She’s probably one of the most beautiful of the Ancient God Clan. Her skin is so soft and tender.tsk tsk...”","Rui Jiang said as he slowly walked towards Huang Yueli.."]},{"number":4517,"title":"Chapter 4517: Live and die together (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4517: Live and die together (7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying saw that Rui Jiang’s hand had already touched Huang Yueli’s face, and immediately, his entire body trembled in rage as all the blood in his body rushed to his head, and his eyes seemed to be about to spit fire.","“You... What are you trying to do? Let her go!”","“Hahaha, brat, you want me to let her go? Why should I? With your half-dead state?” Rui Jiang let out an extremely arrogant laugh.","Seeing Li Moying so angry, but unable to gather his Profound Energy to counterattack, his depressed mood that had been stuck for the entire night finally relaxed.","As one of the top experts of the Devil Clan, it had been many years since he had suffered a loss like the one he suffered today. He had actually been played around with by two seemingly little brats for m the Ancient God Clan, and had even been injured by their combined efforts!","If this matter got out, who knew how people would laugh at him!","However, everything was fine now. This Ancient God Clan brat had finally fallen into his hands!","Moreover, Rui Jiang could tell that Li Moying was a tough nut to crack. If they tortured him, he might not react, but if they tortured this young lady from the Ancient God Clan, it would be different...","“I just heard you call that little girl your wife? Tsk tsk, did all the geniuses of the Ancient God Clan get married at such a young age? It was too bad that this little girl was not a virgin. Otherwise...such a girl’s primordial yin is the most nourishing...”","“I said... Let her go! Let her go right now! Otherwise, I... I won’t let you go even if I become a ghost!”","He tried his best to get up from the ground, but the condition of his shattered meridians was too serious. Even if he tried his best, it was difficult for him to move his body, let alone gather enough power to counterattack Rui Jiang.","Rui Jiang laughed out loud,” Tsk tsk, I’m really scared! For a genius like you to actually have an ancient divine beast following you around, I’m afraid you’re the most outstanding genius of the Cloudy Qilin Clan in this generation, right? Maybe you’re even a Young Patriarch or something... How could I give you the chance to become a a malicious ghost with such rare alchemy materials?","Besides, your little lady...”","As Rui Jiang said this, his gaze swept down from Huang Yueli’s messy collar caused by the fight earlier.","Her jade-like skin and the slender and perfect lines on her neck immediately attracted him, causing his eyes to show an obvious lustful glint.","“Even if she is not a virgin, this lord must have a good taste of such breathtaking beauty. Don’t worry, I will definitely let you, the little husband, personally watch from the side and see how this little girl is begging for mercy under this lord’s body... When her vitality is exhausted, I will peel off her beautiful skin and turn it into a Spirit Armament. As for her spirit, it can also be used to refine pills. I will refine two blood pills, one Yin and one Yang, with you. After I consume them, my cultivation will definitely improve greatly and I will officially enter the Devil Overlord realm, hahahaha...”","Rui Jiang imagined what he would look like when he officially broke through, and finally couldn’t help but laugh.","As he said these words, his gaze was fixed on Li Moying.","Seeing the hatred on Li Moying’s face grow more and more intense, Rui Jiang’s heart felt more and more refreshed!","Being able to torture these two incomparable geniuses of the God Clan to their heart’s content was absolutely something the devil race had dreamed of!","Rui Jiang said a few more words, and after admiring Li Moying’s twisted expression for a while, he finally felt satisfied.","He turned around and reached out to Huang Yueli’s face...."]},{"number":4518,"title":"Chapter 4518: Live and die together (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4518: Live and die together (8)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Just as his finger was about to touch Huang Yueli, Huang Yueli dodged and spat at him.","Rui Jiang was taken by surprise. The distance was so close that he was unable to dodge it in time and her spit landed on his face.","For a moment, he was unable to react. After a while, he realised what had happened and was immeditely furious.","“Damned girl! How dare you... how dare you do this to me! This little bitch deserves to die ten thousand times over! As expected from that brat’s wife. She definitely deserves to die!”","Rui Jiang’s eyes were red as he glared at Huang Yueli, the anger in his heart indescribable.","He had never been humiliated like this in his life. He was actually spat on!","“Hmph, I think you won’t cry until you see the coffin. I will teach you a good lesson today...”","Rui Jiang reached out and grabbed Huang Yueli’s neck, pushing her to the ground. The expression on his face was incomparably malevolent.","But Huang Yueli didn’t show any fear at all and smiled slightly instead.","Rui Jiang saw her abnormal expression and suddenly felt uneasy. He reached out to rip off her clothes and stopped for a moment.","Huang Yueli’s body, which was originally cold due to her severe injuries, suddenly experienced a rapid rise in temperature. In the blink of an eye, she became scorching hot, as if she was burning from the inside.","Rui Jiang’s heart skipped a beat. Not good! “Damn it, you... You really want to...” The word ‘self-destruct’ appeared in his mind and he was instantly terrified.","“No, no, no. Impossible, you... Wretched girl, don’t you know that after self-destructing you will be completely dead? You won’t even be able to keep your soul, and you won’t be able to reincarnate?”","Powerful cultivators, no matter the race, rarely chose to destroy themselves.","After all, even if their physical bodies were completely destroyed and their souls were tortured until only a trace of consciousness remained, as long as there was a chance, the talented experts could still break out of the cocoon and be reborn.","However, if he chose to destroy himself, it would be tantamount to destroying all hope.","A cultivator who had painstakingly cultivated to such a stage was absolutely unwilling to do so.","Rui Jiang had never imagined that a young genius like Huang Yueli would make such a choice.","Was she crazy?","Or... just because of that Cloudy Qilin Clan brat?","“Damn it, you...”","Rui Jiang made a hasty move to seal Huang Yueli’s acupoints to prevent her from self-destructing.","However, the Devil Clan’s techniques for sealing their meridians were far inferior to those of the Ancient God Clan. They usually relied on their mighty strength to forcefully suppress the other party.","But unfortunately, Huang Yueli’s body also contained evil qi, and to a certain extent, it merged with his demonic energy. Rui Jiang’s demonic energy entered Huang Yueli’s body, and for a short while, he actually couldn’t control it.","Meanwhile, the fire-associated energy in Huang Yueli’s body grew rapidly in an instant, and scorching hot flames even came out of her mouth.","“Damn it, Huang Yueli, you... Stop, stop!”","The shrill cry of desperation tore through the dark sky. There was even obvious fear in the voice.","Li Moying used all his strength to support himself on the ground as he looked at the blazing flames in front of him, his heart and meridians seemingly crushed to pieces.."]},{"number":4519,"title":"Chapter 4519: Dao Profound Realm (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4519: Dao Profound Realm (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Why...why did it happen again!","He had clearly vowed to protect Huang Yueli well and become a man she could rely on.","But in the end, he actually saw that she chose to destroy herself to save him at any cost...","He... What a good-for-nothing!","If he could be stronger... stronger...","The grief and indignation in Li Moying’s heart seemed to be about to burst out of his chest.","It was as if he did not know that the current situation was already an irredeemably desperate one, and he was still trying to mobilize the remaining Profound Energy in his body.","The Profound Energy condensed again and again, and in the blink of an eye, it dispersed from his shattered meridians.","Each time it condensed, it was as if countless sharp blades were stabbing into his body.","Cold sweat continued to drip from his forehead, but he didn’t seem to feel any pain. In just a few breaths, he repeated it hundreds of times!","The sound was so faint that even Rui Jiang, who was not far away and whose hearing was far superior to that of ordinary people, did not notice it.","But in Li Moying’s ears, this sound was like a volcano erupting, piercing through the clouds and making his head buzz as he felt dizzy.","Yet he did not panic. Instead, a wave of ecstasy surged through his heart.","That was because with that loud bang, his dantian instantly broke through the bonds. The bottleneck that had been stuck for so long actually broke through in one fell swoop!","He... He had actually successfully entered the Dao Profound Realm at this point!","Of course, he didn’t consider this to be an accident or a miracle. On the contrary, the fact that he had only broken through so far was something he and Huang Yueli couldn’t understand.","Li Moying had entered the peak of the Heart Profound Realm earlier than","Huang Yueli and had been there for almost a year.","In that time, Huang Yueli had already jumped from the initial level of the Heart Profound Realm to the later level of the Heart Profound Realm, but he seemed to be stuck in a bottleneck, unable to break through.","At first, the two of them thought that it was due to their dual cultivation of the < Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual >>, so before Huang Yueli caught up with his cultivation, it would be very difficult for him to break through.","But later, when Huang Yueli had also reached the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm, he was still stagnated.","Although Li Moying knew that this was something that couldn’t be rushed, and he usually didn’t have any strange reactions to it, this was the first time that an incomparable genius like him had encountered a bottleneck in his many years of cultivation, so it couldn’t be said that he didn’t care about it at all.","He had tried many methods to break through, but none of them had worked.","Unexpectedly, just when he thought that he and Huang Yueli would die here, becoming a pair of mandarin ducks who would share the same fate, he... he actually broke through!","From the Heart Profound Realm to the Dao Profound Realm, it was the process of a cultivator’s understanding of the laws of Heaven and Earth reaching the peak, and from there condensing into his own Great Dao.","The moment Li Moying broke through, the extremely powerful Profound Energy in his body surged out and instantly merged with the naturally formed Profound Energy, causing a Heaven and Earth phenomenon.","“Rumble! Boom! Boom!”","Bolts of lightning blitzed down from the sky, and the sound of thunder continued to grow louder and louder.","The thunder attribute energy surged madly in Li Moying’s direction.","This change happened in the blink of an eye.","When Rui Jiang saw that Huang Yueli was about to self-destruct, he was still desperately retreating for fear of being affected by the aftershock of the self-destruction. Suddenly, he felt the Heaven and Earth Profound Qi behind him become incomparably violent.."]},{"number":4520,"title":"Chapter 4520: Dao Profound Realm!(2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4520: Dao Profound Realm!(2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","A strong sense of danger rose from behind Rui Jiang.","His brain hadn’t reacted to what had happened, but he instinctively felt a fatal threat.","Rui Jiang subconsciously dodged to the side.","In the next moment, a bolt of lightning descended from the sky and exploded in an instant. The intense light was so piercing that people could not open their eyes at all. The thunderous clap of lightning shook the entire land as if it was trembling.","Although Rui Jiang reacted quickly enough, he was still forced back by the aftershock of the energy. He felt blood congeal in his chest and he almost vomited blood on the spot.","However, he had been through hundreds of battles and knew very well that now was not the time to heal. After a powerful attack, it was the most dangerous time!","Rui Jiang could not be bothered to check his wound. He forcefully suppressed the blood and Qi that kept surging up in his chest and opened his eyes.","The strong light was still very blinding. The moment he opened his eyes, he felt a pain and tears flowed down subconsciously.","However, he still used his strong willpower to force himself to turn around and look.","He broke out in a cold sweat.","The remaining branches of some trees were still burning, emitting black smoke. It looked especially terrifying.","“This... How is this possible? What exactly...What exactly happened?”","Rui Jiang couldn’t come back to his senses for a moment.","This was because this change had happened too suddenly!","Just a dozen breaths ago, he clearly had the upper hand. He only needed to move a finger and he could kill this pair of seriously injured peerless geniuses of the Ancient God Clan on the spot.","Although Huang Yueli’s intention to self-destruct had caught him off guard, but Rui Jiang didn’t think that a mere Heart Profound Realm practitioner’s self-detonation could really harm his life, it was just a little injury.","But now, at this moment, he clearly felt the threat of death.","The chill that slowly climbed up from his back clearly penetrated deep into his bones.","To create this huge pit in the blink of an eye, the energy required was not something that ordinary cultivators could imagine.","Even though Rui Jiang had forcefully raised his cultivation through the help of the Ancient Talisman Array and had reached the Devil Overlord Realm, he still needed to use a secret technique to stimulate the energy in his entire body in order to launch such a powerful attack.","To say that such destruction was caused by Huang Yueli and Li Moying, he naturally wouldn’t believe it. After all, these two little brats had been beaten to the ground by him and were on the verge of death, so they could only wait for death.","Rui Jiang’s first thought was that there was a peerless expert from the Ancient God Clan who had arrived to save Li Moying and Huang Yueli.","Moreover, the strength of this Ancient God Clan cultivator... It was even above him!","“Who is it? Come out quickly, stop hiding! Didn’t you Ancient God Clans care about your face the most? You always say that you all are open and aboveboard and look down on the Devil Clan? Your Excellency is also a top expert of the Ancient God Clan, right? You actually hid and ambushed me!","Don’t you think it’s embarrassing to use such despicable methods?”","Rui Jiang seized the time and adjusted his breath. At the same time, he looked around vigilantly, wanting to find this Ancient God Clan expert who had come to save them.","Logically speaking, the other party had already made a move and caused such an earth-shattering commotion. It was impossible for him to hide his tracks.","However, no matter how he looked, he could not find any trace of a fourth person at the scene.."]},{"number":4521,"title":"Chapter 4521: Dao Profound Realm!(3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4521: Dao Profound Realm!(3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Only Huang Yueli who was on the verge of death was half-lying on the grass not far away, her body not moving at all. No one knew how far the self-explosion had gone and whether she was dead or alive.","And the top of the huge pit was filled with black smoke which couldn’t dissipate for a long time so Li Moying’s figure on the other side of the huge pit was indistinct but Rui Jiang could barely make out that Li Moying seemed to be sitting on the same spot without any movement and looked like he was beaten up till he couldn’t move.","Then... Who was the one who attacked just now?","Moreover, the other party was really too strong. Even after he was assisted by the Talisman Array, he did not dare to say that he could match the other party.","This meant that the other party’s strength had at least surpassed Divine","General Xuan Jiuling, who was overseeing Blessed City!","There were also a few such powerhouses in the Ancient God Clan.","Why did he suddenly appear here? Isn’t this too much of a coincidence?","“Which one of the gods has arrived? Looking at your esteemed self proficient in Thunder Profound Skills, you should also be an expert of Cloudy Qilin Clan right? Come out quickly! What kind of ability was hiding? If you don’t come out now, I’m going to be rude to these two brats!”","Rui Jiang shouted for a long time, but there was still no response from the other side.","On the contrary, the Profound Qi in the surroundings became more and more intense. The thunder attribute energy kept gathering in this direction. The concentration of the Profound Qi became higher and higher, and even the surrounding temperature rose at an astonishing speed.","Rui Jiang’s heart skipped a beat. He realized that the situation was getting worse.","He did not know what the Ancient God Clan was up to, nor did he know why this mysterious expert of the Ancient God Clan did not appear.","However, at least he knew that the current situation was getting more and more disadvantageous to him.","If he didn’t want to wait for death, he had to act now. At the very least, he had to force the other party out first.","At the thought of this, Rui Jiang reacted immediately.","He suddenly exerted force on his feet and immediately flew up, dashing towards the other side of the huge pit. At the same time, he stretched out his hand and grabbed towards the shadow behind the black smoke that seemed to be Li Moying.","In this situation, it was naturally the safest to have a hostage in hand.","Since the experts of the Ancient God Clan were here to save people, it was impossible for them to remain calm and hide at the side when they saw the geniuses of the Ancient God Clan in danger.","And since the person who came was from Cloudy Qilin Clan who was proficient in thunder attribute, then Li Moying as a hostage would naturally be more useful than Huang Yueli.","Even if he was from the Devil Race, he had heard of the grudge between Cloudy Qilin Clan and Sacred Phoenix Clan. If he captured Huang Yueli, she might even use his hands to kill her and wouldn’t show herself.","It had to be said that Rui Jiang was indeed worthy of the reputation of a top expert. Not only was he extremely powerful, but his reaction was also fast enough. In just a few breaths, he had already analyzed the situation in front of him clearly and made the most beneficial choice for himself.","However, when Rui Jiang jumped up and passed through the black smoke above the pit, he froze when he saw the situation on the other side of the pit.","“This... This...","Not far away from the huge pit, Li Moying was indeed as he had predicted, not moving at all.","However, his current condition had nothing to do with the word ‘dying’ at all.."]},{"number":4522,"title":"Chapter 4522: Dao Profound Realm!(4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4522: Dao Profound Realm!(4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying sat cross-legged on the muddy ground beside the pit. The battle armour on his body was already in tatters and fresh blood was still flowing out from a few wounds on the ground.","However, there was not a trace of embarrassment on his face. His back was straight, like the sharpest saber!","Countless lightning attribute Profound Qi gathered in his direction. The surrounding lightning attribute energy was so dense that it made it difficult for people to breathe.","These energies formed a blue purple halo around Li Moying’s body, enveloping his entire body within.","Because the energy was too dense, the Profound Qi that was originally in a gaseous state was even squeezed into a blueish violet liquid around him, dripping drop by drop from the light ball around him.","Above Li Moying’s head, a thick lightning bolt shot straight into the sky, connecting together with the huge tribulation clouds in the sky, like a towering giant tree constructed from lightning!","Lightning kept falling from the tribulation clouds, striking down on Li Moying’s head through this pillar of light, flickering with a dazzling light as the lightning intersected with each other, giving out a sizzling sound.","Just seeing such a stance was enough to make people tremble in fear.","This was the power of the tribulation clouds of heaven and earth, representing the Great Dao of the thunder origin in heaven and earth.","As long as it came into contact with a little bit, it was enough to turn the vast majority of cultivators into ashes in the blink of an eye!","The lightning shone on his handsome face, making it difficult to see his expression.","He closed his eyes slightly and faced the sky with his palms, absorbing the surrounding lightning energy to his heart’s content.","The instant Rui Jiang saw Li Moying clearly, his mind buzzed as he suddenly understood.","“This... This was... This brat is...He was breaking through! Furthermore, he is entering Dao Profound Realm!","It’s equivalent to the realm of our Devil Clan’s Sky Devil Realm!","Rui Jiang had also experienced this kind of advancement process, so she could judge it with just a glance.","His face instantly turned as pale as paper. How was this possible? How was this possible? This little brat from the Ancient God Clan definitely looked underage, but he actually... He was actually able to advance to Dao Profound Realm!","Simply... This was simply...No, that’s impossible!”","Rui Jiang himself could be considered one of the top geniuses of the Devil Clan.","He was not inferior to the heaven grade geniuses of the Ancient God Clan.","When he was in his eighties, he advanced to the Sky Devil Realm and was already the youngest person to break through to the top hundred in the history of the Devil Clan.","Rui Jiang had always been proud of this. He was even more certain that with","his shocking talent, it was very possible for him to advance to the Devil Overlord Realm in the future. He was destined to become one of the strongest experts in the entire God Realm.","However, this confidence was completely shattered the moment he saw Li Moying break through.","Even if it was hard for him to determine the exact age of the Ancient God Clan, he could tell that Li Moying was terrifyingly young!","However, he actually...He was about to break through!","Furthermore, the heaven and earth phenomenon that Li Moying’s breakthrough triggered was many times more powerful than his back then!","“Damn it! This brat! If he did not die today, then the Devil Clan would probably never have a peaceful day in the future! In the future, countless devils will struggle to survive under his shadow...”","At the thought of this, a fierce look flashed across his eyes, and his killing intent became even more obvious.","Of course, as a devil, Rui Jiang’s sympathy for his own kind was also limited. He did not have the noble sentiment of sacrificing himself for justice.","But he knew that if he allowed Li Moying to advance successfully, even if he escaped, he would not be able to escape for more than a few days.."]},{"number":4523,"title":"Chapter 4523: Dao Profound Realm!(5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4523: Dao Profound Realm!(5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Offending such an inconceivable genius was a nightmare for anyone! This was because the other party’s growth rate was too perverse. The gap between them would only continue to widen.","So instead of escaping and waiting for Li Moying’s strength to become stronger before killing him, he might as well take advantage of the fact that Li Moying had just advanced and his strength wasn’t stable enough to kill him all at once!","A dead genius was no longer a genius and no longer a threat.","Rui Jiang had always been very decisive. In a few breaths, he had already made up his mind.","His retreat paused as he suddenly turned to face Li Moying once again.","His eyes were wide open as he stared at the young Ancient God Clan surrounded by the interlacing lightning bolts. He was on 120% alert, silently waiting for the opportunity to attack.","He didn’t know how much time had passed. It could have been several hours or just a moment. In the face of such a vast and boundless power of heaven and earth, he had already lost the ability to calculate time.","Eventually, the lightning that kept falling began to diminish, and the tribulation clouds in the sky began to dissipate at a visible speed.","Rui Jiang shivered.","Even though he had guessed before that with Li Moying’s innate talent, successfully advancing shouldn’t be a problem, Rui Jiang had never expected Li Moying’s advancement process to be so smooth.","Logically speaking, whether it was the Devil Clan, the Ancient God Clan, or the Devil Clan, advancing was an extremely dangerous matter.","Because even though cultivators who had broken through to the Dao Profound Realm had already grasped the Great Dao origin of a certain attribute, if they wanted to obtain the recognition of the origin, they still had to infuse enough origin energy into their bodies.","During this process, if they were not careful, they would be consumed by the Great Dao Origin. It was even more common for them to go berserk.","Just looking at how each large family clan had to send at least four elders to advance to Dao Profound Realm cultivators every time, one could get a glimpse of this.","This time, Li Moying not only didn’t have anyone to protect him, but he had suddenly advanced in the wilderness during a battle, so he wasn’t prepared at all.","If it were anyone else in that situation, Rui Jiang would probably have lost his life here without even having to do it himself.","However, not only did Li Moying not die, he didn’t even show any signs of injury.","The Lightning Dao descended from the sky and merged into his body without any hindrance. It was as if he had been born with the love of Heaven and Earth Dao. The power in his body should naturally merge with the power of lightning.","Such a talent was simply terrifying!","Rui Jiang’s heart burned with jealousy and hatred when he saw this and the killing intent in his heart intensified.","When the tribulation clouds had half dispersed, the balls of light around Li Moying’s body gradually began to dissipate.","Bit by bit, the balls of light faded until it disappeared completely. Rui Jiang suddenly moved!","After experiencing a breakthrough, he knew very well that the moment he successfully advanced, the other party would be at its weakest.","Even though the person who had advanced had already attained the recognition of the Origin of the Great Dao, if he wanted to use this new power skilfully, he would need at least months, if not years, of practice.","And the Profound Energy that had been accumulated by the person who had advanced had already been exhausted when he had withstood the power of","Heaven and Earth.","So, at this moment, Li Moying was a mere shell completely drained of energy!"]},{"number":4524,"title":"Chapter 4524: Dao Profound Realm!(6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4524: Dao Profound Realm!(6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Although the lightning around his body seemed extremely powerful, in reality, the strength of a finger could have knocked him to the ground.","Rui Jiang successfully seized this opportunity, and the Devil Qi in his body suddenly erupted!","The black mist enveloped his body in the blink of an eye, and his speed was ten times faster than before.","Rui Jiang leaped up and his figure was like a black arrow as he shot out. The moment the ball of light disappeared, he rushed to Li Moying’s side.","Li Moying, who was inside the ball of light, was still sitting upright in the same place, his eyes closed tightly and not moving at all.","Rui Jiang was delighted when he saw this. He... He was right!","Li Moying wasn’t moving now, not because he didn’t want to move, but because he couldn’t move! All he could do was sit there and wait for death!","Rui Jiang’s wrist twisted and a dagger imbued with a dark purple aura was already held between his fingers, stabbing directly at Li Moying’s heart.","The dagger was less than an inch away from Li Moying...","Suddenly, Li Moying’s tightly shut eyes opened.","Li Moying’s originally pitch-black pupils had turned to a bluish-purple colour as his eyes flashed with a piercing light, appearing and disappearing as if the lightning that had struck down from the Tribulation Clouds earlier were all contained within his eyes.","Rui Jiang almost lost his composure when he was struck by that pair of cold gaze, but he calmed down with his extraordinary willpower.","He... He couldn’t be frightened by Li Moying’s appearance!","This was just a difference in the power of the lightning attribute cultivators after they had advanced.","But no matter how strong he looked on the outside, it couldn’t hide the fact that Li Moying was extremely weak right now... All cultivators were the same!","Rui Jiang tried his best to convince himself, and at the same time, his fingers tightened as he gripped the dagger and stabbed at Li Moying’s chest once again.","This time, however, he didn’t even manage to push the dagger forward an inch when he felt an extremely powerful force blocking in front of Li Moying, like an iron wall, preventing the dagger, which was as sharp as mud and soaked in the Devil Clan’s blood poison, from penetrating at all.","“Damn it! What is going on?”","Rui Jiang used every ounce of strength in his body to push the dagger forward.","However, the dagger still stayed where it was. At the same time, a deep, cold sneer sounded in his ear.","Before Rui Jiang could react, the force blocking the dagger increased again.","A blazing purple-blue light suddenly erupted from Li Moying’s body, and in the blink of an eye, the light seemed to engulf the sky and earth, piercing his eyes until they bled with pain.","Clang!","Rui Jiang lost consciousness, and it was only when his back hit the ground hard that he realised he had been sent flying by Li Moying’s blow!","As a famous peak Sky Devil Realm expert among the devils, he had killed countless experts from the Ancient God Clan and had the power of an ancient secret treasure talisman array with him. However, he was defeated by a brat who was still wet behind the ears!","Moreover, he did not even have the ability to resist!","This was simply unbelievable.","“Damn it, how is this possible... Cough, cough, why... It will be like this?”","After advancing, it should be the time when he was at his weakest, but how was Li Moying weak? He... Why was he different from others?","Could it be that there really was an incomparable genius in the world who possessed an extremely vast divine sense and was born to merge with the Great Dao of Heaven and Earth?"]},{"number":4525,"title":"Chapter 4525: These...are all ours!(l)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4525: These...are all ours!(l)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Rui Jiang would never get an answer to that question.","Before he could regain his senses, Li Moying’s figure had already passed through the black smoke and flashed over from the other end of the huge pit.","The young and handsome cultivator from the Ancient God Clan walked towards Rui Jiang step by step. His speed was not too fast, but he carried a powerful pressure that could not be ignored.","“You...!”","Looking at Li Moying’s cold and emotionless eyes, Rui Jiang felt that death was so close to him for the first time.","Subconsciously, he began to beg for mercy. Young Master, you... Spare my life, let me go just this once, I... I can help you, really. I will definitely be useful to you! As long as you spare me, I can recognise you as my master and become your slave to help you subdue the entire devil army!","I know that a young genius like you must have returned to the battlefield to perform meritorious deeds, right? As long as you have this kind of contribution, you will be the greatest hero of the Military Department when you return to the Twelve Continents of the God Clan! I can still...”","“The Devil Clan’s shamelessness is indeed well deserved! In order to survive, did you actually betray all the clansmen in the military camp?” Li Moying’s gaze became even colder.","“No, no, no, I won’t betray you! Young Master, no, Master! Master, I’m doing this to pledge my loyalty to you... Ah!”","In order to survive, Rui Jiang couldn’t care less about anything else and began to show his loyalty to Li Moying by hook or by crook.","Unfortunately, his words were too shameless and Li Moying felt that his ears had been polluted by just one more breath, and he couldn’t help but make a move as a bolt of lightning flew out from his side and pierced Rui Jiang’s body directly.","Rui Jiang let out an extremely pitiful scream and fell to the ground.","The devil’s blue blood spewed out of his chest and scattered everywhere.","Luckily, Li Moying stepped back in time, or else he would have been splattered all over.","However, he regretted it the moment he attacked.","Of course, Rui Jiang deserved to be killed. But he should not have let Rui Jiang die so easily. Instead, he should have tortured him to make him wish he were dead and regret being born in this world!","Because of that devil, his Li ‘er was actually forced to self-destruct once again in front of him!","Just the thought of the blazing flame erupting from Huang Yueli’s chest made Li Moying’s heart ache.","Unfortunately, even Li Moying had not expected that Rui Jiang had actually taken the initiative to give up all his defences in order to show his loyalty earlier, so he was killed by him in a single blow. Looking at him now, he was already dead.","Li Moying’s heart was filled with pity, but he didn’t bother to think about it as he immediately turned around and ran to where Huang Yueli was lying.","On a patch of burnt grass, Huang Yueli’s petite figure was lying on the ground with her head down, not moving at all.","She was so still that even the earth-shattering scene that had just unfolded did not make her react the slightest...","The throbbing pain in Li Moying’s heart surged wave after wave, making him almost unable to breathe.","If... If only he could be stronger...","If only he had broken through sooner...","If he could have sensed the danger earlier and stopped Li ‘er from entering this cave dwelling alone...","Maybe Li ‘er was still by his side now, smiling with a face full of wisdom with a hint of mischief.."]},{"number":4526,"title":"Chapter 4526: These...are all ours!(2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4526: These...are all ours!(2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","She was still clutching his arm and flirting with him in her sweet voice.","This little fox was so domineering in front of outsiders, but when she was next to him, she was like an ordinary little woman. It made him want to dig his heart out for her...","Unfortunately, he would never be able to see all this again.","Never again...","Just as Li Moying was in extreme pain and had already raised the longsword in his hand, intending to slit his throat and die together with Huang Yueli...","Suddenly, the fingers of the girl on the ground moved slightly.","Li Moying’s heart trembled as his hands stopped, while his eyes stared intently at Huang Yueli’s fingers.","However, after staring at it for a while, he realised that the slender and beautiful finger had stopped moving. He could not help but sigh.","He had personally witnessed Huang Yueli preparing to destroy herself.","However, due to his sudden advancement, Huang Yueli’s self-destruction didn’t seem to be complete, so she didn’t self-destruct like the previous time, where her consciousness and physical body dissipated on the spot.","If her dantian exploded, she would not be able to survive.","No matter how powerful a cultivator was, they were no exception.","“Li ‘er...” Li Moying raised his long sword once more and pressed it against his neck.","“What did you say? What did you see wrong?”","Just as he was about to make a move, a slightly hoarse voice suddenly sounded.","Li Moying was obviously stunned for a moment as he unconsciously replied, “Wh...” What’s that sound?”","“What sound? Li Moying, you... have you lost your mind after being beaten up by Rui Jiang? You can’t even recognise your wife’s voice!”","Huang Yueli gritted her teeth as her tone carried obvious displeasure.","However, Li Moying still couldn’t come to his senses, “Little... Li ‘er? You... Is it because your soul can’t bear to leave and still stays by my side? Don’t worry, I’ll go with you right away. You won’t be lonely in the underworld...”","“Li Moying! You, you, you... Are you really stupid? Hurry up and help me up! Ughh, I...","My chest is injured. Pressing on the wound like this will kill me... Did you hear that?”","Hearing Huang Yueli’s agitated and desperate voice, Li Moying suddenly realised that the situation wasn’t right.","He quickly threw down the longsword in his hand as he crouched down and walked closer to Huang Yueli to take a closer look.","The girl lying on the ground was as pale as a sheet, and her forehead was covered in cold sweat.","But her eyes were already open, and there was a light in them that Li Moying was very familiar with, along with an undeniable frustration and anger...","His Li ‘er had really woken up!","Li Moying almost thought he was dreaming!","At that moment, he was already on the verge of a complete breakdown. He felt that there was no point in continuing to live, which was why he was in a daze.","But now he felt as if he had been reborn.","Moreover, his limbs and bones seemed to be filled with infinite strength due to the advancement.","“Stop looking, it’s... It wasn’t as if he hadn’t seen it before! Hurry and help me up! I... I’m already completely exhausted. I can’t move at all...”","Huang Yueli said weakly.","“Yes... Li Jer, don’t worry, I’ll come right away!”","Li Moying didn’t dare to be careless as he quickly turned Huang Yueli over.","Then he did not leave her on the ground. Instead, he picked her up and pulled her into his arms, leaning her against his chest.."]},{"number":4527,"title":"Chapter 4527: These... are all ours!(3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4527: These... are all ours!(3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","This position caused their bodies to be pressed tightly together.","He didn’t know when it had started, but the slender and somewhat thin girl he had first met had grown into a great beauty with curves. The little bunny on her chest was bulging. Every time she came close, it made her husband’s heart flutter.","But today, Li Moying wasn’t in such a mood.","He hugged Huang Yueli tightly as he felt the warmth from her body and the weak but stable heartbeat from his chest. His anxious heart was finally placated.","His Li ‘er... He really was fine!","She was alive and well and in his arms!","Li Moying was overjoyed, and in a moment of excitement, he hugged Huang Yueli tighter and tighter.","At first, Huang Yueli obediently leaned into his embrace, immersed in the joy of regaining what she had lost, but as Li Moying’s strength grew stronger, she couldn’t help but draw in a breath of cold air in pain.","“Husband, you... you’re hurting me!”","Li Moying quickly let go of her hand and remembered that Huang Yueli had suffered a serious injury earlier, so he quickly untied her collar and examined her carefully.","However, her entire body’s strength seemed to have been drained, and her four limbs seemed to weigh a thousand pounds. It was difficult for her to even move, so it was impossible for her to push Li Moying away, so she could only let him see everything from head to toe.","After reading it, Li Moying’s furrowed brow didn’t loosen, but became even more knotted.","He took a bottle of fragrant snow-white ointment from his chest and applied it to the sword wound on Huang Yueli’s chest.","Then he asked again, “Li ‘er, apart from feeling weak all over and the wound on your chest, are there any other injuries? Are you feeling pain all over your body?”","When Huang Yueli heard this, she subconsciously frowned as her face showed a doubtful expression.","“No, I actually... Actually, it felt fine. Just now, Rui Jiang and I exchanged blows and I was hit in the chest. However, I was wearing the Holy Armament Armour I took from the Phoenix Clan’s Treasure Vault, so only the superficial injuries were more serious. Although my meridians are damaged, as long as I cultivate properly, I can still recover.","The sword wound on Huang Yueli’s chest looked quite horrible and frightening to ordinary people, but experienced cultivators could tell that it wasn’t a big deal.","No matter how serious the external injuries were, as long as there were Heavenly Grade medicinal pills that could regenerate flesh and promote blood circulation, it would not take more than a few days for them to return to their original state.","However, if any of her meridians were injured, it would be a huge problem.","Fortunately, Huang Yueli was wearing a piece of Holy Armament, the Divine Clout Soft Armour.","Although the level of this armour was extremely high, Huang Yueli herself was only a Heart Profound Realm practitioner, so she was unable to unleash the full power of the Divine Clout Soft Armour, at most, she could only unleash twenty percent of it.","However, that 20% was enough to save her life.","Upon hearing this, Li Moying’s expression became even more solemn, “Being hit by Rui Jiang’s sword, injuries are inevitable. I saw your wound earlier, and you’re already lucky. But after being hit by the sword, most of your meridians are intact, so why did you feel so weak all over? Could it be because of your self-destruction just now?”","Mentioning the word ‘self-destruction’ , Li Moying suddenly thought of something and his expression instantly turned black as he turned his head and glared at Huang Yueli fiercely.."]},{"number":4528,"title":"Chapter 4528: These... are all ours!(4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4528: These... are all ours!(4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Li ‘er, today you actually... you were going to self-destruct again! Tell me, what did you promise me?”","” Uh...Umm...”","Huang Yueli, who was initially happy to have survived a disaster, heard her husband’s question and immediately felt guilty as her eyes darted around, not daring to look at him.","She lowered her voice and explained in a low voice, “Husband, I wasn’t...” Didn’t you see Rui Jiang trying to kill you? I didn’t know that you would break through in the face of danger. The situation was really too dangerous. I was completely instinctive. Yes, an instinctive reaction!”","“You still dare to say that it’s an instinctive reaction!”","Li Moying looked at her innocent expression, and how could he not see that this little fox was just pretending when sh saw how upset he was?","“Huang Yueli, do I need to remind you that you promised me that you would never choose self-destruction, no matter when! If I encounter an opponent I can’t defeat or a desperate situation, no matter how dangerous the situation, you will never sacrifice yourself to protect me. Instead, you will face it with me! Death is not scary, but we must die together. We can’t leave each other and live alone! Have you forgotten that?”","Huang Yueli listened as she broke into a cold sweat.","It had been a long time since she felt this guilty.","Young Clan Leader Li, who had always been cold and distant, had not shown such a desperate expression for a long time.","She raised her eyes and stole a glance at Li Moying as she continued to defend herself, “What you said, I...” Of course I remember. How could I forget what I promised my husband? I’m not that kind of person!”","“Is that so? I don’t believe it.” Li Moying looked at her and was still angry.","Huang Yueli pursed her lips nervously and continued: “You don’t believe me, I...” I really haven’t forgotten, but just now... I was too nervous just now! You know that when a person is anxious, his mind is easily confused. Besides, the demonic ai of Ruiiiang has already forced its wav into your throat. I... I didn’t have much time to think. On impulse...","Husband, I really didn’t mean to break my oath.”","Her petite body leaned gently into Li Moying’s embrace as her two large eyes looked up at Li Moying.","Li Moying lowered his head slightly, and from this angle, Huang Yueli’s palm-sized face looked even more innocent, like a snow-white little rabbit. For a moment, Li Moying felt like he was about to be sucked into those eyes.","He would believe anything the little girl said.","But as his peripheral vision swept over Huang Yueli’s wounded chest and the blood stains on her clothes, he suddenly woke up.","“You know very well whether you did it on purpose or not!”","“Li Moying, can’t you trust your wife for once? We are husband and wife, but you don’t believe me!”","Huang Yueli saw that pretending to be pitiful was useless, so she started to act shamelessly.","However, before she could use all her strength, she heard Li Moying exhale deeply as a tired expression appeared on his face.","Li ‘er, do you know how scared I was when I saw you self-destruct yourself again?","Li Moying’s voice was deep.","Huang Yueli’s heart trembled as she hurriedly nodded, “I know, I.... I know!”"]},{"number":4529,"title":"Chapter 4529: All of this...will be ours!(5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4529: All of this...will be ours!(5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“No, you don’t know anything. Otherwise you would not have acted so rashly. You would not have chosen to self-destruct without hesitation time and time again in order to save me...”","“I told you, I was just being impulsive...”","” Impulsiveness means that this is your first choice. You don’t even have to think about it, do you?” Li Moying gave a cold sneer as a cold glint flashed by his eyes and a cold gaze swept over her.","Huang Yueli was speechless.","She had to admit that Li Moying was right!","Seeing her silence, Li Moying continued, “You will never know how scared I am. I’m afraid that after this self-destruction, we won’t even have a chance to reincarnate and we won’t be able to meet again.","“I know...”","“No, you don’t know! Because I was the one who watched you self-destruct every time, and you... How can you understand if you’ve never seen it?”","Huang Yueli unconsciously wanted to defend herself, but just after she said two words, she was interrupted by Li Moying.","His deep black eyes were fixed on Huang Yueli’s face and his expression was extremely calm, but in Huang Yueli’s eyes, it made her heart tremble.","He stopped speaking and gently held Huang Yueli’s hand, “How is it? Before you destroyed yourself, was that what you thought?”","Huang Yueli opened her mouth but realised that she couldn’t even utter a sound.","What Li Moying had said was really too accurate.","She had no choice but to admit it.","Li Moying didn’t expect her to answer, so he took a deep breath and continued, “I also had such an impulse, but in the end, I held it back. Do you know why? Because I have experienced the fear of the person I love almost losing their soul. I know how painful that is. I don’t want you to suffer!”","Li Moying’s words were like a thunderbolt that exploded in Huang Yueli’s mind!","Only then did she realise how selfish her previous actions had been and how much damage they had caused Li Moying!","She... she had already destroyed herself once and left Li Moying alone in this world. If she did it again... ....","She wanted Li Moying to go on living, but in a world without her, could Li Moying go on living as if nothing had happened?","The answer... There was almost no suspense.","When she thought about it, a strong feeling of guilt invaded her heart. Huang Yueli looked at Li Moying’s sombre expression and her heart ached terribly. She couldn’t help but whisper, “Moying, I...” I was wrong. I really shouldn’t have acted so impulsively. It was me... I was too selfish and didn’t consider your feelings... I promise you, I’ll never do it again. Really, I can guarantee it!”","If it weren’t for the fact that her four limbs were powerless and unable to move, Huang Yueli would have wanted to be like the ordinary people of the Soaring","Heavens Continent, raising her right index finger and swearing to the heavens.","However, Li Moying’s face was still sombre and his mood was obviously still heavy.","Huang Yueli pursed her lips and continued, “Moying, just trust me this time. If I do it again, I’ll be struck by lightning and die without burial.... Mmmph!”"]},{"number":4530,"title":"Chapter 4530: These... are all ours!(6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4530: These... are all ours!(6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Before Huang Yueli could finish her words, a strong hand covered her mouth.","She was not able to say anything.","Li Moying’s handsome face was as black as the bottom of a pot,” Li ‘er, you... Are you trying to kill me with anger? How dare you make such a poisonous oath! All right, I believe you, all right? You can’t swear anymore. Even if you don’t keep your word, I can’t do anything to you.","Just pretend that I didn’t say anything!","He was really... destined to fall into the hands of this woman!","Each time, he wanted to teach her a lesson and make her remember, but when he heard her swear, he could no longer hold back.","To put it bluntly, he couldn’t bear to get angry at Huang Yueli, and he couldn’t bear to hear that little fox curse her to death!","Forget it, forget it. Whether the little fox wanted to destroy herself or something else, he would just accompany her.","As Li Moying sighed in his heart, Huang Yueli also stared at him nervously.","Seeing that his handsome face was still tense, she thought for a moment and said, “Husband, I understand what you mean. I promise it won’t be like this in the future. You...” Don’t be angry. Besides, it would be very difficult for me to destroy myself. For example, this time... this time...”","Li Moying recovered from his earlier anger and thought along the lines of her words, realising that something was wrong, “Oh, right, I didn’t get a chance to ask you. I clearly saw you destroy yourself earlier. The fire attribute energy in your dantian exploded. No mortal body can withstand such power. But you... why is it unharmed?”","Upon hearing this, Huang Yueli’s face was filled with doubt.","“I was just about to say that! I also think that this matter is too strange. At that time, I had already made up my mind to save you at any cost. So when I self-destructed my dantian, I did not hold back. Based on my previous experience of self-destruction, my physical body would explode completely in two or three breaths at the most, and my divine sense would last a little longer...”","Huang Yueli was discussing this topic very seriously and didn’t notice that her husband’s face had turned black again.","But Li Moying forcefully suppressed the surging emotions in his chest as he asked, “Then what about this time?”","Huang Yueli replied, “Just when the Profound Energy in my body was surging out like crazy, and my Dantian couldn’t withstand it and was about to explode, I suddenly felt a powerful energy in my body... I can’t explain what it felt like either. In short, the rate at which my Profound Energy was spewing out seemed to have reached a limit. It was as if it was frozen and couldn’t move. My Dantian was also retracted by an invisible force...”","“What did you say? How could this happen?” Li Moying’s face was filled with shock.","Even though he was the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan and thought that his knowledge and experience were extensive, this kind of situation was truly unheard of.","Huang Yueli replied: “I don’t know either. At that time, I wanted to burst out with all my might, but I couldn’t. I don’t know how hurt I was! If not, Rui Jiang would have died then. How could he have attacked you later?”","She knew better than anyone else that it was possible for a cultivator to self-destruct and explode with a power ten times greater than his own. With her talent, it was even more than that.","In addition, she had a large number of high-level Spirit Armaments, so it was almost certain that she would kill Rui Jiang in one fell swoop.","The two of them should have died together.","But because of the sudden change in Huang Yueli’s body, she was able to save both of their lives.."]},{"number":4531,"title":"Chapter 4531: These... are all ours!(7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4531: These... are all ours!(7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“This... It’s really hard to understand...”","Li Moying’s brows furrowed tightly as no matter how he thought about it, he couldn’t understand what was going on.","If it wasn’t Huang Yueli who said those words, he would have already concluded that she was lying to him.","But his Li ‘er would never lie to him.","He thought for a moment and simply stretched out three fingers to place them on Huang Yueli’s wrist to probe the situation inside her body.","The two of them had the same Profound Energy due to their dual cultivation, and slowly entered Huang Yueli’s meridians.","Almost as soon as he entered, Li Moying felt a suction force coming from Huang Yueli’s dantian, tightly wrapping around his Profound Energy and sucking it towards Huang Yueli’s body.","However, since Huang Yueli’s body was weak, this suction wasn’t very strong, so he could easily retreat backwards.","Li Moying frowned and thought for a moment, but he didn’t decide to let Huang Yueli go. Instead, he increased his Profound Energy and probed her meridians again.","This time, as expected, his Profound Energy was absorbed again.","The suction power of Huang Yueli’s Dantian... It seemed to be slowly increasing!","Towards the end, it was almost as if it was hungrily clinging to him, even causing the Profound Energy in Li Moying’s body to flow into Huang Yueli’s body.","At the same time, Huang Yueli let out a soft groan, “Moying, you...” What are you doing? Let go... Let go of me! Hurry up and let go!”","As she said this, she waved her wrist and threw Li Moying’s hand away.","The connection of the Profound Energy was instantly severed.","Li Moying was stunned for a moment before he was overjoyed, “Li Jer, you...","can you move?”","Huang Yueli was also startled.","When she raised her hand earlier, it was a completely unconscious action, and she was afraid that she would absorb too much of Li Moying’s Profound Energy, causing harm to the other party, so she wanted to shake him off. Only now did she react, she... she could actually move?","Huang Yueli hastily raised her hand again.","Unlike her previous state where her body was as heavy as a thousand pounds, this time, she successfully raised her right hand. However, this action was much more difficult than when she was healthy. It was also quite strenuous.","When she raised her wrist to her shoulder, no matter how hard she tried, she could not raise it higher.","Moreover, this simple action made her breathless, and beads of sweat appeared on her forehead.","“Tsk, why can I only move so much!” Huang Yueli frowned in disgust.","For a powerful cultivator like her, this weak and powerless state was probably what she hated most.","She lowered her right hand and put her elbows on the ground. She exerted her strength and tried to sit up.","It was obviously more difficult than raising her hand just now. Her back rose only three centimetres before she lost all strength and fell back to the ground.","“Li’er, what are you doing? Your body hasn’t recovered yet. Don’t try to be brave! ”","Li Moying caught her falling body in time, his eyebrows furrowed as he glared at her.","His Li ‘er was good at everything, but she was too stubborn.. She was already injured to this extent, so why was she still fighting? Couldn’t she just obediently lean into her husband’s embrace and let him take care of her and protect her?"]},{"number":4532,"title":"Chapter 4532: These...are all ours!(8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4532: These...are all ours!(8)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli was quite indignant as she leaned her head against his neck, her lips puckered in discontent: “What’s going on? We were both at the peak of the Profound Heart Realm, but after a fight to the death, you successfully broke through in battle, while I... Not to mention breaking through, he even fell to the ground and couldn’t move?”","This was too unfair!","Seeing her indignant look, Li Moying couldn’t help but burst out laughing as he reached out to pinch her little face with puffed up cheeks.","“Li ‘er, have you not reconciled? I reached the peak of the Profound Heart Realm more than half a year before you, so it’s normal for me to break through before you. Besides, who was the one who destroyed himself without worrying about his own safety? You’re already extremely lucky that your cultivation hasn’t regressed! Let’s see if you still dare to do it in the future!","Huang Yueli felt a bit depressed, but she also knew that what Li Moying said was trie","The self-destruction just now had seriously damaged the energy channels in his body. It was a complete fool’s dream to break through at this time. It was already very unexpected that he could save his life.","However, she did not regret the decision she had just made.","“It seems that you are exhausted because the Profound Energy in your meridians is depleted. I have injected you with my Profound Energy and you can move again. That way, I can be at ease. As long as I give you some more Profound Energy, you might be able to return to normal by tonight.","Li Moying’s voice interrupted Huang Yueli’s distracted state.","She quickly turned her head to see Li Moying extend his hand again. This time, it wasn’t on her wrist, but on her back.","Huang Yueli unconsciously wanted to push him away, “No, Moying! You have just advanced, and your own realm is not yet stable. How can you waste so much Profound Energy? I can do it myself... Oh!”","Before she could finish her words, her back felt hot and a strong Profound Energy suddenly rushed into her body.","Li Moying’s Profound Energy had always been incomparably powerful, and now that he had entered the Dao Profound Realm, it was even sharper than before.","Even though he had taken Huang Yueli’s injuries into consideration and deliberately weakened his Profound Energy, the moment the Profound Energy entered her body, it still made Huang Yueli’s entire body tremble.","She had to use 120% of her energy to absorb that much Profound Energy and protect her meridians from being damaged by the impact.","As a result, she didn’t have any energy left to argue with Li Moying.","Li Moying looked at the little fox in his embrace who was biting his lips in pain as the corners of his lips turned up slightly, “You’re underestimating your husband too much. It’s just that little bit of Profound Energy... .... Don’t worry, my kingdom is very stable. You should worry about yourself! If you still want to progress, don’t reject me. The most important thing is to heal your injuries quickly.”","Huang Yueli remained silent.","Of course, she couldn’t say anything now.","Because Li Moying was too vile, deliberately maintaining such a large amount of Profound Energy input just to force her not to have the time to speak.","Huang Yueli’s stomach was filled with worry, but unfortunately, she couldn’t express it, and she didn’t dare to forcefully break the connection between them.","After all, the moment it was forcibly terminated, Li Moying, as the person who had transfused it, would definitely suffer a backlash and be seriously injured! The two of them sat on the scorched earth, one in front and one behind.","After Li Moying’s Profound Energy gradually seeped in, Huang Yueli suddenly felt a burning sensation rising from her lower abdomen.."]},{"number":4533,"title":"Chapter 4533: These... are all ours!(9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4533: These... are all ours!(9)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","This kind of feeling was similar to the feeling she had when she was cultivating with Li Moying.","However, it seemed different.","Normally, at this time, her legs would have gone limp and she would have had to use all her self-control not to plunge into Li Moyings embrace.","But now, she didn’t have the impulse to pounce on Li Moying at all. On the contrary, she unconsciously turned her elbow back and slapped Li Moying’s chest.","“Enough!” Huang Yueli’s eyes suddenly opened.","Li Moying didn’t expect his wife to suddenly attack him in his embrace and was surprised when he felt a moment of pain.","” Li ‘er?!”","” Moying, I’m fine, let me go!” Huang Yueli said calmly.","Li Moying gave her a glance as his eyes were filled with doubt, but he didn’t say anything as he slowly withdrew his power.","Earlier, the auras in their bodies had already completely merged, and he could clearly feel that Huang Yueli’s dantian and meridians were almost filled with the Profound Energy he had injected. Moreover, the absorption speed was getting faster and faster, and there was a moment when he couldn’t control himself because he had the misconception that he was being sucked dry by","Huang Yueli.","“Li ‘er, you... How was it? How do you feel now?”","After the two of them parted, Li Moying’s face turned pale and he even started to gasp slightly.","However, he didn’t bother to adjust himself at all as he leaned in front of Huang Yueli and looked at her with a frown.","Huang Yueli said hastily: “I feel very good now, really! Look, I can even stand up.”","As she spoke, she pushed herself to the ground with her hand.","Li Moying didn’t even have time to stop her when he saw Huang Yueli standing in front of him. Apart from the tattered clothes on her body, which looked extremely pitiful, the rest was no different than usual.","Huang Yueli moved her hands, lifted her feet and jumped a little, but there wasn’t any problem.","She couldn’t help but smile, “This is great. It looks like our guess was right. I’ve just used up all my Profound Energy. As long as I can get the Profound Energy from the same source, I will be able to recover.","Li Moying finally let out a long breath as his heart, which had been hanging in his throat all night, finally fell to the ground.","The two of them sat down on the ground again, crossed their legs, and adopted the standard posture for cultivation. They began to regulate their internal breathing.","When they opened their eyes again, the sky was already bright.","Unknowingly, they had already spent two days and two nights in the wilderness.","Huang Yueli stretched her stiff body that had been sitting for too long and stretched lazily, “This is great, I feel like I’m alive again! Unfortunately, I don’t know how long it will take for me to progress after this...”","Even though Li Moying had already replenished the Profound Energy in her body, the Profound Energy from the same source was different from what she had cultivated.","Not to mention, Li Moying’s Profound Energy was mainly attributed to thunder, while her main cultivation method was attributed to fire!","Even with the help of the Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual, which allowed her to absorb Li Moying’s energy, she could only absorb a portion of it. Moreover, if she wanted to completely transform it for her own use, she would still need to spend some time refining it.","Upon hearing her voice, Li Moying’s long and cold eyes slowly opened.","The moment he opened his eyes, the sharp coldness in his eyes could almost freeze the surroundings.","But when his gaze landed on Huang Yueli, the coldness in his eyes instantly disappeared.."]},{"number":4534,"title":"Chapter 4534: These...are all ours!(10)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4534: These...are all ours!(10)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","There was even a hint of a smile on his face.","“If you want to advance smoothly, then you must not joke with your life in the future!” Li Moying lowered his voice as he once again warned his disobedient wife.","Huang Yueli grumbled indignantly, “Aren’t you the same? You’re lucky this time. Not only did you not die, but you even advanced! If you really die trying to save me... Hmph, I’ll make you a cuckold!”","” What did you say?!” Li Moying’s gaze immediately turned dangerous again.","The powerhouses of the Dao Profound Realm had already achieved the recognition of the Dao of Heaven and Earth. Even a single gaze carried an astonishing amount of power.","However, this didn’t scare Huang Yueli at all.","Not only did she not panic at all, but she even smiled with curved eyes.","Husband, didn’t you hear me clearly? Then I’ll say it again. If you really die here to save me, I’ll put it on your head... mmmph!”","Li Moying was furious, but he couldn’t do anything to the little fox.","In a moment of desperation, he simply grabbed her and firmly blocked her lips, preventing her from saying any more things that would hurt his heart.","“Li ‘er, if you want to find another man, you really are dreaming! Let me tell you, I will definitely live well. I will live longer than anyone else, and I will be stronger than anyone else. So you’d better stay obediently by my side...”","He looked at the sky and saw that it was getting late. He frowned slightly. We shouldn’t stay here for long. With Rui Jiang dead, the remaining Devil Army is no longer a threat. We should return to the Twelve Continents of the God Clan as soon as possible. The wilderness doesn’t even have a doctor.","Although Huang Yueli looked better now, Li Moying’s heart was still uneasy.","Huang Yueli had already destroyed herself, but at the end of the day, she was just exhausted?","Moreover, just by absorbing a little bit of his Profound Energy, she would actually get better?","How could there be such a cheap thing in the world!","In the past, it wasn’t like Huang Yueli hadn’t self-destructed before, so why didn’t she have such shocking defensive and recovery abilities?","No matter how he thought about it, this matter was not normal.","So Li Moying no longer cared about the discussion he had with Huang Yueli earlier, he had to go out and train until he broke through to the Life Profound Realm before returning to the clan.","The most important thing was to find a miracle doctor to treat Huang Yueli. Huang Yueli thought for a moment and nodded, “All right, you’re right. We should indeed go back. However, it’s not appropriate for us to leave like this. Xuan Chaoyi and the others are still in the Devil’s Camp. If there’s real chaos, their lives will be in danger. We promised to bring them back to the Blessed City, so we can’t go back on our word.","Li Moying frowned as he remembered that there was still a small team of scouts from the Ancient God Clan that they had intercepted halfway, and they were still trapped in the Devil Clan’s camp.","As far as he was concerned, even one of his wife’s fingers was more important than the lives of those people.","But he knew that Huang Yueli had always valued promises and would definitely insist on going back.","Although he was unhappy, he could only nod his head in agreement.","Huang Yueli gave him a slight smile as she lightly pecked his face, “Husband, you’re so nice!”","A soft touch suddenly landed on his face, and Li Moying was startled as he unconsciously reached out to hug his little fox.","However, Huang Yueli’s movements were quick and she had already moved away from his side. She turned her head and ran towards Rui Jiang’s body.","Her watery eyes were wide open and the bottoms of her eyes were shining. The word “money-grubber” was almost written on her face.","‘ Rui Jiang is a powerhouse at the peak of the Sky Devil Realm, equivalent to the peak of the Dao Profound Realm. He’s definitely very rich! There’s also this cave dwelling left behind by this mysterious devil expert. There must be a lot of treasures inside.. Now they’re all ours!"]},{"number":4535,"title":"Chapter 4535: King Xiang’s Talisman Array (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4535: King Xiang’s Talisman Array (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When Li Moying heard this, he was stunned for a moment before shaking his head in amusement.","His little fox was the most excited when she saw treasures.","Li ‘er had grown up in a large sect from the moment she was born, and due to her outstanding natural talent, she had been accepted as a closed disciple of the Sect Master at a very young age. It could be said that she had never experienced a single day of poverty.","In the past, Li Moying had never understood why she loved earning money so much.","It wasn’t until he was reborn that he came to his senses.","He always felt that Huang Yueli liked the feeling of seeing others aggrieved and depressed after cheating others of their money. Even though they hated her, they couldn’t beat her to death...","It could be said that it was quite a bad taste.","Li Moying released his hand, and Huang Yueli immediately ran over to Rui Jiang’s body and crouched down.","Rui Jiang’s death was rather miserable, as Li Moying’s Lightning had pierced his chest and blown up his entire body. Even his face wasn’t recognisable, and he looked like a charred corpse.","If it was an ordinary young female practitioner, she would definitely be disgusted, but Huang Yueli was obviously no ordinary person.","It was impossible to tell what material this token was made of just by looking at it. On the surface, it looked like gold but not gold, like jade but not jade, but it had a faint sheen.","The outside of the token was shiny and translucent, and even though it had been struck by Li Moying’s lightning, it didn’t leave any damage or stains, looking like it was brand new, clean and tidy.","There was a huge ‘Xiang’ character engraved on the front of the token, and a blank space on the back.","Huang Yueli took the token and gently fumbled with it, deep in thought.","Li Moying walked up behind her and his gaze landed on the talisman as he raised his eyebrows and asked, “This... Is it the talisman that Rui Jiang used to increase the strength of the Devil Army?”","Huang Yueli nodded her head as her finger traced the lines of the ‘Xiang’ character in the middle of the talisman, her expression filled with astonishment.","“I wonder which senior left this talisman behind. It’s too powerful and incredible! Originally, I thought that the array patterns engraved on the multiple-use talisman array would be very complicated. Who would have thought it would be so simple? Not only was it simple, but this Spirit Armament Master had also incorporated the array pattern into his name... It’s simply miraculous!","As the saying goes, outsiders watch the show, while insiders watch the door.","Huang Yueli herself was an extremely excellent Spirit Armament Master and Array Master, so she could sense how high the level of the senior who had refined this talisman was!","It was already very difficult to carve this Talisman Array, and he had even simplified and fused the Talisman Array to such an extent...","Not to mention that Huang Yueli couldn’t do it now, if she hadn’t seen it with her own eyes, she would have found it hard to believe that the peak of the array techniques could reach such a high level!","She had always thought highly of herself. Even in the God Realm, she did not feel that her talent in Array Techniques would lose out to others.","However, in the face of this senior’s achievements, she could onlv sav that she was convinced.","“Amazing, truly amazing! Who was the senior who could refine this tile? With his accomplishments, he must also be an extremely famous Array Master in the God Realm, right? Could the ‘Xiang’ character on this talisman be his name?” Huang Yueli muttered to herself.."]},{"number":4536,"title":"Chapter 4536: King Xiang’s Formation Talisman (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4536: King Xiang’s Formation Talisman (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Seniors with the word ‘Xiang’ in their names have to be proficient in both","Spirit Armament techniques and array techniques...”","Huang Yueli frowned slightly as she sank into deep thought.","However, she had not been in the God Realm for long. Most of the time, she had been out training. Even if she read some ancient books, she would mainly focus on practical use. She knew very little about the ancient history of the God Realm. She could not figure out who this senior was.","On the other hand, Li Moying, after pondering for a moment, exclaimed in astonishment,” There’s ‘Xiang’ in the name...” Could it be the legendary Senior King Xiang?”","When Huang Yueli heard that, she turned around to look at her husband, feeling even more puzzled.","“King Xiang? What King Xiang? Would there be anyone with such a name? Or could it be...Was this a title?","However, isn’t there no such title in the God Realm?”","In Soaring Heavens Continent, every country in the continent would have their own emperor and the emperor would also enfeoffment the dukes or even the kings.","Like Li Moying back then in South Yue Kingdom, he also had the title of ‘Prince","However, in the God Realm, there was no such thing as a Conferred King.","However, these were all ranks formed around the family. They were completely different from the ranks of the lower realm’s emperors and generals.","Li Moying smiled and replied,” There isn’t any now but in the ancient times billions of years ago, the God Realm...” There was actually a royal family! Don’t tell me you don’t know about it, Li ‘er?”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment,” This...l have indeed read about it in some ancient books before. However, this... Wasn’t this something that happened billions of years ago? Those that could be passed down were probably no longer verified. They were just rumors...","Don’t tell me that this talisman is an antique from hundreds of millions of years ago? That’s too exaggerated...’","Even in the God Realm, trillions of years was an extremely long period of time. It was so long that even a peerless expert at the peak of the Profound Life Realm would not be able to live past one percent of it.","In such a long history, everything that existed could be considered to have turned to ashes.","If this talisman was really something from so long ago...","Not to mention that it was such a powerful artifact, even if it was an ordinary stone, it would be priceless!","Li Moying slowly replied,” I originally felt that it was impossible. However, the word ‘Xiang’ is engraved on this talisman, which reminds me of a legendary person...”","Huang Yueli didn’t make a sound but used her eyes to express the doubts in her heart.","Li Moying smiled as he pulled her to sit down at the side,” It’s a long story so I’ll tell you slowly.”","Li Moying slowly explained what he knew.","The expression on Huang Yueli’s face grew more and more astonished.","According to the ancient records passed down by Cloudy Qilin Clan, billions of years ago, the God Realm had an imperial clan. Moreover, these imperial clans were the predecessor of the current True Dragon Clan!","As for the other eleven great Ancient God Clans including Cloudy Qilin Clan and Sacred Phoenix Clan, they were merely feudal lords.","Back then, the concentration of Heaven and Earth Dark Force in the God Realm was a hundred times higher than now and there were many strong practitioners.","The Veracious Wyvern Clan was able to lead all the Ancient God Clans and establish their own imperial power.. They could only rely on their absolute strength to crush the heroes!"]},{"number":4537,"title":"Chapter 4537: King Xiang’s Formation Talisman (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4537: King Xiang’s Formation Talisman (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Legend had it that the True Dragon Race was indeed born in accordance with the Heavenly Dao, and their talent was indeed superior to others.","This was still reflected in the Veracious Wyvern Clan.","That was because the True Dragon Race was the only Ancient God Clan among the twelve great Ancient God Clans that did not have a main attribute.","Sacred Phoenix Clan’s ancient martial art practitioners ‘main attribute was fire attribute while Cloudy Qilin Clan’s was lightning attribute. But True Dragon Clan, any attribute was possible and there were no rules to follow. Even if they were biological father and son, they could have completely different attributes.","However, even though the True Dragons had retained this part of their ancestor’s characteristics, they were no longer as powerful.","It was also because the True Dragon Race’s talent had been weakening over time that they were besieged by the other eleven great Ancient God Clans. In the end, they could only announce their abdication. After tens of millions of years of chaotic warfare, the current situation of relative harmony between the Ancient God Clans had been formed.","As for exactly how the True Dragons had weakened, it was already impossible to verify.","In short, for a long time, the various great Ancient God Clans bowed their heads to the True Dragon clan.","In the God Realm, it was known as the period of imperial power.","At that time, every tribe’s leader had to first obtain the approval of the Veracious Wyvern Clan’s Emperor before being bestowed the title of King of a different surname.","“It’s said that King Xiang was one of the Sacred Phoenix Race’s clan leaders during the ancient imperial era. He was the most powerful Spirit Armament Master and array master during the ancient era! At that time, the concentration of Profound Qi in the world was shocking, and treasures were everywhere. Therefore, not only were there many experts in the Profound Life","Realm, but the level of the Spiritual Blacksmith profession at that time was also beyond our imagination.”","Li Moying recalled the records he had read in the ancient records as his eyes slowly narrowed, his heart was filled with longing towards that era where heroes rose up together.","Unfortunately, no matter what, they would never be able to experience it.","“Let me give you an example. The mountain-protecting array formations that the various Ancient God Clans have set up around their holy lands are all passed down from ancient times without exception. There are also some array formations used to deal with the Devil Clan that have also been passed down from ancient times. Unfortunately, there are too few of these things left behind...","When Huang Yueli heard this, she revealed a look of realization.","When she had just returned to the Sacred Phoenix Continent, she had already researched the Sacred Phoenix Race’s ultimate mountain protecting array formation. At that time, she had already felt abnormally amazed. There was actually someone who could design such an exquisite array formation. The array patterns involved were so complicated, the engineering was so vast, it was hard to imagine.","This required the cooperation of at least a hundred Array Masters with similar talent as her, and also the cooperation of tens of thousands of cultivators above the Heart Profound Realm. It would take many years before it could be completed.","In the current God Realm, to be able to reach Huang Yueli’s innate talent, the various great Ancient God Clans added together were less than five in number.","It was impossible to rebuild such a project.","“So, you think that this talisman was refined by King Xiang? However, it was not impossible. With the God Realm’s current spirit artifact techniques, it’s indeed impossible to refine an Talisman Array that can be used repeatedly and can cover tens of thousands of people. This can only be left behind from ancient times.”","Huang Yueli pondered for a moment and had to admit that her husband’s judgement was correct.","She couldn’t help but sigh, “I didn’t expect that the most outstanding Spirit Armament Master in ancient times was actually from our Sacred Phoenix","Race!” Unfortunately, I don’t know where Rui Jiang obtained this Talisman Array.. Did senior Xiang King leave behind other relics...”"]},{"number":4538,"title":"Chapter 4538: King Xiang’s Formation Talisman (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4538: King Xiang’s Formation Talisman (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“If I had known earlier, I wouldn’t have killed Rui Jiang so quickly!”","Huang Yueli pursed her lips in pity.","As a spirit artifact master, she wanted more of King Xiang’s relics than anyone else.","Even though a treasure like King Xiang’s Talisman Array was precious, it was not what she wanted the most. What she wanted to see more was the inheritance left behind by King Xiang!","If there was, even if she couldn’t advance to such a high realm, as long as she could act like a senior expert, it would be enough to satisfy her pursuit as a Spirit Armament Master.","But although Huang Yueli said that, she was very clear in her heart that even if Rui Jiang was still alive, he probably wouldn’t know about the inheritance of King Xiang.","If he knew, he would have gone by himself long ago. How could he die in her and Li Moying’s hands so aggrieved?","Li Moying could see Huang Yueli’s disappointment as he leaned over and gently held her shoulders.","“Li ‘er, you don’t need to be overly concerned about these. Actually, since the ancient times, the God Realm’s best spirit artifact masters had always appeared in the Sacred Phoenix Race. The Sacred Phoenix Race’s artifact refinement talent definitely far surpassed the other Ancient God Clans. Even in ancient times, a Deity grade genius like you was very rare. Perhaps your talent in artifact refinement will surpass that of your predecessors. In the future, it might not be impossible to refine a better Spirit Armament than this.”","Hearing that, Huang Yueli’s lips curled into a smile.","Especially since her husband was exceptionally handsome, and his deep and exquisite black eyes were focused on her!","“I hope that it will be as husband has said...”","Atter all, this was an illusory matter so Huang Yueli only hesitated tor a moment before putting it down.","There were still many more important things waiting for her to deal with!","For example, continue to count their spoils of war and calculate how much money they had made this time.","Another example was to try out the Ancient Talisman Array that he had obtained with great difficulty..","Huang Yueli held King Xiang’s Talisman Array in her hand and with a look of eagerness, she said: ” Speaking of which, I haven’t tried out how to use this Talisman Array! Why don’t I try it out first? Rui Jiang used this Talisman Array alone and was actually able to breakthrough to the Devil Overlord Realm. Then I’m only at the Heart Profound Realm right now. Breaking through to middle-stage Dao Profound Realm shouldn’t be a problem, right? Why don’t","Before she could finish her sentence, she suddenly felt that her hand was empty.","Turning around, he saw that King Xiang’s Talisman Array was already in Li Moying’s hands.","“Husband?” Huang Yueli was stunned.","Li Moying’s lips curled up lightly,” Don’t try it, this is too dangerous. Who knows what kind of side effects there will be after forcefully breaking through the King Xiang’s talisman. If it damages your meridians or even your cultivation foundation, then the gains won’t make up for the losses. Let me do","“I don’t think that’s possible. Rui Jiang isn’t a fool. If he dared to use this talisman, it means that there aren’t too serious consequences. Besides, if there’s any harm, what’s the difference between you and me trying? I know array techniques better than you, or I...Wait, are you listening to me?!” Huang Yueli wanted to snatch the Talisman Array back.","But Li Moying didn’t say a word as he directly injected his Profound Energy into the talisman.","Huang Yueli couldn’t stop him in time so she could only widen her eyes as she stared unblinkingly at Li Moying, afraid that he would meet with any mishaps and she wouldn’t be able to help him in time.","However, the result was completely beyond her expectations.."]},{"number":4539,"title":"Chapter 4539: King Xiang’s Formation Talisman (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4539: King Xiang’s Formation Talisman (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","One breath, two breaths, three breaths...","Ten breaths, twenty breaths...","Nearly a quarter of an hour had passed but Li Moying still didn’t move at all and his body didn’t show any different changes from before.","The King Xiang Talisman Array was lying quietly in his palm, just like an ordinary token.","Huang Yueli was stunned for quite a while before she walked over and frowned as she looked at the talisman.","“What happened? Don’t tell me you can’t use it?”","Li Moying’s brows creased slightly but he didn’t say anything as he just nodded his head.","Huang Yueli saw his expression and became even more puzzled,” How can you not be able to use it? Even a devil like Rui Jiang can use it. Could it be that he needs some special driving method?”","This time, Li Moying really couldn’t answer,” This...l don’t know what’s going on. However, King Xiang’s Talisman Array doesn’t seem to have any reaction to my Profound Energy.”","Huang Yueli looked at his slightly embarrassed handsome face as her lips curled up. Stretching out two fingers, she took the Xiang King’s Talisman Array from his hand.","Huang Yueli waved her hand and dismissed her husband. Once again, she held King Xiang’s talisman in her palm and tried to infuse her Profound Energy into it.","Indeed, just like what Li Moying had said, after King Xiang’s Talisman Array absorbed her Profound Energy, it was like a clay ox entering the sea, without any reaction.","Huang Yueli injected a bit of evil qi into it.","Although she didn’t think that this talisman was specially refined for the devils, since Rui Jiang could drive it, perhaps it would be more effective to use the evil qi that had the same origin as the devilic energy.","However, such an attempt also ended in failure.","No matter what fancy method Huang Yueli used to inject Profound Energy, the Talisman Array didn’t show any signs of being activated.","Li Moying walked over and held her small hand,” Alright, don’t try anymore.","I’ve tried all sorts of methods earlier but the talisman didn’t have any reaction. Looks like ordinary methods might not be suitable. There’s another mystery hidden within this talisman...”","Huang Yueli’s brows furrowed even tighter,” But this doesn’t make sense? Even Rui Jiang could drive it...The devils are very ignorant of spiritual artifact techniques and array techniques...”","She stared at the Talisman Array in a daze as she quickly calculated the composition of these array patterns and the changes they could cause by guiding the Xuan Energy of Heaven and Earth.","The array patterns left behind by His Highness King Xiang were very different from the array patterns of the Ancient God Clan that Huang Yueli had seen before. Although it didn’t look complicated on the surface, but when she really wanted to analyze it, she would discover that these seemingly simple patterns had formed too many changes, complicated and complicated, so she couldn’t figure it out in a short period of time.","Li Moying saw that Huang Yueli was lost in her thoughts as she stared at the Talisman Array and didn’t say anything to disturb her.","Instead, he lightened his footsteps and walked to Rui Jiang’s corpse.","He pulled Rui Jiang’s wrist and took a space ring from his finger.","The interspatial ring of a powerhouse at the peak of the otherworldly devil realm was naturally attached with a powerful restriction.","However, the people of Rui Jiang were already dead. No matter how powerful the spiritual imprint left behind was, it was much dimmer now.","Li Moying directly used brute force to destroy it and without much effort, he crushed Rui Jiang’s spiritual imprint and sent his own consciousness into the ring.","As the lord of the Vermillion Light Collet, Rui Jiang’s wealth had exceeded his expectations.","The ring was filled to the brim.."]},{"number":4540,"title":"Chapter 4540: King Xiang’s Formation Talisman (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4540: King Xiang’s Formation Talisman (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying’s lips revealed a trace of a smile as he turned around to call out to his little fox.","“Li ‘er, don’t stare at that talisman first and come over to take a look. Rui Jiang has quite a number of treasures on him, you will definitely like it. Moreover, he might have the method to activate King Xiang’s formation talisman!”","When Huang Yueli heard that, she felt that it made sense as she immediately stood up and walked towards him.","“How was it? Did you find anything good? Let me see...”","She watched as Li Moying took out the items from Rui Jiang’s interspatial ring one by one and laid them out on the ground as her eyes became brighter and brighter.","Rui Jiang’s storage ring was mostly filled with all kinds of heavenly and earthly treasures. At least 70% of the space was filled with these things.","Moreover, these natural treasures were rare items that were priceless in the twelve continents of the God Clan.","This was because most of the Heavenly Materials and Earthly Treasures of the Immortal Realm grew in the desolate wilderness or in the secret forests. These places were outside the twelve continents of the God Clan. Most of them were occupied by the Demon Clan.","Therefore, it was much easier for the fiend race to obtain these materials than for the god race.","Moreover, these materials contained extremely dense demonic qi, which could be directly used by the demons for cultivation.","Humans and demons could only use a small portion of these materials directly, and most of the energy would dissipate. However, it was completely different for demons.","Therefore, after the fiend race found heavenly and earthly treasures, most of them would directly refine them to increase their cultivation, unlike the human race and the god race, who used them to refine various spirit weapons and spirit medicines.","This could be considered the racial advantage of the demon race. However, it was precisely because it was too easy for them to refine heavenly and earthly treasures that they were far behind the twelve continents of the god race in terms of skills such as spirit weapon techniques and spirit medicine techniques.","After all, there was no need for them to refine these things before they started the war with the Shen clan.","These things that Auspicious River had hoarded were naturally also used for cultivation.","But now that it had fallen into Huang Yueli’s hands, the effect was huge.","Huang Yueli sorted out these natural treasures and stored them in the Sky Phoenix Ring’s space as she started to calculate in her heart.","“These are all top-notch materials used to strengthen ling armor! That’s great. I was just worried that I wouldn’t be able to refine a better armor for my husband. Now, someone is really giving me a pillow when I’m sleepy...","“Could these medicinal herbs be the legendary...Azure Sky Spirit Bamboo? This was the best material to refine the Nine Revolutions Soul Returning Pill! I also have this pill formula, but it’s a little wasteful for me to refine it. I’d better bring it back to senior brother. He will definitely be happy to see it...”","“There are also these...’","When Huang Yueli was packing up her things, Li Moying had been smiling at her from the side.","Every time she counted the money, the little fox’s expression was the richest.","That kind of glowing expression sometimes made him really unable to hold back his laughter.","After a while, Huang Yueli kept all the treasures and continued to look at the remaining items.","In Rui Jiang’s ring, the second most abundant items were all kinds of magic nuclei and magic crystals.","Huang Yueli stared at those colorful stones that were piled up into a small hill and said thoughtfully: ” Magic cores are left behind by various magical beasts after their death.. Auspicious River collected these things, it should be for cultivation! However, wasn’t the Magic Stone the energy core nurtured in the body of a demon? Why did he collect these?”"]},{"number":4541,"title":"Chapter 4541: The secret of the cave abode (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4541: The secret of the cave abode (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying’s lips revealed a trace of a smile as he turned around to call out to his little fox.","“Li ‘er, don’t stare at that talisman first and come over to take a look. Rui Jiang has quite a number of treasures on him, you will definitely like it. Moreover, he might have the method to activate King Xiang’s Talisman Array!”","When Huang Yueli heard that, she felt that it made sense as she immediately stood up and walked towards him.","“How was it? Did you find anything good? Let me see...”","She watched as Li Moying took out the items from Rui Jiang’s interspatial ring one by one and laid them out on the ground as her eyes became brighter and brighter.","Rui Jiang’s storage ring was mostly filled with all kinds of heavenly and earthly treasures. At least 70% of the space was filled with these things.","Moreover, these natural treasures were rare items that were priceless in the twelve continents of the God Clan.","This was because most of the Heavenly Materials and Earthly Treasures of the Immortal Realm grew in the desolate wilderness or in the secret forests. These places were outside the twelve continents of the God Clan. Most of them were occupied by the devil Clan.","Therefore, it was much easier for the Devil Clan to obtain these materials than for the Ancient God Clan.","Moreover, these materials contained extremely dense devil qi, which could be directly used by the devils for cultivation.","Humans and devils could only use a small portion of these materials directly, and most of the energy would dissipate. However, it was completely different for devils.","Therefore, after the Devil Clan found heavenly and earthly treasures, most of them would directly refine them to increase their cultivation, unlike the human race and the Ancient God Clan, who used them to refine various Spirit Armaments and spirit medicines.","This could be considered the racial advantage of the Devil Clan. However, it was precisely because it was too easy for them to refine heavenly and earthly treasures that they were far behind the twelve continents of the Ancient God Clan in terms of skills such as Spirit Armament techniques and spirit medicine techniques.","After all, there was no need for them to refine these things before they started the war with the Ancient God Clan.","These things that Rui Jiang had hoarded were naturally also used for cultivation.","But now that it had fallen into Huang Yueli’s hands, the effect was huge.","Huang Yueli sorted out these natural treasures and stored them in the Sky Phoenix Ring’s space as she started to calculate in her heart.","“These are all top-notch materials used to strengthen ling armor! That’s great. I was just worried that I wouldn’t be able to refine a better armor for my husband. Now, someone is really giving me a pillow when I’m sleepy...”","“Could these medicinal herbs be the legendary...Azure Sky Spirit Bamboo? This was the best material to refine the Nine Revolutions Soul Returning Pill! I also have this pill formula, but it’s a little wasteful for me to refine it. I’d better bring it back to senior brother. He will definitely be happy to see it...”","“There are also these...’","When Huang Yueli was packing up her things, Li Moying had been smiling at her from the side.","Every time she counted the money, the little fox’s expression was the richest.","That kind of glowing expression sometimes made him really unable to hold back his laughter.","After a while, Huang Yueli kept all the treasures and continued to look at the remaining items.","In Rui Jiang’s ring, the second most abundant items were all kinds of magic nuclei and magic crystals.","Huang Yueli stared at those colorful stones that were piled up into a small hill and said thoughtfully: ” Magic cores are left behind by various magical beasts after their death.. Rui Jiang collected these things, it should be for cultivation! However, wasn’t the Magic Stone the energy core nurtured in the body of a devil? Why did he collect these?”"]},{"number":4542,"title":"Chapter 4542: The secret of the cave abode (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4542: The secret of the cave abode (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Because of the huge battle earlier, the originally exquisite thatched cottage had been turned black by the heavenly lightning that Li Moying had summoned, looking as though it would collapse at any moment.","However, it did not fall.","No matter how strange the color of its exterior looked, it was still standing in their line of sight. Moreover, not even a tile on the roof had fallen off.","“I really can’t believe it...Was this cave really built by the devils themselves?”","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but sigh as she turned her head and called out to her husband.","Husband, let’s go in and take a look.”","After she finished speaking, she took a step forward and walked in the direction of the cave abode.","When Li Moying saw this, his face turned black as he shot forward to catch up to her and grabbed her wrist,” What’s the rush? Just now, it was because you were in a hurry to enter that you encountered such a big trouble and almost fell into Rui Jiang’s hands! Let’s go in together!”","Huang Yueli looked innocently at her husband, wanting to say that she had already gone in once and understood all the mechanisms and arrays inside so if she went in again, it wouldn’t be that dangerous.","But after being glared at by Li Moying, she wisely shut her mouth.","Earlier she had almost self-detonated which had angered her husband so if she were to go against him, she might be banned from entering the cave dwelling by Li Moying.","Huang Yueli was still very self-aware. After Li Moying advanced in rank, she was probably not his match for the time being so it was better to be obedient.","She slowed down her footsteps as she walked into the cave dwelling side by side with Li Moying.","After two days and two nights, the mechanisms that Huang Yueli had destroyed in the cave had all been restored to their original state.","However, Huang Yueli had already grasped the pattern within and it wasn’t difficult to crack it again. Without spending much effort, she had destroyed the twelve consecutive illusionary arrays, allowing the lower level hall to be revealed.","“Look, this is the cave abode of that devil senior. These cabinets here should be the relics left behind by that devil. However, I reckon that there isn’t anything good left behind. Rui Jiang must have plundered everything...”","When Huang Yueli came in earlier, she was in a hurry to look for the Talisman Array so although she knew that there were many things hidden in the cabinets in the hall, she didn’t have the time to take a closer look.","Now that she had enough time, she walked over to check.","Sure enough, just as she had guessed, the rest of the things inside were medicinal pills and Spirit Armaments that she looked down on.","However, the dignified Grandmaster Huang naturally didn’t mind that these things weren’t worth much and still kept them all into her space.","After walking around the hall, she stopped and began to re-examine the glittering gold and jade walls around her.","“This hall should only be the upper level of the cave abode. There should be at least one level below, which is where Rui Jiang started cultivating. At that time, Rui Jiang opened a staircase that led to the lower level and suddenly appeared.","Now that the staircase is gone, it should be hidden by some mechanism...”","As Huang Yueli spoke, she walked along the wall as her slender fingers brushed across the wall, trying to find the mechanism.","Li Moying stood silently in the middle of the hall, but his deep eyes were gentle and affectionate, not leaving Huang Yueli for even a moment.","This little fox might not know that the most charming time for her was when she was focused on the Spirit Armament technique that she liked. It seemed... His entire body was glowing.."]},{"number":4543,"title":"Chapter 4543: The secret of the cave abode (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4543: The secret of the cave abode (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli circled around the main hall but didn’t find any clues about the mechanism. This made her a little surprised and she couldn’t help but stop in her tracks.","Li Moying knew that she had encountered a difficult problem but he didn’t make a sound to disturb her.","After so many years of getting along, the two of them had long developed a tacit understanding.","He was very clear that at this moment, what Huang Yueli needed wasn’t concern, but an environment that allowed her to think quietly.","Huang Yueli’s gaze slowly swept across every corner of the hall as her right hand formed a hand seal as she kept calculating in her heart.","In the end, her gaze stopped on the cabinets that she had just searched.","“Husband, help me!”","Huang Yueli didn’t even turn her head as she greeted him.","Li Moying walked over and asked softly,” How is it? Li ‘er, do you have any clues?”","Huang Yueli nodded her head as she pointed to the lines on the side of one of the cabinets and said: ” Husband, I’ll have to trouble you to infuse the evil qi in your body into these array lines...”","Just as her voice fell, Li Moying stretched out his large hand and pressed it on the cabinet. Without any hesitation, he followed Huang Yueli’s instructions and started to infuse his evil aura.","The reason why Huang Yueli didn’t take action personally was because after the failed self-detonation earlier, the evil qi in her body had been consumed quite a bit and she probably didn’t have enough energy to crack the mechanisms in the cave dwelling.","She originally wanted to remind Li Moying beforehand that these array patterns might directly absorb the evil qi in his body, just like the first time she came in. If she encountered such a situation, she shouldn’t be nervous and continue to inject the evil qi. After reaching a certain concentration, she would be able to successfully break the array.","However, before she could finish her words, Li Moying had already started to make his move.","Seemingly, he wasn’t worried at all that if he followed Huang Yueli’s instructions, any accidents would happen.","Upon seeing this, Huang Yueli didn’t say anything more and just watched quietly from the side.","Li Moying placed his hand on the array pattern as he continued to inject evil qi into it. At the start, his brows creased as he had obviously encountered the problem of the evil qi being sucked away but he didn’t doubt Huang Yueli’s judgement at all and didn’t hear her shout to stop as he continued to work steadily.","After half an hour, the walls of the hall suddenly let out a soft cracking sound.","With this sound, the floor of the hall disappeared from their sight.","The two of them seemed to be floating in the air, and below them was a black altar. The surrounding walls were all made of a black stone that emitted silver light.","Huang Yueli had never seen this kind of stone before and could only identify it from the dense devil aura that it emitted. This should be a rare material produced in the devil race’s territory.","“I knew it. The senior who built this cave abode seems to like to use illusions. The array formation on the previous level used an illusion, but this level... It was the same! It’s just that the types of illusions are different...”","As Huang Yueli said that, she looked around for a moment before pointing towards the right,” Husband, look quickly, there’s a staircase over there, let’s go down from there!”","“Alright, let’s go!”","Li Moying nodded his head as he held Huang Yueli’s hand once again.","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment before she burst out laughing. Without saying anything, she brought Li Moying along as they walked towards the stairs.","The two of them slowly walked down. They could clearly feel that the closer they got to the altar, the higher the density of the devil gi.."]},{"number":4544,"title":"Chapter 4544: The secret of the cave abode (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4544: The secret of the cave abode (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When their feet landed on the ground of the altar, the surrounding devil qi seemed to have materialized and gathered around the two of them.","Even if they did not actively circulate their cultivation techniques to absorb it, the devil qi spontaneously surged into their meridians.","Sensing this, Huang Yueli and Li Moying exchanged glances and couldn’t help but frown slightly.","Fortunately, it was the two of them who were here now. They were both people who had already cultivated evil cultivation techniques.","If it were an ordinary human or Ancient God Clan here, being invaded by such dense fiend energy into their bodies, they would probably faint on the spot. Even Dao Profound Realm and above experts would also find it very difficult to fight in this kind of place that lacked heaven and earth profound qi but was rich in fiend energy.","“No wonder the Devil Clan cultivators who built this cave abode did not set up too complicated mechanisms. This is naturally because the Devil Clan’s spiritual artifact skills are not as good as the Ancient God Clan’s. There’s still no need!” Huang Yueli pondered for a moment and sighed softly.","To the Devil Clan, the illusionary formation in this cave dwelling was already as hard to come by as a heavenly book. There was simply no way to crack it.","For the array masters of the Ancient God Clan race, setting up an illusion array was not too difficult. However, without the corresponding devil qi, even if they knew the principle of the array technique, they could not crack it. Even if they managed to crack it, they could not stay in the second level of the cave abode for ten breaths.","Li Moying was also observing the surrounding situation,” You said earlier that Rui Jiang was cultivating on this level and when he heard the commotion, he went up to kill you?”","Huang Yueli nodded her head, ” That’s right, I’m guessing that there are many Spirit Gathering Arrays set up on this wall, used to absorb the surrounding and underground devil qi for the owner of the cave dwelling to cultivate. This is indeed a good place for the mo to cultivate. You can definitely get twice the result with half the effort. No wonder Rui Jiang runs here whenever he has time.”","“To be able to build a cave dwelling specifically for cultivation, this devil expert’s strength is definitely not ordinary. Rui Jiang’s luck was pretty good...l have a guess...” Li Moying thought of something and his voice suddenly paused.","Huang Yueli turned to look at him,” What?”","Li Moying replied,” Who knows, that King Xiang’s Talisman Array might have been found by him in this cave dwelling. If it was the owner of this cave abode, it would make sense for him to have such an Talisman Array. Moreover, Rui","Jiang must have some tricks up his sleeves for storing the Talisman Array here. It’s impossible for him to do this for no reason...”","Huang Yueli suddenly understood,” Husband, you’re absolutely right! Then let’s look carefully again!”","She was already in a hurry to use that King Xiang Talisman Array, so when she heard this, she immediately became spirited and walked around the altar on the second level.","In fact, the altar itself was not big. It was only a circle with a diameter of about five meters. No matter where one stood, one could see the full appearance of the altar.","There was nothing else here other than the piles of black and silver stones. It didn’t look like a place to store talismans.","Huang Yueli circled two to three times but still couldn’t get to the point and finally stopped.","“That’s strange. This seems to be a place used for cultivation, but... What were these stone piles for? Could it really be used as a sacrifice?”","Huang Yueli stared suspiciously at the stone pile in the middle for a while and curiously stretched out her hand to touch the top of the stone pile.","It was too late to say, but it was too fast.","Just as her fingers touched the pile of rocks, the ground under their feet","suddenly sank..."]},{"number":4545,"title":"Chapter 4545: The secret of the cave abode (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4545: The secret of the cave abode (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Not good! Li ‘er, be careful!”","Li Moying’s terrified roar rang out beside Huang Yueli’s ears.","However, at this moment, no matter how fast she reacted, it was too late to escape. She could only fall all the way down.","The tunnel below seemed to be endless and Huang Yueli didn’t know how long she had been falling. Just when she thought that this state of falling wouldn’t stop, she suddenly felt her feet stop.","“Crash!”","There was a loud noise, and then a stream of water rushed into her nose, making her feel suffocated.","Huang Yueli hurriedly waved her arms as she forcefully mobilized the evil qi in her body, allowing the evil qi to seep out of her body to form a spherical defensive body before slowly floating up from the bottom of the water. It took her a lot of effort to move to the shore, climb up, and lay on the ground.","After resting for a few breaths, Huang Yueli took a deep breath and raised her hand to release a trace of flame, illuminating the surroundings.","It was only then that she realized that she seemed to have fallen into a depression in the interior of the mountain. In the middle of the depression was a pitch-black deep pool, so deep that she could not see the bottom. She was surrounded by steep mountain walls, and she did not know how high the top of her head was. She could not see the opening she had fallen into.","This was... What place?","Was it right below the cave abode of that devil expert?","Just as Huang Yueli was deep in thought, suddenly, another sound of water falling could be heard.","Above her head, a black shadow suddenly smashed into the deep pool, causing a huge splash, wetting Huang Yueli’s clothes which she had dried with great difficulty.","However, Huang Yueli totally couldn’t care less about this. Her face immediately revealed a pleasantly surprised expression as she ran towards the direction of the deep pool, shouting loudly: ” Moying, Moying! Is that you?”","“Crash! Crash!”","The stagnant water in the deep pool was stirred and after a moment, Li Moying’s handsome face appeared above the pool.","Borrowing the faint light emitted by Huang Yueli’s flame, one could see his perfect facial features and the black hair that was wet by the pool water. Although he looked a little disheveled, it did not damage his handsome appearance.","It was just that Li Moying’s expression was rather unfriendly and he even glared at Huang Yueli, obviously extremely dissatisfied with her careless action of triggering the mechanism earlier.","Huang Yueli felt a little guilty as she stuck out her tongue,” Husband, this place feels extraordinary. Who knows, there might be some fortuitous encounter! Come ashore first. Do you want me to help you...”","Before she could finish her sentence, her expression suddenly changed and she shouted, “Be careful!”","Just as Li Moying looked towards her, a huge black shadow suddenly shot out from the bottom of the water behind him.","That black shadow was at least eight to nine meters tall and compared to it, Li Moying’s figure was just like a dwarf and was instantly enveloped in the black shadow.","After that black shadow came out of the water, it didn’t stop at all as it smashed towards Li Moying’s direction.","However, before Huang Yueli could give a reminder, Li Moying had already sensed something.","There was no trace of panic on his face. Instead, he revealed a cold smile and sneered.” Where did this vile beast come from? You’re courting death!”","He turned around calmly, and a wisp of evil qi shot out from his fingertip and collided with the black shadow.","At this moment, Huang Yueli’s attack had already reached the black shadow.","Under the joint attack of the two, this seemingly extremely powerful and terrifying black shadow was not a match at all. It was instantly cut into two.."]},{"number":4546,"title":"Chapter 4546: The secret of the cave abode (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4546: The secret of the cave abode (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The two parts of the body fell back into the deep pool.","Water splashed out again, but it quickly returned to normal.","Huang Yueli finally heaved a sigh of relief.","At this moment, Li Moying had also swam out from the deep pool and climbed onto the shore.","The moment Huang Yueli met her husband’s gaze, she shivered and laughed dryly: ” Husband, this...” I can... It could be explained! It was true! I didn’t take the risk on purpose. I didn’t...","Wasn’t there an accident? I thought that after opening that mechanism, we would see a staircase leading down like the one on the previous floor. Who knew...Who knew that I would come to this damn place...”","Li Moying actually knew that this matter couldn’t be blamed on Huang Yueli.","In the ancient mystic realm, any kind of danger could appear. It was not something that could be avoided just by being careful.","Moreover, danger often meant opportunities.","But when he saw Huang Yueli’s figure disappear from his sight, his heart almost stopped...","To marry a wife who was bolder than him, he was destined to spend his entire life worrying.","However, he did not regret it at all.","Li Moying swept her a glance,” You didn’t expect to be transported here so forget about it. But when you activated the mechanism, why didn’t you ask me to go with you? Do you know that after you fell, the entrance closed again? How much effort did I put in to open this entrance again? In the end, I directly smashed the stone in the altar before I saw the entrance...”","“Uh, this...Hehe..","This was really her fault so Huang Yueli didn’t even bother to explain because there was no way to explain...","She had completely forgotten about her husband...","“You little fox!”","Seeing that Li Moying was still fuming, Huang Yueli hurriedly changed the topic.","“Husband, where do you think we are now? Why do I feel that this place...lt looks like a mineral vein.” Huang Yueli pointed to the surrounding mountain walls.","Li Moying glared at her and said,” This should be a mineral vein without a doubt.”","Huang Yue asked curiously: ” But what kind of ores are produced here? When I was collecting materials, I had been to countless mines. Every mine had a unique pattern. Just by looking at the patterns on the mountain wall, I could tell what kind of ore was hidden inside the mountain wall. However, the patterns here... I’ve never seen it before.”","Huang Yueli said as she moved her hand closer to the mountain wall, allowing Li Moying to see the lines on it more clearly.","However, Li Moying didn’t pay any attention to this as he directly opened his mouth to speak,” The ores here should be the ones we saw earlier at the altar on the second level of the cave dwelling. The materials used to build that cultivation chamber.”","Huang Yueli was startled,” You said...ls it that kind of black stone with silver?”","Li Moying nodded his head,” That’s right, don’t you feel that although the devil qi concentration here isn’t comparable to that sacrificial altar, but it’s still so thick that it makes people unable to breathe. Especially the deep pool that we fell into earlier. The temperature of the pool water is really too cold. If it was a practitioner below the Profound Meaning Realm who fell in, I’m afraid they would freeze into an icicle in a few breaths ‘time.”","“However, there is actually a living creature in such a cold pool. Moreover, it is such a huge Magical Beast...The devilic beast I killed just now should be a nine-headed snake that was corroded by devil qi..”"]},{"number":4547,"title":"Chapter 4547: The secret of the cave abode (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4547: The secret of the cave abode (7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Nine-headed snake? The black shadow in the water just now was an enlarged version of the nine-headed snake?” Huang Yueli’s eyes widened in astonishment,” Why didn’t I notice that it has nine heads?”","The nine-headed snake was a type of fierce beast that was very famous in the God Realm. Supposedly, an adult nine-headed snake, each head could reach strength equivalent to Dao Profound Realm.","The nine heads added together could erupt with the power of nine Dao Profound Realm powerhouses.","In the early years, there were often experts who raised this kind of ferocious beast as a helper. However, the Nine-headed Giant Snake was too fierce and bloodthirsty. Sometimes, when it was mad, it would even swallow its own master. In addition, as the Profound Qi density of heaven and earth decreased, the resources needed to raise the Nine-headed Snake increased. As time passed, almost no one in the 12 continents of the God Clan raised the Nine-headed Snake anymore.","Legend had it that there were quite a number of nine-headed snakes in the","Wildlands, and there were even huge nine-headed giant snakes. But Huang Yueli had never ventured deep into the Wildlands so this was her first time seeing the legendary nine-headed snake.","Li Moying smiled as he said,” If I didn’t guess wrongly, Rui Jiang should frequently throw down the Ancient God Clan’s practitioners into this deep pool to feed this nine-headed giant snake. “Therefore, it must have treated me as a new food at the beginning. It didn’t expect me to have such great lethality, so it only popped out one head and wanted to devour me. In the end...”","The result was obvious. He didn’t get to eat the food, but he lost his head.","Huang Yueli had heard before that the nine heads of a nine-headed snake were actually nine lives. As long as one head was chopped off, one life would be lost.","Of course, losing a life meant that he could still be resurrected.","However, this resurrection process would take at least hundreds of years.","Therefore, no matter how many lives this nine-headed snake had left, at the very least, it had stopped for now.","Otherwise, the two of them would not be afraid of one head, but when nine heads appeared together, even they would find it difficult to resist.","Underwater was the territory of the nine-headed snake and she and Li Moying weren’t good at water battles so when the time came, the trouble would be huge.","When Huang Yueli heard Li Moying’s words, she recalled the black shadow she saw back then and felt a lingering fear in her heart.","“I heard that an adult Hydra’s body is usually five to six meters long. However, the one I saw just now was already eight to nine meters out of the water. The total length is at least sixty meters! The density of the devil qi in this deep pool is really high. It can actually nurture a nine-headed snake into such an astonishing ferocious beast!”","Li Moying also sighed,” Luckily when I fell into the water, I felt that there must be something strange in this deep pool so I had been secretly on guard. If not, if I were to be suddenly attacked, I might suffer a loss...”","If the pond water could breed huge ferocious beasts after being eroded by the devil qi, one could imagine what the ores in the surrounding mountain walls were like.","Huang Yueli immediately agreed with Li Moying’s judgement earlier.","“In that case...lt really was like this! I’ve never heard of it before. devil qi can actually be extracted from ores! However, now that he thought about it, since the Profound Qi of Heaven and Earth could condense into crystal jade in ores and form spiritual springs in water. That devil qi can naturally seep into the mountains and rivers.. In that case, my knowledge is too shallow...”"]},{"number":4548,"title":"Chapter 4548: The secret of the cave abode (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4548: The secret of the cave abode (8)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","As Huang Yueli pondered, she flipped her hand and took out a small shovel from her space and chiseled towards the mountain wall.","Under Huang Yueli’s powerful strength, cracks quickly appeared on the rocks outside the mountain wall.","Huang Yueli waved the small shovel, one strike after another and not long after, a small piece of ore was exposed at the bottom of the mountain wall. Indeed, it was the same as what they had seen in the altar on the second level of the cave dwelling. It was a kind of black stone with silver threads.","However, compared to the stone used to build the altar, the silver threads in these ores were obviously less, and the black color was not pure.","Huang Yueli stretched out her finger and touched the ore before attempting to absorb the devilic aura from the ore.","After a few breaths, he retracted his finger.","“These ores are too rough. The concentration of devil qi contained in them is not too high. They can’t be compared to the few stone piles in the altar at all! “It seems that the stone in the altar is not an ordinary ore. It’s impossible to dig out too much in such a large mine. The rest are probably useless ores, or the owner of the cave abode doesn’t like them, so he left them here to nurture the water in the deep pool and the fierce beasts in the water...”","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli’s eyes were filled with disappointment.","When he saw these ores just now, he thought that he had made a fortune again. The God Clan didn’t have these ores in the twelve continents. Although they couldn’t be used for cultivation directly, they might be able to refine Spirit Armaments if they studied them properly.","Moreover, this kind of ore was only available to her subordinates. Once she used it to research a new spiritual weapon, she could even produce it exclusively. No other spiritual weapon master could learn it. At that time, she could sell it for however much money she wanted.","What was even better was that the entire mountain of ores could be mined at will. How much money would that cost?","Now that he thought about it, there was indeed no such good thing in the world.","Li Moying just looked at Huang Yueli’s expression and knew what his little fox was thinking as he shook his head helplessly.","Li ‘er, if you like it, we can dig a little and bring it back. But the best quality ores have definitely been taken away by the master of the cave dwelling. It’s meaningless for us to dig too much so why not go to that sacrificial altar earlier and get a few pieces.”","“I know...” Huang Yueli’s face fell as she nodded.","“Sigh, let’s take a look around first. Perhaps there are even better treasures here!”","She had finally broken through the second level’s altar’s illusion array mechanism and suddenly landed in such a strange place and suffered a shock that was neither too big nor too small, so Huang Yue was not willing to leave empty-handed.","Therefore, she quickly turned her attention to the mountain wall. She wanted to find out if there were any traps left behind by the owner of the cave abode in this mineral vein, and if there were any treasures hidden.","However, the truth made Huang Yueli extremely disappointed.","Although this mineral vein was extremely tall, its internal area was not very large. Its diameter was only about two thousand meters.","With her and Li Moying’s speed, even if they walked slowly, it only took them less than an hour to go around the entire place.","In the end, reality proved that...This mineral vein was a real mineral vein. There was no element of deception in it.","There were no mechanisms or formations.","Furthermore, after her and Li Moying’s evil aura seeped in to probe, these were all extremely crude waste ores and not a single stone could match up to the altar!"]},{"number":4549,"title":"Chapter 4549: The secret of the cave abode (9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4549: The secret of the cave abode (9)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Obtaining such a conclusion, Huang Yueli felt her chest tighten.","“What? There was actually such a thing! I’ve never encountered such a ridiculous thing before! What the hell was the owner of this cave dwelling doing? He had painstakingly cultivated the third level of the cave abode. In the end, this third level, which should have been the most mysterious and safest, actually had no tricks at all!","Did he really use this floor to raise the Nine-Headed Python?”","Li Moying was silent for a moment before he opened his mouth to speak,” It’s not just that...” Building a cave abode on top of a mineral vein would more or less have a bonus effect on cultivation. “I guess that even in the territory of the Devil Clan, this kind of devil ore vein is very rare. Therefore, even if this devil expert has almost emptied the mine, he can’t bear to leave. He still built his cave abode above it. He can use the remaining devil qi in the ore to operate the array formation in the cave abode...”","“Very good, you’ve successfully comforted me!” Huang Yueli’s lips twitched.","She could tell that Li Moying wanted to comfort her.","However, this consolation was completely ineffective.","That’s right, what Li Moying said was absolutely right. These waste ores were not completely useless. At least they could provide a large amount of energy to ensure that the two layers of illusion arrays on the top of the cave dwelling would still be able to function normally after experiencing trillions of years of changes.","Therefore, the use of the abandoned mine was not as simple as raising the Nine-Headed Python.","However, so what?","After all, they were going to return empty-handed..","Huang Yueli was rather unwilling but the truth was as such and she had no other choice but to let out a long sigh,” Alright then, there’s no point in us staying here any longer. Let’s hurry out. Xuan Chaoyi and the others are still waiting for us in the devil camp! Rui Jiang is already dead, we still don’t know what will happen in the mo camp!”","‘ Let’s go,” Li Moying nodded his head immediately,” We’re already clear about the location of this cave dwelling. If there’s a need, we can come again next time.”","The two of them were very decisive and made a decision.","But soon, they realized that something was wrong.","“Wait, we...How should we get out? The exit of this mineral vein...Where is it?” Huang Yueli looked left and right as her expression changed slightly,” It’s not like we have to climb along the mountain wall back to the hole above us right?”","Li Moying frowned as well, ” I don’t know how high it is above us but it’s estimated to be at least a thousand meters. The entrance might only be opened from the outside...How do we get out? Li ‘er, could it be that even you can’t find another exit?”","Huang Yueli’s face was full of confusion,” No, I can’t find it! Didn’t I tell you ?just now? There isn’t even a mechanism or a formation in this mine. How can the exit be hidden?”","The two of them looked at each other. This time, they were both a little dumbfounded.","They had only been focused on observing if there were any treasures and had never thought that there would be an exit.","Logically speaking, there should be traps everywhere in this place. The exit must be hidden in one of the traps. This was already common sense.","However, there was no mechanism here...","Then where would they find the exit?","“Could it be that I have to dig out a certain mountain wall to get out?” Li Moying’s brows raised as he stared at the extremely hard mountain walls as he sank into deep thought.","Huang Yueli seemed to have thought of something as her eyes lit up,” Oh right!”"]},{"number":4550,"title":"Chapter 4550: The secret of the cave abode (10)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4550: The secret of the cave abode (10)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying immediately turned his gaze towards Huang Yueli,” What? Do you have an idea?”","“A way...Not yet.” Huang Yueli shook her head and answered honestly,” But I","just thought that since someone is feeding the Nine-Headed Giant Snake, it means that Rui Jiang has opened the third level. Since he has a way out, it means that there is an exit here and we can definitely get out...”","She had yet to finish her sentence when Li Moying poured a bucket of cold water on her.","“That might not be the case. Think about it, with Rui Jiang’s attainments in array techniques and mechanism techniques, could he rely on himself to crack those array formations outside this cave abode? Obviously not. Therefore, I suspect that he has an ancient secret book of the Devil Clan, which explains the situation in the cave abode. Otherwise, even if he finds the cave abode, he won’t be able to enter.”","‘ Therefore, if there was no exit to this mine, he would have known from the start. He would not have foolishly fallen in like us and could not find the exit...”","“Uh, that’s true...","Huang Yueli’s voice suddenly lowered.","“What should we do now? Are we really going to dig a hole in the mountain wall and leave by force?”","Hearing this, the two of them turned their heads at the same time and looked at the gray mountain wall.","Li Moying walked to the front of the mountain wall as he bent his fingers and knocked on it a few times.","He knocked on the rock with his strength, but there was only a very light muffled sound, almost inaudible.","It was obvious that the thickness of this mountain wall was beyond their imagination. It was not something that could be done in a few days if they wanted to dig through it.","But Li Moying didn’t reveal a disappointed expression because of this. He still appeared extremely calm,” There’s no other way now so why don’t we give it a try first! Although a few days shouldn’t be enough, there’s a limit to how big the mine is. I can dig through it in a few more months. I still have this bit of patience.”","For ordinary cultivators, in their current predicament, spending a few months digging through the mountain wall was no different from courting death. No matter how big the interspatial ring was, no one would store dry rations for a few months at a time. They would starve to death sooner or later.","But Huang Yueli had the Sky Phoenix Ring in her hands and it had formed a small world inside. The space was shockingly huge and not only could it store a large amount of food, there were even fresh herbs growing out. Not to mention a few months, even staying there for a few hundred years wasn’t a problem.","Therefore, they were not panicked at all.","“Wait, Moying, I don’t think we need to do such a troublesome thing...l suddenly thought of the possible location of the exit!”","Li Moying didn’t put on any airs as the heir of a large family as he rolled up his sleeves and immediately started to work.","However, Huang Yueli pulled on his sleeve in time to stop him.","Li Moying turned his head to look at her,” What did you think of this time? How can there be...’","Halfway through his sentence, he suddenly paused.","Following Huang Yueli’s line of sight, in the middle of the mineral vein, there was a bottomless pool of water that was deathly silent.","Li Moying was slightly startled and immediately understood,” You mean...The exit is under this deep pool?”","Huang Yueli nodded her head,” That’s right. Other than this place, there shouldn’t be any other possibility. We can’t really dig through the mountain wall, right? Let’s go and take a look!”","“Wait!” Li Moying grabbed her wrist,” You’re not allowed to take risks, I’ll go over and take a look first.."]},{"number":4551,"title":"Chapter 4551: Under the deep pool (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4551: Under the deep pool (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli took a glance at her husband and cooperatively stopped in her tracks.","She had always felt that there was no need to hide behind a man. In her previous life, she would often argue with Li Moying over such matters.","However, after so many years of interaction, she had learned to show weakness appropriately and not be entangled in such small matters.","Occasionally, she would let her husband protect her. It could also promote the relationship between husband and wife. Why not?","Li Moying walked quickly to the side of the deep pool as his cold eyes narrowed slightly as he stared at the water surface.","The water in the pond was calm. At a glance, it was pitch-black and bottomless. Even the nine-headed snake that they had just killed was nowhere to be seen. There was nothing unusual about it.","Li Moying thought for a moment as he tried to probe his spiritual perception into it.","After a few breaths, he suddenly frowned and grunted, subconsciously taking a step back.","Huang Yueli had been watching him from the side and upon seeing this, her heart jolted as she hurriedly walked over, wanting to support him,” Husband, what’s wrong?! Where are you feeling uncomfortable? What’s under the pond?”","Li Moying gently held Huang Yueli’s hand and rejected her support as he stood up straight.","“I’m fine. I’m not injured. It’s just...” He thought of the situation underwater and frowned again.” We were all wrong. The Devil Qi in this deep pool is not supplied by these low-grade ores on the mountain wall. There should be a bigger source of Devil Qi below the pool.”","“Just now, I sent my divine sense into the pool to sense the situation underwater, but the deeper I went, the higher the density of the devil qi in the water. I could only vaguely sense the situation two hundred meters below the water. And in the depth of two hundred meters, I can sense the life force of many magical beasts. Some of them are even more powerful than the nine-headed snake.”","“Looks like there is indeed something strange below this pool. It is likely that it is not as simple as the exit of this level...”","Li Moying recalled as the expression on his face turned increasingly solemn.","After all, he was a god. Even if he had cultivated evil techniques, the overly dense devil qi still affected his divine sense.","Under normal circumstances, his divine sense could cover an area of several thousand meters. However, under the circumstances where the density of the devil qi under the pond had reached such an astonishing level, the ability of his powerful divine sense was extremely limited.","When Huang Yueli heard that, her delicate brows furrowed slightly.","She thought for a while and walked to the edge of the pond.","Li Moying’s brows moved slightly but he didn’t stop her, only lightly said,” Be careful!”","Huang Yueli nodded,” Don’t worry, I know what to do.”","She also imitated Li Moying’s earlier actions as she sent her spiritual perception into the deep pool.","Because of the Soul Splitting Technique, her spiritual awareness was of the same origin as Li Moying’s, so she had gained quite a bit of advantage and was also very powerful.","After a round of investigation, she had to admit that what Li Moying said was right. There should be an extremely powerful source of devil qi underwater and the greatest possibility was that there was a top grade devil ore vein which could produce such a shocking amount of energy.","Moreover, under the influence of the devil qi, the devilic beasts underwater had undergone a lot of changes. Many of the devilic beasts were not even seen outside, nor were they recorded in the ancient records of the Ancient God Clan.","“This time.... We’re in trouble...”"]},{"number":4552,"title":"Chapter 4552: Under the deep pool (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4552: Under the deep pool (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Iranslations Editor: Misty Cloud Iranslations","At first, the two of them had never expected that this deep pool would actually be such a dangerous place.","Now that he thought about it, it was all thanks to their quick reflexes when they fell into the water and their good luck that they only attracted the attention of the nine-headed snake.","If they were a little slower, they would attract the attack of the underwater magical beasts, and it would be very troublesome.","Moreover, these magical beasts should only be the least threatening part of the deep pool.","With such a high concentration of devil qi, it was impossible for them to know what changes would happen and whether there were any traps below.","Understanding this point, Huang Yueli immediately turned back and exchanged a glance with her husband.","Li Moying then slowly opened his mouth,” Do we have to pass through underwater? Was there no other way to leave? If it really doesn’t work out, we can dig the mountain wall and leave. I don’t mind the trouble.”","Huang Yueli shook her head, ” I think that we shouldn’t be able to leave by digging through the mountain wall. At first, I thought that this was just an ordinary mine, so I thought that this plan would work. However, there are obviously very powerful mechanisms and formations under the pool. The magical beasts in the pool should be raised to protect the mechanisms below. This means that this place must be very important to the owner of the cave abode.”","“Under such circumstances, the master of the cave must have done something to the surrounding mineral veins. He definitely wouldn’t let anyone leave by digging through the mountain wall.”","Li Moying frowned.","What Huang Yueli said was right, such an important place, there was no way for them to leave by any means.","The master of the cave must have left only one path. As long as one entered, they could only leave through the most dangerous place.","“Then we... We can only go into the water.” Li Moying said in a deep voice.","Huang Yueli nodded slightly,” That’s right.”","The two of them were very decisive. They only spent a few breaths to make a decision and no longer hesitated.","After that, he spent another two hours circling the deep pool and exploring the water from all angles. After concluding the situation underwater, he made a plan to enter the water.","“The devil qi in the water is so dense. It is very likely that it is because of the devilic ore vein. However, if I were the master of the cave, I would definitely use the mineral vein to set up a mechanism underwater. Therefore, there was a","99% chance that there was a mechanism driven by devil qi. Therefore, I must enter the water. As for husband, you...”","“I’ll go into the water with you and help you fend off these magical beasts. Don’t worry, I’ll do my best to protect you. You just have to find a way to figure out the situation underwater.”","“Alright, then it’s all up to you, husband!”","Huang Yueli didn’t act pretentious and immediately nodded her head in agreement.","The two of them slowly released the evil qi in their bodies, forming a protective shield that enveloped their bodies like a layer of black mist.","Then, he took a deep breath and stepped into the water.","Although the two of them were not water-attributed cultivators, with their cultivation, it was naturally easy for them to avoid water.","However, they were still very cautious. Every move they made was very careful.","They tiptoed and tried their best not to make the sound of paddling.","This was mainly to avoid attracting the attention of the underwater magic beasts.","To ordinary Ancient God Clan warriors, the Dark Force in their bodies was like a poison to the Magical Beasts. No matter how careful they were, it was impossible to hide it.."]},{"number":4553,"title":"Chapter 4553: Under the deep pool (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4553: Under the deep pool (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","But Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s situation was slightly different.","Because the evil qi had wrapped around their bodies, after they entered the water, the evil qi shield they released had indeed fused with the devilic energy in the water, isolating the god aura in their bodies.","The two of them slowly moved forward in the water. As the depth of their dive increased, the magical beasts they encountered became stronger and stronger.","However, they were careful enough, and their use of evil qi was superb, so they never exposed their whereabouts.","Huang Yueli secretly heaved a sigh of relief as she slowly released her divine sense and continued to probe the situation at the bottom of the water.","Because it was too dark underwater, his vision had completely failed, and he could only rely on his divine sense.","Within the range of her divine sense, the water was still pitch-black. The deeper she went, the darker it was. Moreover, because the devil qi density increased, the water became colder and colder.","Suddenly, Huang Yueli’s vision turned black and her body trembled as she suddenly fell downwards!","Li Jer!!”","Li Moying’s mind buzzed as he immediately flew out and the instant Huang Yueli fell down, he caught her in time.","“Li ‘er, Li’ er! How are you?”","He hugged Huang Yueli’s body tightly as he used his spiritual perception to transmit a message into her mind.","Huang Yueli didn’t faint for too long but after two breaths, she moved slightly and woke up,” I... I’m fine. However, below...lt’s really too cold down there. I wasn’t prepared, and my divine sense almost couldn’t resist the corrosion of the devil qi...’","When devil qi entered the body, it would erode the meridians of the Ancient God Clan cultivators, causing them to feel a cold feeling. In serious cases, it could even cause paralysis and even sudden death.","With the current concentration of devil qi in the deep pool, if it was an ordinary Ancient God Clan, they would have long been unconscious.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying had cultivated the ” Saint Iniquitous Shadow Canon ” before, so they were able to persevere till now.","Hearing Huang Yueli’s explanation, not only did Li Moying not feel at ease, he frowned as a trace of worry rose in his heart.","Earlier when Huang Yueli was scouting downwards, he had also released his spiritual perception to check the surrounding situation.","However, he didn’t feel that it was too strenuous. If it wasn’t for Huang Yueli’s accident earlier and he was in a hurry to save her, at this moment, he would have already been able to probe the situation at the bottom of the deep pool.","Of course, he was aware of the coldness of the devil qi entering his body. However, overall, it was still within the range that he could withstand.","He had not expected that Huang Yueli was actually so far inferior to him. She had not even probed to the bottom and was already unable to withstand the corrosion of the devilic aura...","Admittedly, he had already successfully advanced into Dao Profound Realm while Huang Yueli was still in Heart Profound Realm. The two people’s cultivation already had a difference, so their ability to withstand the devilic aura should also be different.","But Li Moying kept feeling that something wasn’t quite right.","After the two of them dual-cultivated the Wraith Secrets, shouldn’t their progress in the cultivation of evil qi be the same?","Furthermore, the matter of Huang Yueli’s self-detonation not succeeding made him feel extremely strange.","He did not know if the two things were related..","Li Moying’s heart was filled with worry but given the current situation, it was time for him to continue thinking.","He stretched out his hand and pressed it on Huang Yueli’s back as he injected the evil qi from his body into her body. At the same time, he transmitted his voice to her: ” How is it? Li ‘er, are you alright? If you’re not feeling well, why don’t we go back to the shore first and we’ll do it next time....”"]},{"number":4554,"title":"Chapter 4554: Under the deep pool (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4554: Under the deep pool (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“No, I’m fine. I’m really fine!” Huang Yueli shook her head,” Just now...lt was just an accident.”","Huang Yueli also felt that her ability to endure shouldn’t be so bad.","She didn’t know what had happened at that moment. It was as if all the strength in her body had been sucked dry, and her body didn’t listen to her. Now, it seemed to have recovered.","“Are you really alright?” Li Moying’s brows creased tightly as he couldn’t relax,” We don’t need to be in a hurry so it’s not too late to wait for you to fully recover before entering the water.”","“I’m fine, really! Alright, Moying, you don’t have to give me all the evil qi, you need the evil qi to protect yourself. You... Let go of me first.”","Huang Yueli felt that she was fine as she stretched out her hand to push Li Moying, indicating for him to let go.","Li Moying didn’t let go immediately but released a trace of energy and circulated it around Huang Yueli’s meridians. When he found that there was indeed no problem with her, he gently let go of his hand.","Huang Yueli adjusted her breathing,” Alright, let’s continue diving. The density of the devil qi below is very high but it seems to be much quieter. I think those nine-headed snakes and other magical beasts wouldn’t be able to withstand such a fierce power and wouldn’t dare to go too deep into the water.”","Although devil qi was also very nourishing for devilic beasts, if it was overnourished, it would be a tragedy.","Li Moying nodded his head as he used his gaze to signal Huang Yueli to follow behind him, before diving down first.","Huang Yueli knew that if she continued to go deeper, although the water seemed much calmer, but the danger would definitely not be lesser!","And she had almost made a mistake earlier and still couldn’t find the reason so naturally she didn’t dare to force herself as she obediently retreated a little, closely following behind Li Moying.","Huang Yueli’s judgement was correct.","The two of them continued to dive down. When they reached a depth of about 300 meters, the magical beasts that were swimming around completely disappeared.","At this moment, the pool was almost filled with overflowing devil qi. That kind of dense and heart-palpitating aura assaulted one’s face, making it difficult for one to breathe.","Even for Huang Yueli and Li Moying, it was already difficult for them to take a single step forward. They had to put in 120% of their focus and release almost all the evil aura in their bodies to resist the surrounding devil aura that wanted to invade their bodies.","The water in the pond was as black as the eternal night and as cold as ice. Coupled with the disappearance of the devilic beasts, the surroundings were terrifyingly quiet.","Only the familiar warmth came from their palms.","Li ‘er, hold on, we’re about to reach the bottom of the water so you must be careful.”","“Yes, I know!”","Hearing that Huang Yueli’s voice was still normal, Li Moying felt slightly relieved.","After diving for another few dozen meters, the two of them realized that they were already close to the bottom of the deep pool...","Not long after, Huang Yueli and Li Moying finally touched the ground.","Just as they had guessed, the bottom of the deep pool was not naturally formed sand and mud, but a very flat bronze ground. It was obviously man-made.","“I can already sense that the devil qi fluctuations in this vicinity have a pattern. Someone must be guiding the flow of devil qi through some kind of array formation. There was definitely a hidden exit mechanism! I have to get close to the center and check the overall situation.”","It was the first time Huang Yueli had seen a mechanism that was built at the bottom of the deep pool and was completely driven by devilic energy.","Even if it was not to leave this place, she still wanted to understand the principle of the array.","Huang Yueli adjusted her inner breath as she slowly walked towards the center of the pool...","Li Moying followed behind her for a few steps and suddenly, a chill ran down his spine.","“Not good...! Li’er, come back quickly!”"]},{"number":4555,"title":"Chapter 4555: Under the deep pool (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4555: Under the deep pool (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Just as Li Moying spoke, Huang Yueli realised that the situation wasn’t right.","She reacted quickly and retreated immediately.","However, it was already a little too late.","The devil qi at the bottom of the pool was extremely dense and even the water in the pool had become rather viscous. Although she and Li Moying could still barely hold on, but their five senses were severely affected and they were only at less than ten percent of their normal state.","Therefore, by the time they noticed it, the change had already happened.","In the depths of the pitch-black pool, an incomparably thick and sturdy whip-like object suddenly swung down towards Huang Yueli’s head. Using the thick devil qi to cover it, it was soundless but its speed was shockingly fast!","Huang Yueli couldn’t see the situation underwater and could only rely on her spiritual perception to try her best to dodge.","However, in the water where the Devil Qi was dense, her speed was far from her usual speed. Furthermore, she could only use the Evil Qi to protect her body and did not dare to use the Fire Attribute Dark Force in her body, afraid that she would attract the attention of the Devil Beasts underwater and cause even more trouble.","This way, she had a body of movement mystic skills but she was completely unable to unleash them.","Seeing that whip-like object was about to hit her head, Huang Yueli’s expression turned solemn but her heart was very calm. With a flip of her right hand, she had already grabbed a small dagger in her palm and raised her hand to lift it towards her head.","Even at such a critical moment, her hand was very stable. Her hand was fast and accurate, and she stabbed the foreign object that attacked her.","The dagger in her hand was a magical weapon she had obtained from the Phoenix Clan. Even if it could not be fully activated, its sharpness alone was enough to cut through gold and jade.","With this move, a strange sound suddenly came from the deep and quiet pool, like an animal grunting.","A thought immediately flashed across Huang Yueli’s mind, This thing...lt was a living thing!","However, before she could figure out what it was, the other party’s second attack followed closely. Moreover, this time, the whip-like object fell even faster than before, carrying with it an astonishing might. Under such an impact, the viscous pool water rapidly spread to both sides, forming wave-like currents.","With such speed, it was already too late to dodge.","Huang Yueli hurriedly flipped over in the water as she mobilized all the evil qi in her body, wanting to block this terrifying attack.","If she was on land, such an attack would not be difficult for her to resist. However, she was now underwater, surrounded by devil qi...","She only had 30% of her strength left!","If he was not careful, he would be killed on the spot!","Just as Huang Yueli was about to vomit blood from the impact of the water current, Li Moying arrived in time.","The cold sword light emitted a weak glow in the pitch-black water and looked inconspicuous but the timing of the attack was just right, arriving at the same time as Huang Yueli’s attack.","The two evil auras fused together, forming an energy that was no weaker than the other party’s. It collided with the thick whip-like object.","With a dull explosion, the other party let out an even more miserable cry. A faint bloody smell spread from the bottom of the water.","Li Moying’s attack had succeeded and he immediately went to pull Huang Yueli’s wrist as he shouted sternly,” Hurry up and leave! Let’s leave this place immediately!”","Actually, even without her saying it, Huang Yueli knew that the enemy was in the dark and she was in the light. They didn’t even know what was on the other side and the underwater battle environment wasn’t suitable for them so they would only be courting death if they went head-on.."]},{"number":4556,"title":"Chapter 4556: Under the deep pool (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4556: Under the deep pool (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The wisest choice now was to retreat.","She didn’t hesitate as she followed Li Moying and retreated towards the direction they came from.","The two of them tried their best to move as fast as possible. In just a few seconds, they had already moved more than a hundred meters up.","Just as the water was about to come out, waves of intense devil qi fluctuations came from the water.","Huang Yueli turned around and her expression changed slightly.","“Not good. Our battle just now should have attracted the attention of these Magical Beasts. They are swimming towards us...”","Because they were much closer to the surface of the water, at this height, the two of them could already vaguely see the situation in the surrounding water with their extraordinary vision.","A large number of magical beasts were rapidly approaching them. Among them, there were not only nine-headed snakes, but also many magical beasts that looked familiar but could not be directly called out. These were clearly magical beasts that had been seriously eroded by the devil qi in the pool, causing their appearance to be different from ordinary magical beasts.","The strength of these devilic beasts were all about the same as the","Nine-Headed Hydra. The majority all reached the strength of Dao Profound Realm cultivators. There were even some that were even more powerful than the Nine-Headed Hydra.","As far as the two of them could see, they could see more than ten magical beasts, and there were definitely more where they couldn’t see.","Li Moying narrowed his eyes,” Let’s hurry up and get out of the water at the fastest speed. Once we’re surrounded, we’ll be in big trouble!”","This point, Huang Yueli was naturally very clear.","But she didn’t immediately follow Li Moying’s instructions as she frowned,” No way, above our heads...” There were so many... What is this?”","Her voice changed slightly as she spoke.","When Li Moying heard that, he hurriedly raised his head to take a look.","A large school of fish had gathered above their heads.","Each of these fish was half a meter long, and the longest was only about one meter. However, their mouths occupied more than 70% of their body length. When they opened their mouths slightly, there were at least four to five layers of teeth in their mouths. The dense silver-white sharp teeth were like rows of knives, emitting a cold light.","Without even trying, he could guess that if he was bitten by so many sharp teeth at the same time, it would definitely feel very sour.","“This is...Piranha!”","‘ Such a huge piranha?!”","Huang Yueli had never thought that there would be such a large group of piranhas in this deep pool. There were so many of them and they had even mutated into such a state!","Normal piranhas were only the length of a palm. Although their teeth were sharp, they only had one row.","Of course, although the piranhas were small in size, they appeared in groups. If they pounced at the same time, it was enough to tear a Profound Meaning Realm cultivator into pieces within a few breaths and swallow him whole.","Once they were accidentally surrounded by the piranhas, even a Heart","Profound Realm expert would lose a layer of skin even if they did not die.","And now, they had encountered an enhanced version of the Piranha...No, it was the perverted version!","Looking at the huge piranha’s terrifying sharp teeth, Li Moying’s face revealed a rare trace of unease,” No, if we force our way in, although we might not be able to leave, but... The price was too great! There are too many of these piranhas. They’re too difficult to deal with!”","Just as the two of them were talking, the piranhas above their heads had already started swarming towards them like flies that had smelled the fishy smell.","There were more than ten devilic beasts surrounding the two of them.. For a moment, they did not know where to escape!"]},{"number":4557,"title":"Chapter 4557: Under the deep pool (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4557: Under the deep pool (7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Under extreme danger, Huang Yueli quickly made a decision.","“Husband, let’s turn around and return to the bottom of the pool!”","As she transmitted her voice to Li Moying, she flipped over and dived towards the bottom of the pool.","Li Moying’s brows furrowed slightly but he didn’t say anything as he followed closely behind Huang Yueli.","Although he did not know why Li ‘er said that, but he believed in her judgement.","Since they had already been exposed, the two of them did not continue to waste their energy to conceal their strength. Instead, they simply mobilized their Profound Energy and used their movement Profound Skills.","With this, the two of them immediately increased their speed by a large margin, like two sharp arrows that had left the bow. In the blink of an eye, they had left all the devilic beasts behind.","Huang Yueli rushed ahead and when she saw that she was only eighty meters away from the bottom of the pool, she suddenly stopped.","Li Moying had been staring at her every move and when he saw her stop, he followed suit and floated in the water.","Immediately after, he raised his head and saw that the devilic beasts that were chasing after the two of them had all stopped about a hundred meters from the bottom of the pool.","One could tell that these magical beasts were drooling over these two fresh food with abundant Profound Energy in their bodies. Rows of fangs were revealed as if they wanted to pounce on them immediately and tear them into pieces to swallow.","However, they seemed to be afraid of something and did not dare to go deeper.","They only swam back and forth in the periphery. When they got closer, they seemed to sense something and retreated in panic.","Huang Yueli also raised her head as a trace of relief flashed past her eyes.","“It seems that my guess is correct. There is a reason why these Magical Beasts are gathered at the top of this deep pool. It is because there is something at the bottom of the Pool of Fear...","Hearing that, Li Moying frowned slightly as his expression turned increasingly solemn,” That’s indeed the case, but...” I wonder if they are afraid of the living thing that attacked us just now or something hidden behind the mechanism at the bottom of the pool..","No matter what the situation was, it was not good news for them.","Although the magical beasts above him were not particularly powerful, there were too many of them. It would be very difficult for them to break through the encirclement and float to the surface.","This also meant that it was best for them to leave directly from the bottom of the pool.","However, if the thing at the bottom of the pool made so many magical beasts afraid...lt would be even more dangerous for them to face such a thing!","There was a wolf in front and a tiger behind. No matter which side he chose, he had to take a huge risk.","However, there was not much time left for them to consider.","Li Moying thought for a moment and asked,” Li ‘er, how confident are you to crack the trap at the bottom of the pool?”","Huang Yueli had been thinking about this question from the start and at this moment, she shook her head slightly,” This is hard to say. I didn’t even have the time to find out the full picture of the mechanism below and was...That thing attacked. The problem now is that if I keep being disturbed by that magical beast, I won’t be able to crack the array at all.”","Li Moying immediately replied,” This isn’t a big problem. I can think of a way to stall that thing. At least fifteen minutes isn’t a problem.”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli was a little surprised as she turned back to look at him,” What? What method are you going to use to stall it? This thing comes and goes without a trace, and its speed is shockingly fast...”"]},{"number":4558,"title":"Chapter 4558: Under the deep pool (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4558: Under the deep pool (8)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","It wasn’t that Huang Yueli didn’t trust her husband’s ability, but in this deep pool, there was something strange everywhere.","A place with such a high concentration of demonic qi could almost be said to be a forbidden area for the god clan martial artists.","Even a Profound Life Realm expert would not easily step into such a place.","They had relied on the fact that they had cultivated evil techniques and were careless for a moment, which was why they had fallen into such a dilemma.","No one in the 12 continents of the God Clan had experienced the dangers they had encountered today. There was no experience of predecessors to refer to. Once they made a mistake, it was very likely that they would be doomed.","However, Huang Yueli didn’t regret her choice to go deep into the pool.","After all, all opportunities were closely linked to risks. There was no such thing as a good opportunity without risks.","The fact that the interior of the deep pool was so dangerous meant that the thing hidden at the bottom of the pool was very important to the owner of the cave abode. It might be a great opportunity.","However, taking a risk was one thing. When it was time to be cautious, one had to be cautious.","Hearing Huang Yueli’s question, Li Moying pondered as he spoke with uncertainty,” If I’m not wrong, the one that attacked us at the bottom of the pool earlier should be the Extreme Cold Giant Eye Octopus. It’s a monster that only appears in the water with extremely dense devil qi. I didn’t expect that we would really meet one!”","‘ Giant Eye Octopus?” Huang Yueli was stunned,” This kind of magical beast really exists?!”","Because the magical beast that Li Moying was talking about, she wasn’t unfamiliar with it. In the Divine Realm, this kind of beast was often used to scare children. Although it was terrifying, no one took it seriously, thinking that it was just a magical beast from the ancient times and had long gone extinct.","Li Moying replied,” This is the cave dwelling of the devil race’s powerhouses from the ancient times. It’s not surprising that they would keep such magical beasts. But...”","He didn’t finish his sentence but Huang Yueli’s heart was connected to his so she naturally understood his unfinished meaning.","Even in the ancient times, the demons who could capture the extremely cold giant octopus should be at the level of peerless experts.","Huang Yueli’s heart turned cold,” Moying, according to what you’ve said, this giant octopus probably has a lifespan of a trillion years and its strength is definitely unfathomable. No matter how strong you are, how can you possibly hold it back? Otherwise, we should think of a way to get out from above.”","Comparatively speaking, Huang Yueli still felt that it was safer to leave from above.","Although there were a lot of piranhas, their individual combat strength was not too strong. As long as the strategy was correct, they could still kill their way out.","However, Li Moying shook his head,” I’m afraid that it’s already too late for us to leave now...”","“What do you mean...!”","Before Huang Yueli could finish her words, she felt a bone-chilling chill on her back.","She realized that something was wrong and quickly jumped to the side, wanting to dodge.","But Li Moying directly flashed and snatched in front of her.","“Moying, you...What are you doing? Hurry up and dodge!”","However, Li Moying didn’t say a word as his back was straight, without any signs of retreating.","His right hand formed a sword gesture and he gently glided across the cold, pitch -black water.","A blinding electric light suddenly lit up wherever his fingertip swept past.","Although this lightning was only a thin line, it was so bright that it instantly lit up the entire bottom of the pool!"]},{"number":4559,"title":"Chapter 4559: Under the deep pool (9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4559: Under the deep pool (9)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","At this moment, Huang Yueli clearly saw that the thing that was suddenly lashing towards her back was a huge tentacle.","This wrist was more than two meters thick, and there were ugly bumps around it. They emitted a faint green light and looked abnormally ferocious. From time to time, mucus would come out of the bumps.","At the front of the wrist, there was a huge organ that looked like an eye that bulged out.","Even though it was so thick, the tentacle moved very quickly and soundlessly. The surrounding water seemed to have been frozen, unable to make any movement.","If he was hit by such a limb, he would definitely be injured or killed.","Huang Yueli took a look and was instantly disgusted.","She had read about it in the ancient books and knew that the Giant Octopus was very ugly, but she didn’t expect it to be so ugly!","No wonder it could only hide in the water with dense devil qi..","This tentacle was menacing and its speed was shocking but when the lightning in Li Moying’s hand suddenly lit up, the huge eye at the front of the tentacle seemed to have been stimulated as it shut up abruptly and a trace of fresh blood seeped out from its eyes.","Li Moying gave a cold humph as his right hand swiftly changed into two sword seals.","The Gigantic Octopus uttered a weird shriek and retracted its limbs.","Huang Yueli’s eyes widened as she looked at the scene in front of her and was extremely shocked,” This...” Was this the Giant Eye Octopus? But Moying, earlier you...Could it be that the Giant Eye Octopus is afraid of the lightning attribute energy?”","Li Moying nodded slightly, ” I wasn’t too sure earlier and was just taking a risk. I’ve read about it in the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s ancient records. It said that during the ancient times, there was a peerless expert in my clan who had once killed an extremely cold giant octopus. Although the records did not describe the process in detail, I’m guessing that the extremely cold giant octopus’s physique is cold and Yin, so it should be afraid of the lightning attribute’s power. Moreover, I suspect that the fire attribute should also have a certain degree of suppression on it.”","In the end, after a try, he successfully forced the other party back.","“It’s actually like this! This... This was great! At least, we’re not completely helpless against the Giant Eye Octopus!”","Huang Yueli was slightly surprised but not long after, she frowned again,” If it was outside, just based on this point, we would be able to fight with this giant octopus. But now, we are in a deep pool with dense devil qi and we can only unleash ten percent of our strength at most...Furthermore, I suspect that the mountain walls of this mineral vein, which are rich in devil qi, should also have a shielding effect on the Heaven and Earth Dark Force.”","Hearing that, Li Moying nodded his head, ” That’s right.”","If not for that, the lightning he summoned with his sword technique would not have been so thin.","With his usual swordsmanship cultivation, every time he struck out with his sword, he would trigger heavenly lightning and shock the world. Moreover, he had just advanced and his strength had increased greatly!","However, in this godforsaken place built by the devils, he could only summon a few small lightning bolts even if he used all his strength.","‘ However, Li ‘er, don’t worry. Even if I can only unleash this bit of strength, it’s still possible to stall this Arctic Giant Eye Octopus.”","However, Li Moying’s words didn’t make Huang Yueli feel at ease as she frowned and glared at him, ” Don’t think that I don’t know that the Giant","Frost-eyed Octopus has eight limbs and what we saw earlier was only one!”"]},{"number":4560,"title":"Chapter 4560: Under the deep pool (10)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4560: Under the deep pool (10)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Being able to block the attack of one limb did not mean that he could block the attack of eight limbs at the same time.","Just based on Li Moying’s pitiful few bolts of lightning earlier...","Huang Yueli was really worried.","If one hadn’t seen Li Moying’s usual heroic bearing when he struck out with his sword, one might feel that the might of this lightning was already extremely shocking but in Huang Yueli’s eyes who was used to seeing Li Moying attack, this...lt was really the embodiment of Li Moying’s extremely weak state.","Li Moying’s expression didn’t change as he spoke indifferently,” That’s right. Eight limbs attacking together, I don’t know how long I can last so your speed must be fast enough! Besides, you have to hide yourself well and not attract the attention of the Giant Eye Octopus. Otherwise, I won’t be able to buy you more time.”","Huang Yueli’s heart was still a little uneasy but she wasn’t a person who was indecisive.","Hearing that Li Moying had already made up his mind, she could only trust her husband.","“Alright, then cover me. 1...1’11 go now! You must be careful!”","“Li ‘er, why are you so untrusting towards your husband? When have I ever disappointed you?” Li Moying lifted his lips lazily.","Huang Yueli really wanted to say, ‘Haven’t you risked your life to block behind","However, the situation was critical at the moment. She was too lazy to argue with this man. She had already prepared the array disc and other items as quickly as possible and wrapped her entire body with evil qi again.","She nodded slightly towards Li Moying and Li Moying immediately understood as he leaped up and dove down rapidly.","When he was about 50 meters away from the bottom of the pool, the huge tentacle whipped at him again.","Because the Devil Qi in the water was too dense, the Spirit Tools would be corroded by the Devil Qi. Not only would they not be able to display their power, but they would also be broken in an extremely short period of time, affecting the battle.","So Li Moying didn’t draw his sword but used his finger as a sword, attaching the lightning onto his finger as he stabbed towards that huge eye once again!","However, this time around, the Arctic Giant Eye Octopus seemed to have learnt its lesson as it didn’t charge forward like the previous time but instead quickly circled around and changed its direction, whipping down from Li Moying’s head.","At the same time, the other two tentacles silently rolled over and suddenly appeared behind Li Moying!","Under the pincer attack of three thick and sturdy limbs, Li Moying’s figure looked too tiny, as though he would be squeezed in the middle at any moment and crushed into meat paste.","When Huang Yueli saw this, her eyes suddenly widened as she almost couldn’t control herself to save him!","However, Li Moying was still calm and composed as both his hands conjured a sword scripture at the same time and rapidly changed it.","In just a few breaths, he had conjured hundreds of sword techniques. Hundreds of lightning bolts lit up in the pitch-black water, illuminating the entire water as if it was daytime!","Although the power of his lightning bolt was greatly weakened due to the limitations of the surrounding environment, it still exploded with shocking power under the enhancement of such a large number of sword lights!","Hundreds of lightning bolts connected into a cluster and slashed at one of the limbs like a sharp bayonet.","“Howl! ”","With a strange scream, the wrist was cut off by the lightning!","Li Moying’s figure also followed that lightning bolt, as he suddenly darted through the gap formed by the severed limbs, barely dodging the two limbs behind him.","Seeing her husband successfully escape from danger, Huang Yueli secretly heaved a sigh of relief.","Li Moying frowned and transmitted his voice to her, ” What are you still standing there for? Hurry up and get down!”","Huang Yueli was afraid that if she saw her husband in danger, she wouldn’t be able to hold herself back and didn’t dare to hesitate as she flew towards the bottom of the pool without turning back.."]},{"number":4561,"title":"Chapter 4561: Under the deep pool (11)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4561: Under the deep pool (11)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When Li Moying made his move, the lightning kept flickering and had already lit up the entire bottom of the pond.","Hence, Huang Yueli had gained an advantage this time as she didn’t waste much effort and was able to clearly see the situation at the bottom of the pool. With just one glance, she frowned.","His body suddenly came to a stop, floating less than ten meters from the bottom of the pool, quietly observing the situation below.","The bottom of the deep pool was not much different from what they had expected at the beginning. It was indeed a bronze door that was circular in shape. It looked like the entrance to a passage.","On the periphery of this circular door, there were layers of exquisite and complicated array patterns. Although the bronze had rusted under the erosion of time and the array patterns had become a little blurry, it still made people clearly feel the powerful power and deterrence contained in this ancient array.","However, this wasn’t what shocked Huang Yueli.","What truly shocked her was the giant octopus lying on the bronze array at the bottom of the pool.","Its body was more than a hundred meters long and was extremely soft. It covered almost one-third of the bottom of the pool and even pressed down on half of the array.","And around its body were eight huge tentacles, reaching a length of 200 meters!","These eight limbs were waving back and forth in the pool. Not only was their strength shocking, but they also stirred the devil qi at the bottom of the pool like a vortex.","This extremely cold giant octopus...The extent of his strength had already exceeded Huang Yueli’s expectations!","Huang Yueli had to be on full alert as she carefully walked through it. Otherwise, once she was brushed by these tentacles, she would probably be beaten until she vomited blood.","As for Li Moying...However, he had to deal with such a huge magical beast alone...","moreover, tms extremely cold giant octopus nad Obviously not entered a state of desperation and was only using a few limbs to fight Li Moying. If this dragged on for too long, it would really be completely enraged and who knew how much more power it would unleash.","Huang Yueli knew that she didn’t have much time left and didn’t dare to think too much as she gritted her teeth and rushed towards the bottom of the pool.","She covered her entire body with evil qi, held her breath, and moved towards the door in the center of the deep pool step by step.","This was not easy because the closer she got to the circular door, the more she could feel that there must be a very powerful source of devilic energy on the other side of the door.","The devil qi at the bottom of the water seeped out from the crack in the door.","The closer she got, the more the aura in her body was drawn by the devilic aura inside the door. For a moment, her blood and qi churned, and all the strength in her body seemed to be sucked out.","“Damn it! What is hidden at the bottom of this pool?”","Huang Yueli cursed in her heart as she used up all her self-control to barely suppress the abnormal movements in her body as she moved to the side of the round door.","Luckily, that extremely cold giant octopus seemed to have completely attracted Li Moying’s attention and didn’t notice anyone approaching it.","Huang Yueli heaved a sigh of relief and immediately narrowed her eyes as her fingers formed a hand seal and she started to calculate rapidly.","She knew that the situation was urgent, so she was very focused on her calculations. Her hand gestures quickly changed, forming an illusion underwater. Ordinary people could not see her movements clearly. In just a few dozen breaths, she had deduced several times. However, every time he deduced halfway, he would stop.."]},{"number":4562,"title":"Chapter 4562: Under the deep pool (12)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4562: Under the deep pool (12)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","There were not many array formations from the ancient times that could be passed down. The array masters of the current God Realm knew very little about this.","And the array in front of Huang Yueli was driven by devil qi which was even rarer in the twelve continents of the God Realm.","If it wasn’t for the fact that she still had some evil Qi in her body and that she had just cracked the array on the first and second floor of the cave abode, she probably wouldn’t even know where to start.","The formation was too difficult, and the other reason was that the position where the Gigantic Octopus lay was too unsuitable. It actually blocked a part of the formation patterns.","She couldn’t even see the entire array pattern clearly, so how could she possibly calculate it completely?","Huang Yueli tried a few more times as cold sweat gradually broke out on her forehead.","It seemed that it was impossible for them to take any shortcuts. They had to move the giant octopus away!","However, this meant that they had to completely infuriate this ancient ferocious beast. This was also...","It was too risky...","Huang Yueli was still hesitating in her heart but Li Moying had already noticed that the situation wasn’t right as he transmitted his voice over: ” Li ‘er, what’s the situation? Is this beast blocking your vision and preventing you from deducing? Do you want me to help you move it away?”","Huang Yueli was slightly startled,” That’s right, it indeed blocked the array markings but you also didn’t...”","She didn’t even have the chance to stop him when Li Moying had already shouted out lightly as the lightning in his hand suddenly increased by a huge chunk.","A blinding bluish-purple light burst out from his chest, making his handsome and cold side profile look particularly grim, as if a god of death had descended.","The lightning bolt passed through the limbs of the Gigantic Octopus Coldfrost and rushed toward its body.","“Gulp...! Howl...!”","The Giant Octopus uttered a series of sharp cries. Feeling the pain, its limp body suddenly stood up.","The few huge eyes on his wrists suddenly opened at the same time, as they stared fiercely in Li Moying’s direction.","Obviously, it...He was enraged!","After sleeping for billions of years, it was not that it had never been awakened by invaders from the outside world, but this was the first time someone dared to hurt its main body!","Moreover, this audacious brat was a god!","How did the Ancient God Clan get into this place? How was it possible that he had walked to the bottom of the deep pool without being corroded by the devil qi and dying from madness?","The dark green eyes of the Giant Eye Octopus looked like ghost lamps from the netherworld in the dark and gloomy pool, making people feel cold.","However, the expression on Li Moying’s face didn’t change as he raised his hand to lightly caress the battle armor on his body.","This set ot battle armor was personally refined by Huang Yueli tor him. Not only was its defensive power extremely strong, it was also his Li ‘er’s favorite style. Every time he wore it, Li’ er would stare at him with shining eyes. Unfortunately, it was probably going to be scrapped here today.","Li Moying felt pity in his heart but the movements of his hands didn’t stop at all, long sword...He suddenly unsheathed his sword!","At this critical moment, even if he knew that his precious Spirit Armament would be damaged in the battle, he could only stake everything on it.","The instant the lightning lit up, the body of the extremely cold giant octopus also floated up from the bottom of the pool as it pounced towards Li Moying.","Huang Yueli’s expression turned cold as she hurriedly pounced onto the array and started calculating again.."]},{"number":4563,"title":"Chapter 4563: Under the deep pool (13)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4563: Under the deep pool (13)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","This time around, Huang Yueli could finally see the entire array clearly and her calculation speed was much faster than before.","In the surrounding water, lightning flashed and flickered. The devil qi fluctuated violently, and explosions continuously sounded.","If it were anyone else, they probably wouldn’t even be able to stand properly at this time.","However, Huang Yueli was still extremely calm as she stared intently at the array at the bottom of the pool. Her line of sight glided over the array markings inch by inch as her fingers rapidly changed the spells.","The more nervous she was, the more cautious she was, not letting go of any details.","She knew very well that the most outstanding genius was not the one with the highest talent, but the one who was the calmest in a crisis.","Because no matter how talented one was, a dead genius was no longer a genius. Only those who successfully survived the dangers and fought until the end could become true experts.","This calmness had saved her and Li Moying countless times, helping them surpass their peers time and time again, standing at the height they were at today.","This time would not be an exception.","Although this array was passed down from ancient times, on the one hand, due to years of disrepair, some of the array patterns had lost their original effect. On the other hand, the array of the Devil Clan was much simpler and cruder than that of the Ancient God Clan.","So after Huang Yueli had gone through a series of nervous and rigorous calculations, she had some confidence in her heart.","“It seems that this formation itself is not very complicated. The formation patterns on the outside are mainly used to condense devil qi. The purpose is to maintain the operation of this deep pool and the entire cave abode. If you want to open this door, you just have to crack the mechanism on the door...”","This point was something that Huang Yueli had not expected.","Logically speaking, such an important entrance to the passage must have been set up with complicated mechanisms and arrays to block people who wanted to invade.","Very few people would be like the owner of this cave dwelling, who had set up the array purely to raise these magical beasts and had not placed any emphasis on this circular door.","This gave Huang Yueli a feeling as though the owner of the cave dwelling was full of confidence and wasn’t worried that someone would enter the round door...","“This is... What was going on? The owner of the cave dwelling is so fearless. He definitely has something to rely on...","Huang Yueli stared at the round door for a while and suddenly understood. There was indeed a mechanism on the round door, but it was very simple. It was just a sunken energy tank.","This was like the lock used by ordinary people. As long as there was a suitable key, the door could be opened.","However, the key to an ordinary door only needed to be of a suitable shape. However, the key used to open this bronze door not only had to be of a suitable shape, but it also had to be able to activate the devil qi inside the door and perfectly match the array patterns on the outside of the door.","According to Huang Yueli’s calculations, once the outer array and the key in the middle of the energy tank were connected, the array at the bottom of the deep pool would be officially activated and the devil qi in the pool would be sucked into the array, filling all the array patterns with devil qi, thus producing a huge amount of energy, blasting open this bronze door!","It had to be said that the design of this array was quite exquisite.","The array formations outside the other treasuries were all used to kill intruders outside the door.","However, the master of the cave abode did the opposite.."]},{"number":4564,"title":"Chapter 4564: Under the deep pool (14)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4564: Under the deep pool (14)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The array outside the entrance was used to open the door!","Moreover, before the magic array was truly activated, these array patterns could also gather devil qi, raising the level of the devilic beasts in the deep pool by more than one level. It also played a very good defensive role.","This design...lt was indeed unexpected.","Even Huang Yueli, who was a self-proclaimed master of mechanisms, was deeply inspired.","“The design of this mechanism is too ingenious. However, it can only be done with the help of the treasures in the sect. Because the devil qi condensed by the treasures in the sect was too strong, if we didn’t borrow the array outside, even Moying and I wouldn’t be able to use brute force to break the array, so we could only rely on the mechanism...But we don’t have the key. What should we do?”","Huang Yueli quickly realised where the problem was and her heart instantly became heavy.","The mechanism’s operating principle was too simple, but it was precisely because it was simple that it was even more difficult to crack.","As long as they had the key, they could open it, but they didn’t have the key... “This is troublesome. Where do we find the key now? The only way is to find a way to reverse the shape of the key and the array patterns engraved on it according to the direction in which the array patterns flow. I’ll try my best to replicate the same key...”","However, this was easy to say, but it was as difficult as ascending to the heavens.","With Huang Yueli’s cultivation base, she could casually find a piece of metal material, no matter what shape she wanted to carve, no matter how complicated the patterns were, it would only take a few breaths to complete.","However, the problem was that just because there were array patterns did not mean that it could be recognized by the energy bar.","The key’s material, weight, formation patterns, spiritual imprint, and so on were all closely related to whether it could open the door.","It was almost impossible to replicate it perfectly.","The problem of the materials alone could not be solved.","But now, she had no better way. She could only try her best.","Fortunately, Huang Yueli had the habit of hoarding materials in the Sky","Phoenix Ring so she took out a few raw gemstones from the space on the spot.","Because this mechanism was discovered in the Devil Clan’s devil ore vein, so Huang Yueli’s first choice of materials was naturally the few pieces of devil ore that she had dug out from the mountain wall earlier.","She frowned and pondered for a while. According to the array patterns on the","outer edge of the circular door, she deduced a few possible key shapes. Using the Strange Fire in her hand, she completed several keys in a dozen breaths.","She did not hesitate at all. She took the keys and stuffed them into the energy tank to test them.","Unfortunately, her luck was really bad. None of these keys could open the door.","However, two of them resonated with the array patterns on the outside, even causing the devil qi in the pool to fluctuate.","However, this little fluctuation didn’t go as Huang Yueli had expected, causing the devil qi to pour into the array. The fluctuation only lasted for a short few breaths before it regained its calmness. The bronze door was still standing quietly on the spot without any changes.","Moreover, although these fluctuations failed to push open the door, they had instead attracted the attention of the Giant Eye Octopus!","This ancient ferocious beast had originally been completely enraged by Li Moying and was embroiled in a fight with him, as it had long forgotten about the main gate that it was guarding.","However, at this moment, it suddenly realized that the situation.... Something was wrong!"]},{"number":4565,"title":"Chapter 4565: Shocking History (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4565: Shocking History (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The gigantic body of the Extreme Frost Giant Eye Octopus paused for a moment in the pool and suddenly, its entire body shook. It couldn’t even be bothered about Li Moying who was still filled with hatred earlier as it turned around and rushed towards the bottom of the pool.","At this moment, Li Moying’s entire body was bathed in blood, as he had sunk into a bitter battle.","Even though he was already Dao Profound Realm now and still had a body full of powerful thunder attribute mystic skills, facing an ancient ferocious beast like the extremely cold giant octopus, he was still somewhat powerless.","Fortunately, he didn’t need to defeat the giant octopus. He just needed to stall it.","So Li Moying had basically adopted a defensive stance. Other than when the Giant Eye Octopus wanted to leave and come back to provoke it, the rest of the time, he would carefully control his movement technique, dodging within the limited water area.","Although it was very strenuous, at least he managed to stall the Giant Eye Octopus.","Especially after he had cut off one of the octopus’s limbs, the octopus wanted to kill him as soon as possible, so it chased after him with all its heart.","Just as Li Moying was gritting his teeth and persevering, the giant octopus turned around and ran away!","This was something he had never expected.","Because of this, Li Moying was stunned for a moment, not knowing what exactly went wrong.","However, he quickly reacted and chased after the Giant Eye Octopus.","“Damned fellow, stop! Stop! Aren’t you trying to kill me? I was the one who cut off your limbs. You stupid mollusk, can’t you even tell who your enemy is?”","Li Moying laughed coldly and at the same time, the power of lightning on his body suddenly increased explosively!","He swung his sword with both hands at the same time, and two dazzling sword forces shot out at the same time. They interweaved and formed an incomparably sharp force, which slashed toward one of the tentacles of the Giant Octopus Glacianus that was dragging behind him!","As the lightning fell, the tentacle also fell to the bottom of the pool.","Yet another limb had been severed by Li Moying!","“Gulp...! Gulp...”","With a scream, a violent energy fluctuation occurred at the bottom of the water. The enormous body of the Giant Octopus shuddered greatly. It was obviously in extreme pain!","It suddenly stopped rushing to the bottom of the pool and turned around to look at the Ancient God Clan that dared to provoke it again!","Although its regenerative ability was very strong, even if its limbs were cut off, as long as it was in a body of water with abundant devil qi, it could grow back over time. However, this did not mean that it was a small matter for its limbs to be cut off!","This was a challenge to its authority as the king of underwater beasts!","Moreover, it had not suffered such a serious injury for billions of years!","This Ancient God Clan brat actually dared to sneak attack it again and again. It must crush this stinky brat into meat paste!","The remaining six limbs of the Extreme Frost Giant Eye Octopus stretched out and its six huge green eyes emitted a terrifying cold light as it stared intently at Li Moying, as though it was going to pounce on him in the next second and tear him into pieces.","Compared to the extremely cold giant octopus which was tens of meters tall, Li Moying was as tiny as a mouse.","Coupled with the cold and dark pool water behind him, this scene was really terrifying. If it were anyone else, their legs would have gone weak.","But Li Moying didn’t feel anything as he lifted his chin slightly and his cold gaze met those six huge eyes.","The Gigantic Octopus shivered its limbs violently and was about to pounce on him.","But in the end, it suddenly turned around..."]},{"number":4566,"title":"Chapter 4566: Shocking History (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4566: Shocking History (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying had never expected that he had already cut off the second limb of the Giant Eye Octopus and this ferocious beast could still endure it and didn’t pounce towards him. Instead, it stubbornly turned around and charged towards Huang Yueli who was standing on top of the circular door.","This... Wasn’t he too persistent?","This time, Li Moying’s expression finally changed.","“Damn it, stop! Stop!”","Li ‘er clearly had not had the time to finish cracking the mechanism so if she let this Giant Eye Octopus charge over now, Li’ er would definitely be doomed!","Thinking of this point, Li Moying couldn’t care about anything else as he used all his strength to attack the extremely cold giant octopus crazily.","Countless bolts of lightning exploded with dazzling light and smashed towards the huge body of this ancient ferocious beast.","The sword light formed by the lightning caused a lot of wounds on the Giant Eye Octopus ‘body. The Giant Eye Octopus kept roaring. It was obviously on the verge of exploding.","But no matter how furious it was in its heart, it didn’t turn back to look at Li Moying but charged straight towards Huang Yueli.","“Li ‘er, be careful! Hurry up... Hurry up and get out of the way!”","Seeing that the tentacles of the giant octopus were about to wrap around Huang Yueli’s body, Li Moying’s expression changed as his voice started to tremble, afraid that he would see his little fox smashed into meat paste in the next moment.","Fortunately, Huang Yueli’s reaction was fast enough and the scene that he feared didn’t happen.","Huang Yueli suddenly stomped on the ground at the critical moment as her body bounced in the opposite direction.","The tentacles of the Giant Eye Octopus swept past her chest and finally smashed into the bronze door.","Even with such a huge force, the bronze door was still impregnable.","Huang Yueli’s petite body was like a leaf as she floated a distance in the water.","Li Moying was so frightened by her that he broke out in a cold sweat as he hurriedly transmitted his voice to her,” Li ‘er, hurry up....” Quickly leave the bottom of the pool and float up! You swim to the other side and stand in the opposite direction from me. Later, I’ll lure this ferocious beast over, and you can escape...”","“No, no, wait a little longer! I can’t just leave now!”","He had not expected that after Huang Yueli heard his words, she immediately shook her head and rejected him.","Li Moying’s brows creased tightly,” Li ‘er, you... Now is not the time to be stubborn. Leave that place first, and we’ll think of another way...”","“What else can we do? There were more and more piranhas above us, and it was even more difficult to get ashore! Moreover, after this incident, the Giant Eye Octopus was definitely on guard. The next time he came, he might not be able to lure it away from the bottom of the pool...We only have this one chance! Moreover...","I already know what’s going on. I have to try again!”","Under the pursuit of the Extreme Cold Giant Eye Octopus, Huang Yueli appeared rather pathetic as she had almost used all her Profound Energy, unleashing her movement Profound Skill to the extreme.","However, in front of such an ancient ferocious beast, he still did not have the slightest advantage. Every time he dodged, he was surrounded by danger.","However, her expression was very calm, and her eyes were even burning with confidence. As she dodged, she stared at the array at the bottom of the pool.","” Li ‘er...!!” Li Moying was so anxious that he almost vomited blood. He hated himself for being too far away from her and his ability wasn’t enough to drag her out from the water.."]},{"number":4567,"title":"Chapter 4567: Shocking History (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4567: Shocking History (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli pretended not to hear his words as her expression suddenly turned solemn.","“Alright, Moying, I’m going to make my move, this is the last time! Help me keep an eye out!”","Finishing her sentence, without waiting for Li Moying to react, she had already found the right timing and took advantage of the moment when the Giant Eye Octopus was rolling in the water and revealed the bronze door beneath her, she suddenly rushed over.","” Li","Li Moying was extremely anxious as the veins on his forehead popped out.","He was actually very clear that Huang Yueli wasn’t a rash person and since she insisted on doing this, she must have her reasons. But seeing her putting herself in danger, he couldn’t suppress the worry and fear in his heart.","The Extreme Frost Giant Eye Octopus was confused by Huang Yueli’s feint attack as its body pounced outwards, only to discover that Huang Yueli’s petite figure flashed past and appeared at the bottom of the pool.","It felt that it had been played and was extremely angry. However, its body was too big and it was not flexible enough to turn around. It took a few breaths of time to turn back.","After turning around, she pounced towards Huang Yueli crazily.","However, just this short few breaths of time was enough for Huang Yueli.","She took out a white token from her pocket, clenched it tightly with her slender fingers, and inserted it into the energy tank!","Following Huang Yueli’s actions, the entire mountain of the mineral vein suddenly shook violently.","Waves of tremors came from the bottom of the pool. Ripples spread out in the water and bounced back when they touched the rocks on both sides. After a few times, they formed a huge vortex.","The whirlpool grew larger and larger in a very short period of time. Soon, all the water in the deep pool was wrapped up and spun together.","All the living things in the water were also involuntarily sucked into the whirlpool.","Initially, Huang Yueli was still clutching tightly onto a protruding part of the bronze door, trying to stabilize her body but very quickly she realised that this kind of struggle was completely futile.","The suction force formed by the devil qi pouring into the array at the bottom of the pool was too great. The vortex’s rotation speed was getting faster and faster. This was not something that human strength could resist. The arm that she was holding on to the door was almost torn off by this force.","Just at this moment, Li Moying’s furious voice rang out beside her ear,” Li ‘er, let go quickly! Don’t be afraid, catch me, I’ll protect you!”","Immediately following that, Huang Yueli felt a large hand wrapping around her small hand.","The familiar body temperature instantly calmed her uneasy heart.","She let go of her other hand, relaxed her body, and floated with the water in the whirlpool.","All the living creatures in the deep pool were sucked in by this whirlpool so very quickly, Huang Yueli realised that those piranhas and nine-headed snakes were all sucked down from the upper level of the pool and were floating and sinking around them.","However, these magical beasts had clearly fainted from the shock. Many of them had already rolled their eyes and could no longer pose any threat to them.","The speed of the whirlpool’s rotation was getting faster and faster, so fast that Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s cultivation couldn’t bear it as they felt a wave of nausea.","Fortunately, this process did not last long.","About fifteen minutes later, the power of the vortex reached a critical point.","The circular bronze door could not withstand such a huge force and was finally blasted open.."]},{"number":4568,"title":"Chapter 4568: Shocking History (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4568: Shocking History (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Boom!”","With an earth-shattering explosion, the bronze door instantly shattered.","The water in the pond suddenly surged into the round entrance.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were pressed in the middle by a group of magical beasts ‘corpses and almost suffocated.","The water rushed out for a long distance before the momentum gradually subsided. Their bodies fell with the water and smashed heavily on the ground.","“Cough, cough, cough, cough! Oh my god, I... I accidentally choked on a mouthful of water just now. It’s too... It’s too ugly. It smells like fish...Ugh...” Huang Yueli covered her throat, feeling like she was about to vomit.","Only the heavens knew what was wrong with her just now. She actually opened her mouth. She really regretted it.","Li Moying also frowned but his reaction wasn’t as intense as Huang Yueli’s. He only took a few deep breaths and adjusted his inner breath before he regained his composure.","He hurriedly walked to Huang Yueli’s side and stretched out his hand to support her,” Li Jer, how are you? Are you hurt somewhere? Why do you feel so uncomfortable?”","Huang Yueli clutched her chest. Up till now, she still felt waves of disgust as her face turned pale.","However, she still forced herself to shake her head and said,”lt’s okay, I...” I’m fine. I just choked on water. I should be fine in a while. What injury could I possibly suffer? It’s obvious that you’re the one who’s seriously injured!”","Huang Yueli recalled the intense battle underwater and hurriedly raised her head to look at Li Moying.","As expected, Li Moying’s long black robe had already become tattered and tattered, with countless holes and every hole was a wound, and one could clearly see blood seeping out slowly from within.","Moreover, these were only superficial injuries.","Li Moying had been fighting with the ancient ferocious beast for such a long time and both parties had countless inner breath collisions so one could imagine that Li Moying’s internal injuries would be more serious than his external injuries.","Huang Yueli grew anxious as she grabbed onto his sleeve,” Moying, no way. Sit down first and let me take a look at your wound. Also, stretch out your hand and let me take your pulse, your internal injuries...”","“Alright, Li Jer, don’t be so nervous. I’m injured but it’s not as serious as you imagine. Moreover, now is not the time to check the wound. We are not completely out of danger yet. Let’s take a look at the surrounding situation first...” Li Moying pressed down on her small hand which was constantly groping up and down as his face turned slightly red.","Huang Yueli didn’t notice that she had touched any sensitive parts but she had to admit that Li Moying’s words were right.","They did not know where the door they had just opened led to. The two of them were far from safe!","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli resisted the urge to strip her husband as she quickly took out two bottles of pills from the Sky Phoenix Ring’s storage and threw them to Li Moying,” Then you should first take these pills to replenish your qi and blood and treat your internal injuries. It should be able to temporarily suppress your injuries...Don’t save me, eat it all!”","Seeing Li Moying opening the bottle cap and pouring it out, Huang Yueli hurriedly emphasized as she stared at Li Moying who directly poured the two bottles of heaven grade pills into his mouth.","Li Moying swallowed the pill and looked at the surrounding situation as he instantly revealed a trace of astonishment,” We...Where are we?”","Huang Yueli wasn’t in the mood to take a closer look earlier so when she turned her head, she was also stunned by the scene in front of her.."]},{"number":4569,"title":"Chapter 4569: Shocking History (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4569: Shocking History (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","They were now in an extremely huge karst cave. It was obvious that it was formed purely naturally. The surrounding rocks had been corroded by the devil qi and were deeply sunken.","Only the spot where the two of them were standing was still intact, forming a platform with a radius of several hundred meters.","Huang Yueli stood up and walked to the side for a while before she came to the edge of the high platform and stretched her head to look down.","Because of the erosion of the devil qi over hundreds of millions of years, the depression had already formed a bottomless gully, like a cliff.","Because it was really too deep, Huang Yueli couldn’t see the bottom of the ravine and could only see a black mist.","This mist was a mist droplet formed from extremely dense devil qi.","Some of these water droplets had seeped out over the years and fused into the water of the deep pool. It had already formed an environment rich in devil qi and even nurtured so many abnormally terrifying ferocious beasts.","One could imagine how strong the corrosive power of these water droplets was.","Earlier when she and Li Moying passed through the round door, many of the beasts in the deep pool were swept in along with the whirlpool.","It was just that she and Li Moying managed to stabilize their bodies in time, allowing them to land on the stage.","Those ferocious beasts had basically lost their consciousness. They were all washed directly into the gully below by the pool water. Most of them had been completely corroded and dissolved by these water droplets, turning into a pool of blood.","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli felt a lingering fear in her heart.","Fortunately, their luck was good enough. If they were careless, they would also be washed down. She was not 100% confident that she could climb out again...","Li Moying also walked over and took a glance downwards as his brows furrowed.","“This place is even stranger than the deep pool just now. I originally thought that this was most likely the exit, but now it seems that it shouldn’t be. I wonder how the owner of this cave dwelling found this place. The devil qi here is so dense that it is likely extremely rare even in the Devil Clan...”","If it were two devils who had come here, they would probably have fainted from joy and would not have thought about leaving.","Even if there was nothing here, as long as one could cultivate in such an environment, advancing and breaking through was just around the corner. Who would be in a hurry to leave?","But the problem was that he and Huang Yueli weren’t devils...","Staying in a place with dense Devil Qi required a large amount of Dark Force to form a defensive barrier on the surface of the body, which was very exhausting.","The longer he stayed, the worse it was for his body.","Therefore, leaving as soon as possible was the most important thing.","Huang Yueli looked at the surrounding environment and frowned.","“Is this platform so bare? Then what was this place built for? It can’t be that the owner of the cave abode spent so much effort to seal this place just to cultivate here, right?”","She originally thought that this was some sort of treasure trove.","But now, it didn’t seem like it.","Below this platform was a forbidden area with dense devil qi. Even Devil Overlord realm experts would not dare to jump down directly.","On the high platform...There was nothing, not even a mechanism...","Just as Huang Yueli was deep in thought, Li Moying suddenly thought of something as he turned his head and asked,” Oh right, Li ‘er, I haven’t asked you yet...” Just now, how did you open that door?”"]},{"number":4570,"title":"Chapter 4570: Shocking History (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4570: Shocking History (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","For a moment earlier, Li Moying had already lost all hope, feeling that Huang Yueli couldn’t possibly crack this array and was already prepared to risk his life to save her.","However, the truth was that after Huang Yueli tried to carve a few keys but failed, she suddenly seemed to have a flash of inspiration as she cracked the mechanism and opened the door.","This reversal was too amazing. He almost did not react in time.","Hearing that, Huang Yueli gave a slight smile as she took out a tiny white token from her sleeve and waved it in front of Li Moying.","“Of course...l’ll have to rely on this!”","Li Moying took a closer look and couldn’t help but be shocked, ” This is...King","Xiang’s Talisman Array?”","Huang Yueli nodded her head,” That’s right, it’s King Xiang’s Talisman Array! “I originally thought that it was impossible to crack the mechanism in such a short period of time, so I found the Xiang King’s Talisman Array. I wanted to see if I could activate the array formation inside so that we could increase our strength and charge out. Who knew that when I touched the array patterns on it. I suddenlv realized...This formation Dattern is actuallv of the same origin as the formation at the bottom of the deep pool!”","“Therefore, I immediately decided to use the Xiang King Talisman Array as a key and try it. The result is indeed as I expected...”","Li Moying was slightly startled and immediately reacted as he nodded his head,” In that case, this King Xiang’s Talisman Array should be found by Rui Jiang in this cave dwelling. No wonder it can activate the array in the cave dwelling.”","“That’s right.” Huang Yueli nodded slightly,” Furthermore, we should have misunderstood at the start, or rather, we were misled by Rui Jiang. Actually, the true use of this talisman is not to increase the combat strength of the army, but to open this door...”","Hearing this, Li Moying’s heart shook.","In that instant earlier, what Huang Yueli said, he had already thought of it.","But when he heard Huang Yueli’s words, it still made his heart incomparably shocked.","This was because such a large sum of money had already exceeded their imagination.","“This... This was really too surprising! Such a powerful Talisman Array that could be activated countless times was actually only... Just a key? But why had Rui Jiang never come here?","Doesn’t he know that this is a key?” Li Moying was slightly puzzled.","Judging from the situation in the deep pool just now, Rui Jiang should not have opened this door.","Otherwise, the giant octopus would have been injured long ago, and there shouldn’t be so many ferocious beasts in the deep pool.","Huang Yueli stroked her chin,” I think he probably doesn’t know. To be able to obtain this talisman and find such a good place to cultivate, the Devil Race might have already thought that they had a big advantage and didn’t continue to think about it.”","Now that Rui Jiang had been killed by them, they could only rely on their guesses.","However, this explanation was reasonable.","Most of the devils were simple-minded. Otherwise, with their combat talent, the gods would have long been no match for them.","Li Moying nodded his head in agreement but at the same time he couldn’t help but exclaim,” This is really a stroke of genius! What was the background of this Devil Clan? They were definitely peerless experts with revered status in ancient times! I really can’t imagine what kind of peerless expert would be able to use King Xiang’s Talisman Array as a key.. And what kind of place would the door that this key opens lead to?”"]},{"number":4571,"title":"Chapter 4571: Shocking History (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4571: Shocking History (7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying subconsciously said.","But as soon as he said it, he realized that his question was too stupid.","Because he and Huang Yueli were standing inside the door that was opened by this key!","However, the scene here...Compared to that extremely powerful key, it really did not match...","Huang Yueli also sank into deep thought, ” I’ve been thinking about this question. I originally thought that this was the exit, but this isn’t it. With such a precious key locked on the door, it should be a treasure vault.”","“But, where are the treasures here? Could it be...” Li Moying seemed to have thought of something.","Huang Yueli sighed softly,” I think your guess is right. The treasure is most likely hidden below...”","She stretched out her slender and fair finger and pointed at the deep ditch filled with devilic water below the high platform. Her face was filled with helplessness.","To be honest, the two of them had a lot of experience, but today’s situation was still very rare.","The two of them should be facing a great opportunity, but they could not be happy.","Because they were not devils!","This deep trench was both dangerous and an opportunity for the devils. However, to them, it was very likely to be a complete pit!","Not only did he not get any benefits, but he also had to take a huge risk. Only a fool would do this.","But the problem was that they had been forced to this position.","Obviously, if they did not find a way to find the secret hidden in this treasure vault, they could forget about leaving this place.","“This is really...” Li Moying didn’t know what to say.","Huang Yueli took a deep breath,” There’s no other way now, we...We still have to think of a way to go down and take a look.”","Li Moying thought for a moment and said,” I’ll go down to take a look first.","Wait for me upstairs...”","Before he could finish his words, Huang Yueli vetoed him sternly.","“It’s so dangerous down here. If there’s no one to cover you, who can save you if something happens? Besides, do you have the heart to let me stay on the high platform in fear? Or do you not believe in my ability and think that I will drag you down?”","Huang Yueli’s face was filled with displeasure as she pouted and glared at her husband.","Being coaxed and threatened by his little fox, what else could Li Moying say as he could only sigh,” Alright then, let’s go together.”","Huang Yueli’s anger turned into joy as she smiled and revealed her canine teeth,” That’s right, no matter what danger happens, we should be together. Besides, my intuition has always been accurate. I think our luck today should be very good. Perhaps this is really our opportunity!”","Huang Yueli’s premonition had always been accurate and it was the truth.","Hearing this, he didn’t know if it was a psychological effect but in short, Li Moying felt much more at ease.","Huang Yueli took out a long rope from her space and let Li Moying tie it around her waist while she also tied the other end around her waist.","Don’t look at how this rope looked very ordinary. It was actually refined using very rare materials. It was a high-level treasured weapon. Even Dao Profound Realm powerhouses ‘attacks were unable to make it suffer the slightest bit of damage.","Of course, she didn’t know if it was useful against the devil qi, but at least it was a guarantee.","When the two of them were ready, they carefully moved and slowly climbed down from the rock wall.."]},{"number":4572,"title":"Chapter 4572: Shocking History (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4572: Shocking History (8)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The process of climbing down was much simpler than they had imagined.","Because the cliff below the high platform was formed by the natural erosion of devil qi, it was uneven in itself, and there were many places where he could use it as a foothold.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s cultivation was displayed here and although under the suppression of the devilic aura, they could only unleash less than ten percent of their strength, but their physical strength was still far beyond ordinary people so climbing the rock was still a piece of cake.","Before long, they had already descended to a depth of several thousand meters.","This was the depth that they could not see from the high platform just now.","Originally, the two of them had some guesses about the situation below. They thought that the situation below the high platform might be the same as in the deep pool. There might be all kinds of ferocious beasts or some dangerous traps. They were even on full alert and carefully guarded against them.","But in reality, none of this happened.","On the other hand, there were all kinds of dried corpses of fierce beasts hanging on the protruding mountain walls.","Some of the corpses were fresh and looked familiar. It seemed that they had just rushed in through the circular door with them...","Even so, Li Moying didn’t dare to slack off as he continued to concentrate fully on observing the situation beneath his feet.","“Looks like we’ve already climbed half the distance. Nothing has happened so far...My divine sense can’t detect any dangerous devils here, but it’s better to be careful. The density of the devil qi below is getting higher and higher. We have to be careful...","As Li Moying spoke, he suddenly realised that Huang Yueli had not responded to his words.","This was very rare.","Throughout the entire climb, Huang Yueli was talking to him. On one hand, it was to disperse the oppressive feeling that was caused by the dense devilic aura. On the other hand, it was to let the other party know her position in the darkness.","Li Moying was still thinking about what was going on when suddenly, he felt a tight grip on his waist.","The rope he had tied around his body had been straightened.","This meant that Huang Yueli was already a few metres away from him!","He didn’t know when his wife had stopped, but he hadn’t noticed it yet!","Thinking of this, Li Moying became anxious as he immediately raised his volume,” Li ‘er, Li’ er?! Where are you? You... Did something happen to you? What was going on?","Hurry up and answer me!”","The next moment, Huang Yueli’s voice rang out,” Cough cough, I’m fine. Husband, don’t be nervous, I’m just.... I just discovered something strange. It’s too shocking...”","Li Moying was startled,” What did you discover?”","Huang Yueli asked: ” Don’t you feel that there’s something wrong with the cave wall on the other side? I keep feeling that there seems to be something on the opposite mountain wall...’","“What is it?” Li Moying frowned as his heart skipped a beat.","In fact, it was very dark below the high platform. The two of them could only see a few dozen meters around them. The further areas were covered by black mist, and they were completely relying on their divine senses to investigate.","Although the result of the spiritual sense inspection was nothing unusual, this did not mean that it was absolutely safe.","In such a place with dense devil qi, it was too unfriendly to their Ancient God Clan. Any accident could happen.","Huang Yueli hurriedly replied,” It’s not anything bad, it’s just...” It just feels a little strange. Moreover, I felt that King Xiang’s Talisman Array had a connection with something just now...We’d better take a good look.”","Just as her voice fell, Huang Yueli raised her hand and a flame shot out from her fingertips, directly shooting towards the opposite cave wall.","For a moment, the light shone brightly!"]},{"number":4573,"title":"Chapter 4573: Shocking History (9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4573: Shocking History (9)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The flame in Huang Yueli’s hand lit up the entire cave wall.","At the same time when she made her move, Li Moying had already mobilized the Profound Energy in his body to be on guard, afraid that there would be any accidents.","However, in reality, the surroundings were still silent. Nothing unusual had happened.","However, after the cave walls were illuminated, something was indeed revealed.","“This is...These words were...An inscription left behind by the master of the cave?” Li Moying narrowed his eyes and looked for a while, as he was slightly astonished as he raised his eyebrows.","At the bottom of the cave, there was a huge black stone tablet. The material was nothing special. It was the kind of magic ore that they had seen earlier.","However, the materials used for this stone tablet were countless times purer than those outside the door.","What really surprised the two of them were the rows of words carved on the stone tablet.","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes as she couldn’t hide the doubt in her eyes,” Why? When the ancient devils built their cave abodes, did they like to leave inscriptions in them?”","Speaking of which, when the two of them were in the lower realm, the emperors of the mortal world liked to leave inscriptions everywhere to show their existence.","However, cultivators did not have such a habit.","After arriving in the God Realm, she and Li Moying had gone to some of the senior experts ‘cave abodes but they didn’t discover such a situation.","Li Moying shook his head slightly,” I’ve never heard of such a thing. Could it be that this is a special habit of the devil race?”","“How about... Why don’t we go over and see what’s engraved on the stone tablet? Oh right, Moying, do you know the characters of the ancient era?”","Huang Yueli turned around and asked.","Because the black mist formed by the surrounding devil qi was too dense and blocked their vision, the two of them could not see what was engraved on it clearly from where they were standing.","If he wanted to see it clearly, he had to get closer.","Li Moying hesitated for a moment before replying,” Ancient characters...” When I first arrived in the God Realm, in order to allow me to read the ancient books, the clan did arrange such a course for me. However, I only learned the language of the gods. The language of the devils... It should be different, right?” Hearing these words, Huang Yueli instantly appeared a little disappointed.","Li Moying’s words were really too logical, making her unable to refute.","However, she was depressed for a while before she pulled herself together.” Forget it. No matter what, let’s go and take a look first. If he couldn’t understand it, he could make a copy of the inscription and find a way to understand it in the future. Since this stone tablet is here, it must have its purpose.”","Li Moying naturally felt that whatever his wifey said was right.","Since he had already lit up the fire to see the surrounding situation clearly and there wasn’t any danger, he relaxed and together with Huang Yueli, he borrowed the various tools that Huang Yueli had kept in her space to crawl towards the other end of the karst cave.","About fifteen minutes later, they arrived at the side of the stone tablet.","“Alright, shall we start Skill-Storing now? Or wait...” Huang Yueli supported her chin and before she could finish her sentence, she saw a trace of astonishment flash past Li Moying’s eyes. She immediately stopped and turned around to ask,” Husband, what’s wrong?”","Li Moying shook his head but the shock on his face didn’t lessen,” It’s nothing, I just.... It’s just a little unexpected. The words on this monument are the words of the ancient gods. I can recognize them!”","“What? Really?” Huang Yueli’s eyes widened in shock.."]},{"number":4574,"title":"Chapter 4574: Shocking History (10)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4574: Shocking History (10)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying nodded his head, “That’s right, I wouldn’t be wrong about that.’","Huang Yueli frowned slightly, “But this... this doesn’t make sense. It can’t be that this stone tablet was left by someone from the Ancient God Clan, can it?” It was impossible.","After all, this cave dwelling was built on top of a Devil ore vein. Although it was still unclear what kind of treasure was hidden underneath the vein, one could clearly sense from the surrounding Devil qi that it was definitely a secret treasure suitable for the Devil Clan.","To say that the owner of this cave dwelling was not a devil clan, but belonged to an Ancient God... Everyone would say, “Impossible!","However, the words on the stone tablet... He did not know how to explain it.","Facing Huang Yueli’s doubtful gaze, Li Moying didn’t answer right away. His pair of dark and deep eyes didn’t blink as he stared at the stone tablet, his perfectly formed thin lips tightly pursed.","As his gaze slowly moved down, the expression on his face grew more and more solemn. In the end, he could not help but show a trace of astonishment.","“What is it? That was... How is that possible?”","Huang Yueli asked immediately: “What exactly happened? What is written on the stone tablet?”","“The contents of the stone tablet... If I hadn’t seen it with my own eyes, I really","wouldn’t have believed it...”","Li Moying sighed again before clearing his throat as he explained in detail to Huang Yueli.","“Simply put, this stone tablet was not made by the owner of the cave dwelling, but... It was left by a friend of his. This friend was an ancient god, so the tablet was written in the god’s language. This friend is Senior King Xiang, who forged the Formation Talisman in your hand!”","When Li Moying mentioned “the Ancient God Clan’s friend”, Huang Yueli remembered the situation when the Bronze Door was opened earlier and had already made a guess in her heart.","However, when Li Moying said the words “Senior King Xiang”, she couldn’t help but let out a cry of surprise.","“It really is Senior King Xiang! But he... How did he get mixed up with the Devils? This... This is too...lsn’t it too unbelievable?”","The race of gods and the race of Devils had always been mortal enemies. They hated each other to the bone.","Moreover, this enmity was different from that between the Sacred Phoenix Clan and the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","In ancient times, there were no conflicts between the two great Ancient God Clans. They even had a good relationship. Later, due to the competition for resources, they gradually developed a rift. After generations of accumulation, they became hostile to each other.","But the Devil Clan was different. The Devil Clan, the Ancient God Clan, and the human race were not the same race at all. They did not treat each other like humans.","The Devil Clan used the primordial spirit and body of the God Clan geniuses to refine pills. They simply treated the God Clan as animals. Although the God Clan were not as cruel to the Devil Clan, they would never be merciful when killing the other side.","In the end, the two sides used the power of Heaven and Earth in different ways and had different natures. This point alone was the source of their natural hatred.","Even Huang Yueli and Li Moying, who had only recently arrived in the God","Realm, had instinctively developed hatred for the Devil Clan, so much so that they didn’t need anyone to brainwash them. This was due to the difference in the Heavenly Dao that both parties followed, and it was an instinct that was formed.","Huang Yueli had never thought that ane from the Ancient God Clan would actually befriend a one from the Devil Clan!","Moreover, this Ancient God Clan was not an ordinary person, but the infamous and legendary King Xiang!"]},{"number":4575,"title":"Chapter 4575: Shocking History (11)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4575: Shocking History (11)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying’s expression turned cold as he narrowed his eyes and lowered his voice.","“I find it inconceivable as well. However, the contents of the inscription on this stele are a clear indication of this point. The owner of this cave dwelling is a devil exponent named Ruiying, and he seems to be a Devil King of the Devil Clan. Senior King Xiang is on good terms with him, so he was invited to build this cave dwelling for him. The friendship between the two can be seen from this.","No matter which clan it was, their cave dwelling was the most important.","After all, what expert would not make many enemies in the process of becoming stronger? Once their cave dwelling was broken into by the enemy, they would definitely die without a burial place.","Finding the other party to build their own cave abode was a sign of friendship between the two parties. They could trust each other with their lives.","The more Huang Yueli listened, the more she found it strange. Frowning, she thought for a moment before saying: “This...l really can’t imagine... But it seems to be true. Originally, I didn’t think that the Devils could build such a large and complex mechanism. It’s fair to say that it’s the work of King Xiang. Although the mechanisms here aren’t as complicated compared to other ancient formations, they’re activated by Devil Qi! It’s ten times more difficult than using Heaven and Earth Profound Qi!”","When Li Moying heard this, he slowly nodded, “In that case, it makes sense...”","“So, this is really built by King Xiang! But what’s going on... Why exactly... Could King Xiang be together with the Devils? The Devils are bloodthirsty and cruel, killing countless gods. Let’s not talk about that hatred, but more importantly, the Devils are eccentric in their actions and have no moral compass at all. It’s even impossible to communicate with them. What was King","Xiang thinking?”","After Huang Yueli thought about it, she still found it unbelievable.","It wasn’t that she and Li Moying had never dealt with the Devil Clan before, and the two of them were still mingling with the Devil Army these days!","However, it was absolutely impossible for them to have any good feelings towards the Devils.","The Devils’ selfish and emotionless way of doing things was really disgusting. Besides, in just a few days, they had personally witnessed many Devils torturing and killing humans...","Of course, Huang Yueli was well aware that for the Devil Clan, there was no question of right or wrong. That was their instinct!","After all, the Heavenly Dao allowed them to absorb Devil Qi to become stronger. Under the influence of Devil Qi, the Devils would become so brutal. However, she believed that it was because of this that the Devil Clan and the Ancient God Clan could not communicate with each other.","Li Moying sighed deeply, “Senior King Xiang has been dead for a trillion years, so we have no idea what he was thinking. He only briefly mentioned the reason for building the cave at the beginning. It was probably because the Devil King Ruiying wanted to find a place to live in seclusion, so he helped him. The large section of the stone tablet at the back is used to introduce the situation in this karst cave...”","Hearing these words, Huang Yueli’s spirits rose again, “The situation inside the karst cave! Husband, hurry up and tell me!”","Compared to the history of billions of years ago, which could not be traced back, the situation in the cave was naturally more important.","After all, the two of them were still trapped here and had no idea how to get out!","The first priority was, of course, to find the exit.","If there were detailed clues on this stone tablet, it would save them a lot of trouble.."]},{"number":4576,"title":"Chapter 4576: Shocking History (12)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4576: Shocking History (12)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","At the mention of this, Li Moying’s tense expression relaxed a little, even revealing a faint smile.","“Don’t worry. King Xiang has said almost everything. If we do what he says, we’ll be able to leave right away. Let me finish reading the inscription first.”","Huang Yueli hurriedly nodded her head as she raised her right hand and acted like an obedient baby, “Alright, alright, read it!”","Huang Yueli stood next to her husband and listened to his deep and magnetic voice echoing in the vast karst cave. She was a little distracted at first, but as she listened, she was drawn in, and the light in her eyes grew brighter and brighter.","Aside from his interactions with the owner of the cave dwelling, King Xiang’s inscription also mentioned a few other things.","Firstly, it mentioned King Xiang’s Array Talisman which Huang Yueli had obtained from Ruijiang.","This was actually refined into a bronze door key. As for the ability to increase a cultivator’s strength, it was just an accidental feature upon successful refining.","The most important thing was that King Xiang had refined this talisman for the Devil King Ruiying. Therefore, it had to be powered by Devil Qi. Therefore, it could only benefit the Devil Clan and was almost useless to the God Clan! In addition, since the talisman needed to accumulate a certain amount of energy before it could be activated. Thereafter, it would be dormant as the energy had been drained after each use. It could not be used continuously.","Hearing these words, Huang Yueli finally understood.","No wonder she and Li Moying had tried several times, but they were unable to activate the talisman.","It turned out that the energy accumulated in the array talisman had already been exhausted by Ruijiang.","When they thought about it carefully, they had been wrong about this matter. There were many clues in the past.","Every time the Devil Army fought the God Clan, it was not a continuous battle.","After each battle, they would pause for three to five days before continuing. Otherwise, Blessed City would have been conquered long ago.","At first, Huang Yueli had thought that the devils didn’t have any understanding of the art of war, so they didn’t have any idea how to take advantage of the victory in order to continue their pursuit. But now that she thought about it, it might just be that the talisman had lost its effectiveness and needed to be recharged...","She was also surprised by the fact that the talisman needed to be activated by Devil Qi.","This also meant that even if she obtained the talisman, she would have to use it carefully to avoid exposing the fact that she was cultivating with dark qi.","The second thing was that King Xiang had mentioned the location of this cave dwelling.","It turned out that this karst cave was discovered by him and Devil King Ruiying during their training. The whole mineral vein was extremely huge, and it went all the way to the underground, where Huang Yueli and Li Moying were.","Devil King Ruiying had gathered tens of thousands of devil labourers and spent hundreds of years secretly digging this mine and building a cave dwelling on the ruins.","However, just because the mine had been emptied did not mean that there was no source of Devil Qi in the cave abode. The truly important treasures were still sealed at the bottom of the mine.","“This is a piece of Empyrean Devil Crystal!” Li Moying added in a deep voice. Huang Yueli was slightly startled, “You said... Empyrean Devil Crystals?”","Li Moying thought that she hadn’t heard of it, so he explained, “I’ve heard that in places where Devil Qi is dense, a kind of treasure will naturally form. It’s formed by the dense Devil Qi that solidifies into the Empyrean Devil Crystal! It is said that this entire vein of devil ore was formed by the immense aura from that Devil Crystal.”","“I know, I’ve also read about it in the ancient records.” Huang Yueli nodded her head, but she was still extremely stunned, “But this kind of thing.... doesn’t it exist only in legends?”"]},{"number":4577,"title":"Chapter 4577: King Xiang’s Trial(l)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4577: King Xiang’s Trial(l)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying sighed slightly, “Originally, I thought this was just a rumour left over from ancient times. After all, after so many years of fighting with the Devil Race, no one had seen the existence of the Empyrean Devil Crystal... But now...”","He didn’t finish, but Huang Yueli could fully understand the meaning behind his words.","The Empyrean Devil Crystal wasn’t the only legendary artifact. In the legends of ancient times, there were countless artifacts, and many of them were said to be divine, making it hard for people to believe that such an item really existed.","Now that the Empyrean Devil Crystal was real, did the other artifacts also exist?","Li Moying must have been too shocked as he felt that his understanding of the","Divine Realm had been affected.","And wasn’t it the same with Huang Yueli?","It wasn’t just the legendary Empyrean Devil Crystal. Everything she had experienced in the cave today was beyond her imagination.","In ancient times, the clan leader of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, King Xiang, was actually good friends with the devil king of a devil race. Their relationship was so close that he even built a cave dwelling for the other side!","This news really shocked them.","Moreover, Huang Yueli’s intuition told her that this matter couldn’t be spread, otherwise it would definitely cause chaos in the Twelve Continents.","She thought for a while and gradually calmed down. A disappointed expression appeared on her face, “It’s a pity. Even if the Empyrean Devil Crystal is hidden in the cave, it’s of little use to us. We can’t sell it to the devils, can we? Could it be that we have to give it to the military in exchange for military merits? How many military merits can this thing be exchanged for? Besides, I have so many military merits that I can’t use them up.”","The moment she thought about the fact that there was no buyer for the Empyrean Devil Crystal, Huang Yueli’s heart ached.","What a good treasure!","A top notch Heavenly Treasure from ancient times!","Even if she couldn’t use it, how much wealth would she get if she sold it?","However, the current situation was inconvenient. She had no use for it, and she could not sell it for money. Besides, it might be a big problem if she kept this thing with dense Devil Qi in herhands...","Li Moying looked at her conflicted little face, and the corners of his lips turned up slightly as he deliberately smiled, “I also feel that this thing is a problem.","Why don’t we just leave the Empyrean Devil Crystal here and find the exit to leave directly? This place is not good for us. There’s no need to stay any longer...”","“No! How can that be?”","Sure enough, when Huang Yueli heard this, she exploded.","“I went through so much trouble to get to this karst cave, and there are such powerful treasures hidden here. Do you want me to go back empty-handed?","No, of course not! No matter how inconvenient this Empyrean Devil Crystal is, I have to take it with me!”","Li Moying shook his head as he couldn’t help but laugh out loud.","When Huang Yueli heard his laughter, she was stunned for a moment. Only then did she realise that her husband had seen her money-grubbing gaze again, and she immediately shrugged her shoulders in embarrassment.","Even though they were an old couple, she still wanted to portray her image as a Goddess in front of her husband...","Huang Yueli hurriedly coughed twice as she forcefully explained, “This...” What I mean is that since even Ruijiang knows about the existence of this cave, there must be someone else in the Devil Clan who knows about it.. In the future, if the Devils obtain this Empyrean Devil Crystal, they can use it to cultivate! Wouldn’t that threaten the safety of countless people on the twelve continents of our God Clan? How can we stand by and watch this happen?”"]},{"number":4578,"title":"Chapter 4578: King Xiang’s Trial (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4578: King Xiang’s Trial (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Seeing that Li Moying didn’t say anything, Huang Yueli continued.","“Husband, as the leaders of the two great God Clans, it is our duty to save the people. So let’s take this Empyrean Devil Crystal away for the sake of the people!”","As Huang Yueli spoke, her two eyes sparkled and her entire body was filled with the radiance of ideals!","If Li Moying hadn’t seen her drooling over the Empyrean Devil Crystal earlier, he might have believed it!","Unfortunately...","However, his wife had put a lot of effort into her performance, and he had to eat a bear’s heart and a leopard’s bile to dare to expose her.","Li Moying’s right hand clenched into a fist as he put it to his lips and coughed twice, “That’s right, wife, you’re right. We can’t be so selfish as to think only of ourselves. We still have to treat the world as our own responsibility. Since that’s the case, let’s find a way to take the Empyrean Devil Crystal with us.","Upon hearing this, Huang Yueli nodded her head in satisfaction. She then asked: “Is there anything written on this stone tablet that we need to do to get the Empyrean Devil Crystal?”","Li Moying nodded his head, “There are a few words on the stone tablet, but I don’t think they’re very helpful. It says that the Empyrean Devil Crystal is hidden just below this karst cave. It should be at the bottom of this naturally corroded platform, so we’ll definitely be able to find it if we climb down. It’s just...”","Huang Yueli asked hastily when she heard Li Moying stop.","Li Moying mumbled, “King Xiang said that Devil King Ruiying wanted to leave this piece of Empyrean Devil Crystal for the true geniuses of the Devil Race. Not only do you need to have outstanding natural talent, but you also need to learn the methods of the God Race. So he left a little trick as a trial. Only those who pass the trial will be able to obtain this piece of Empyrean Devil Crystal.","When Huang Yueli heard this, she wasn’t too surprised.","This was not the first time she had entered a senior expert’s treasure vault. Of course, she knew that even if these experts were dead, they would not casually give away their treasures while they were still alive. There was definitely a trial.","If there was no trial, she would be worried that this was a trap.","After all, this was the cave dwelling of a powerhouse of the Devilish race. King Xiang’s inscription also clearly stated that this trial was for the Devilish race.","As a God Clan warrior, she was not sure if she could pass the trial.","However, she did not know the details yet, so she would not underestimate herself.","Huang Yueli nodded her head and replied: “I understand. Is there anything else mentioned on the stone tablet?”","“No, that’s all.” Li Moying shook his head.","Huang Yueli said: “Then let’s make full use of our time. We will follow what King Xiang said and climb down to the bottom of the karst cave to take a look at the situation. Besides, I don’t think our luck is that good. We found this karst cave all the way here, but we will fall on the last step and not be able to pass the trial...”","Li Moying had no objections.","The two of them spent some time copying the inscription and putting it away. Then they continued to climb down the cave wall.","As they approached the bottom of the karst cave, the Devil Qi became even denser, and even Li Moying found it difficult to breathe.","Although he now knew that this was the effect of the Devil Qi radiation from the Empyrean Devil Crystal, he was still worried about Huang Yueli’s condition.","He turned back to look at Huang Yueli with deep worry in his eyes, “Li’er, you...","How are you feeling? If you can’t hold on, let me know right away!”","Who knew that Huang Yueli’s verbose reply was much stronger than he had thought.."]},{"number":4579,"title":"Chapter 4579: King Xiang’s Trial (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4579: King Xiang’s Trial (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Husband, don’t worry about me. I have King Xiang’s Array Talisman. I suddenly remembered that this Array Talisman needs to be powered by Devil Qi, right? Besides, I still have to accumulate a lot of Devil Qi and spend a lot of time. Therefore, I tried to force out the Devil Qi that had invaded my body and channel it into the Array Talisman...”","Huang Yueli’s voice contained a trace of a smile.","“I didn’t expect it to be so useful! This talisman absorbs Devil Qi very quickly. It can absorb all the Devil Qi I force out. Based on that, when we leave this karst cave, the talisman will be filled with energy!”","Li Moying raised his eyebrows in surprise, “There’s such a thing?”","” That’s right.” Huang Yueli nodded her head and asked, “Husband, how do you feel? If you also feel uncomfortable due to the overly strong Devil Qi, I can pass you the Array Talisman...”","“No need!”","Without waiting for Huang Yueli to finish her sentence, Li Moying rejected her,” Keep the Array Talisman for yourself! My cultivation is now a major realm higher than yours, and my endurance is also much stronger than yours.","This bit of Devil Qi is nothing to me. Just take care of yourself!”","Huang Yueli pouted, knowing that her husband was worried about her so she didn’t say anything.","After Li Moying advanced, his abilities had indeed advanced by leaps and bounds. Along the way down from the cave dwelling, the combat ability he displayed was much higher than hers.","This made Huang Yueli puzzled as she couldn’t figure out why she didn’t advance.","Because there were no living things in the cave, the two of them overcame the influence of the dense Devil Qi.","Therefore, it did not take long for them to successfully land at the bottom of the karst cave.","Huang Yueli ignited a small flame on her fingertips and with the light from the flame, she and Li Moying circled around the bottom of the platform and soon discovered an arch-shaped entrance.","“Let’s go, this way!”","Huang Yueli pointed in the direction of the entrance.","The two of them walked in carefully.","Originally, the two of them were a little worried. After all, the Devil Qi outside the arch was already so dense that it was unbearable. After entering, this energy would definitely be even stronger. It was not impossible for it to be so strong that they could not approach it at all.","However, that was not the case.","After the two of them stepped into the archway, the Devil Qi that had been following them like a shadow suddenly disappeared. They could not sense it at all.","It was as though a huge mountain that had been pressing down on them had been moved away by someone, causing Huang Yueli and Li Moying to involuntarily let out a long breath as they felt much more relaxed.","Huang Yueli took a few steps in the arched door as she thought about it,’ There’s actually no trace of Devil Qi here. Of course, there’s also no trace of heaven and earth profound qi. This is extremely pure air, too pure...Ever since I left Soaring Heavens Continent, I have never felt such a pure aura...”","The Profound Qi in the lower realm was dispersed, so Profound Qi only gathered near the Spirit Ore Vein. It was considered a treasured land for cultivation and was very rare.","In some places far away from the Spirit Ore Vein, the Profound Qi in the air was so thin that it was almost non-existent. This was the norm.","However, in the God Realm, the situation was reversed. It was rare to find a place without any energy fluctuations. Even if there was no Profound Qi of Heaven and Earth, there was still Devil Qi.","“This must be man-made. It must be King Xiang’s method!” Huang Yueli quickly came to a conclusion.."]},{"number":4580,"title":"Chapter 4580: King Xiang’s Trial (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4580: King Xiang’s Trial (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","An array that shielded Profound Qi from the surroundings was only the basics for an Array Master.","Huang Yueli herself was able to set it up in a few breaths.","However, the array in this karst cave was fundamentally different from ordinary shielding arrays.","The source of the Devil Qi wasn’t outside the formation, but inside it!","Through the formation, King Xiang allowed the Devil Qi of the Empyrean Devil Crystal to escape, but it turned the inside of the formation into a pure land without any energy fluctuations.","This kind of technique was really quite high end and even Huang Yueli couldn’t think of how it was done.","Li Moying frowned slightly as he revealed a puzzled expression,” Why did King Xiang arrange such an array? Since there was a method used to trial Devil Clan geniuses here, why did it have to shield the Devil Qi? This... This doesn’t make sense.”","Huang Yueli thought about it and felt that she didn’t understand. She could only say: ” Let’s take a look at the situation inside first!”","The two of them slowly walked inside.","Behind the arched door was a very spacious hall. There were a total of twelve pure white carved pillars supporting it. The roof was raised very high, at least as high as ten people standing atop each other. These pillars were very thick, and each pillar was the width of two people.","All the walls of the hall were carved with the same pure white marble. Apart from the pure colour, the main characteristic of this marble was that it contained no energy.","Therefore, whether it was in the lower realm or the God Realm, pure white marble was very common, and it was a very cheap material.","After all, no matter where it was, the more energy the material contained, the more precious it was.","Huang Yueli usually disdained pure white marble and this material was so inferior that even a Spirit Armament Master would feel that it was a waste of energy to look at it.","However, now that these stones had been piled up by King Xiang into a magnificent palace, it was filled with a solemn and dignified feeling.","Huang Yueli stood in the main hall and suddenly felt her restless heart becoming calmer and calmer. Even her breathing and pulse seemed to have slowed down a lot.","At this moment, Li Moying’s voice rang out beside her,” Li ‘er, don’t you feel that this place is too quiet?”","Huang Yueli asked: ” Did you feel it too? This... It should be the influence of these pure white marbles...l didn’t expect these stones to have such a special effect. I used to throw them away like trash! King Xiang is indeed worthy of being an ancient Spirit Armament Master!”","While Huang Yueli was sighing, her heart was also feeling uneasy.","The more outstanding King Xiang’s attainments in formation techniques and mechanisms were, the more difficult the trial he left behind.","This made Huang Yueli both expectant and uneasy.","Li Moying surveyed his surroundings and suddenly raised his hand to point at the center of the hall as he said in a low voice,” Li’er, is that rock there the","Empyrean Devil Crystal?”","Huang Yueli followed the direction of his finger and looked over.","In the middle of this pure white hall, there was a square platform. Above the platform was a transparent cover, and inside the cover was a stone floating in the air that emitted a faint glow.","Huang Yueli muttered to herself, “Looks like this should be our destination...But...”","She suddenly hesitated.","Actually, she had already noticed the stone in the transparent cover when she had just entered.."]},{"number":4581,"title":"Chapter 4581: King Xiang’s Trial (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4581: King Xiang’s Trial (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","However, she couldn’t be sure that this was what they were looking for.","This stone didn’t look like the legendary Empyrean Devil Crystal at all!","Looking at the Devil Qi spreading outside the palace gate, it was so black that it was almost impossible to see anything. One could know that the Devil Qi itself should be pure black energy.","However, this stone was transparent. Upon closer inspection, it was a bit white. If one looked more closely, it seemed to have a faint seven-coloured radiance...","Its colourful appearance was quite extraordinary, but no matter what, it was not black at all!","How could Huang Yueli tell whether it was real or fake?","Li Moying had the same doubts, “Could this be a deliberate trap set by King Xiang? A deliberately created illusion?","“Of course, it is not impossible. All we can do now is try!” Huang Yueli thought for a moment and suddenly took a step forward, walking towards the centre of the hall.","Li Moying unconsciously wanted to pull her back, “Li ‘er, don’t go alone, I’ll go with you...”","“It’s fine, Husband. You can stay there.” Huang Yueli shook her head and stopped him.","“Since King Xiang’s inscription says that this is a trial, it shouldn’t be something that deliberately harms people’s lives, so you don’t have to worry too much. On the contrary, if you were too close, the aura between us would attract each other and cause the Profound Energy to fluctuate. It might even prevent me from cracking the mechanism...”","Huang Yueli could roughly guess that King Xiang’s process was mostly achieved through mechanisms.","Moreover, King Xiang had gone to great lengths to completely remove the Devil Qi in this palace. This meant that one had to pass the test in an environment that was free from the influence of energy fluctuations.","Normally, even if several cultivators entered at the same time, it would be difficult for them to influence each other.","But Huang Yueli and Li Moying had cultivated the dual cultivation method together, and the influence between them was extremely strong. Sometimes, when they didn’t even notice it, it would affect the other party’s blood essence...","When Li Moying heard this, his eyebrows furrowed.","However, he could only follow her instructions and retreat, pushing himself to the farthest spot from Huang Yueli by the wall and watching his little fox walk step by step towards the high platform in the middle of the hall.","Huang Yueli’s footsteps were very steady as she walked up the stairs step by step. Very quickly, she stood in the middle of the platform.","She took a deep breath and placed her hand on the top of the transparent cover. The next moment...","Suddenly, a silver light flashed in front of her eyes and her body seemed to be sucked into something!","However, this change only lasted for a moment before it ended.","Huang Yueli’s cry of surprise was still stuck in her throat, but she had already realised that she had regained her footing when she landed on a patch of green grass.","Above her head was a bright starry sky.","The pitch black night sky was like a curtain of the most luxurious black velvet. On the curtain, sparks of fire were like pearls decorating it, forming beautiful patterns.","For a moment, Huang Yueli was a little dazed because she didn’t know where she was.","However, as she stared at the sparkling stars in the sky for a while, her heart began to stir. She suddenly understood why the mechanism King Xiang had left behind had sent her here.","How could the stars in the sky form such beautiful patterns?"]},{"number":4582,"title":"Chapter 4582: King Xiang’s Trial (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4582: King Xiang’s Trial (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","It was indeed a beautiful pattern, but it was an array pattern that contained a powerful force!","These array patterns were something that Huang Yueli had never seen before. Not only had she not seen it in the lower realm, even after she came to the God Realm, she had read many ancient books on array techniques but she had never seen the same array patterns.","“Could it be that this is the formation pattern that King Xiang created? No, that was hard to say. It could just be an ancient array technique...After all, the ancient array techniques have long been lost. It’s reasonable for them to be different from the array techniques of today.”","Thinking of this point, Huang Yueli was instantly excited as she looked at the night sky with eyes that seemed to be glowing.","After learning about the history of the God Realm, she had never wanted to learn ancient array techniques and trap techniques.","But this kind of lost thing was rarely seen even in the Sacred Phoenix Clan and Cloudy Qilin Clan’s books collection. She had no place to learn it even if she wanted to.","He did not expect to encounter it here today!","Even if she didn’t pass King Xiang’s trial today and obtain the legendary ancient treasure, the Empyrean Devil Crystal, she wouldn’t lose out just by seeing these ancient formation patterns!","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli took a few deep breaths as she tried her best to calm herself down from her excitement.","The current situation was very obvious. King Xiang’s trial should be hidden in these array patterns. She needed to understand the operation law of these array patterns and find a way to break through them. From there, she could break through the illusion in front of her...","Huang Yueli held her breath and concentrated as she formed a hand seal and started to calculate.","Due to her powerful divine sense, her calculation ability had always been amazing. In a short time, she had already used more than ten methods to calculate the array patterns in the starry sky.","However, to her surprise, she couldn’t find any pattern no matter how hard she tried..","The role of the array pattern was to guide the energy that was injected into it to move along the trajectory drawn by the array pattern, thereby triggering the energy contained within, resonating with the Profound Qi of heaven and earth, and then erupting with a powerful force.","To crack the array, one first had to figure out the trajectory of the Profound Qi circulating in the array patterns.","But this time, when Huang Yueli tried to inject Profound Energy into these array patterns, she realised that she was totally unable to inject her Profound Energy in. After a few attempts, her Profound Energy was bounced back and she was almost injured from the backlash.","This was the first time she had seen such a situation.","This was no longer a question of whether she could crack it or not. It was that she could not even find an entry point.","If this went on, how could she pass the trial?","Huang Yueli was utterly defeated but just as she was feeling vexed, a flash of inspiration suddenly appeared in her mind as she realised that she had made a grave mistake.","“Right, what am I thinking? This... This was the array formation that King Xiang used to trial Devil Clan cultivators! Of course, I’ll have to use Devil Qi to crack it! I tried to crack it with Profound Energy, but it was impossible to succeed!”","Understanding this point, Huang Yueli heaved a sigh of relief and once again stretched out her finger, attempting to infuse Evil Qi into the array pattern.","This time, her energy did not bounce back.","However, it did not cause any reaction from the array patterns.","This made Huang Yueli feel a little uneasy.","Although she had always guessed that there was a deep connection between","Devil Qi and Evil Qi, the two were not the same thing atter all.","Could an array that could be activated by Devil Qi be activated by Evil Qi? She wasn’t confident either.."]},{"number":4583,"title":"Chapter 4583: King Xiang’s Trial (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4583: King Xiang’s Trial (7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","If that didn’t work, then she really had no choice.","Perhaps he would really be trapped in this illusion!","When that time came, she wondered if her husband would be anxious outside!","Fortunately, the things that Huang Yueli was worried about didn’t happen in the end.","After absorbing a large amount of Evil Qi, the array patterns in the starry sky finally emitted a blue fluorescent light.","Huang Yueli secretly heaved a sigh of relief.","“Fortunately, these array patterns can sense the evil aura. It’s just that it’s a little slower...What is the reason?”","Huang Yueli thought to herself as she felt that there was a huge secret hidden between this inexplicable connection between Devil Qi and Devil Qi.","Unfortunately, she had no time to think about it now.","Following the infusion of Huang Yueli’s evil aura, the array markings in the starry sky gradually revealed their original form. The evil aura followed the array markings and slowly swept past. The stars in the sky flickered, forming a bright halo, beautiful like a dream.","Huang Yueli closed her eyes and didn’t look at the beautiful scenery, but used her spiritual perception to sense the direction of the energy flow.","Not long after, she suddenly opened her eyes, and her eyes were filled with surprise. Wasn’t it a little too simple? It was obviously easy to crack! This... Was this really a trial left behind by King Xiang?","Or am I wrong?”","Huang Yueli’s brows furrowed as she pondered for quite a while before she calculated again a few times, afraid that she had calculated wrongly.","He wondered how many times King Xiang had given each person the chance to break the formation. What if they were wrong and could not try again? She couldn’t make such a low-level mistake.","However, no matter how she calculated, the result was the same.","Huang Yueli gritted her teeth,” Forget it, let’s just give it a try! There’s no point in continuing to calculate. It’s a waste of time.”","She made up her mind and immediately drew with her finger in the air. Pure Evil Qi flew out from her fingertips, forming energy lines that shuttled between the array patterns.","In the blink of an eye, her fingers drew more than ten lines.","Then, a loud bang came from the sky!","The entire night sky instantly collapsed. All the stars turned into meteors, dragging long streams of light as they fell towards her head.","Huang Yueli secretly cried out,” Not good!”","However, it was too late for her to dodge. These flowing lights all landed on her body and merged into her meridians in the blink of an eye.","Huang Yueli immediately complained incessantly as she almost vomited blood.","It was obvious that the flowing lights in the Devil Clan’s cave abode were all transformed from Devil Qi. These flowing lights that fell into her body were obviously rewards for cracking the starry sky array formation!","But the problem was, she...She wasn’t a Devil?","With so much Devil Qi entering her body, not only would she not be able to obtain any benefits, she might even explode and die on the spot!","What kind of nonsense was this!","For a moment, Huang Yueli almost lost all hope.","However, she soon realized that something was wrong. The flowing light had indeed entered her meridians at the first moment, but she did not feel any discomfort at all. On the contrary, a warm feeling rose from her dantian...","This warmth climbed up her spine and entered her mind.","Huang Yueli’s mind buzzed as a bright light flashed in front of her eyes as scenes of changing scenes appeared.."]},{"number":4584,"title":"Chapter 4584: King Xiang’s Trial (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4584: King Xiang’s Trial (8)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The stars that dotted the night sky seemed to have come alive and were constantly changing in front of her.","The movement of these stars was not irregular. Instead, they flowed slowly along the array patterns, simulating the direction in which energy flowed in the array.","Huang Yueli was stunned for a short moment before she understood and her heart immediately burst into wild joy!","This... This was King Xiang teaching her how to draw those array patterns!","She had never thought that there would be such benefits after cracking those array formations!","One had to know that cracking an array formation and drawing an array formation were actually not the same thing.","To crack an array, one only needed to find a weak point in the array as a breakthrough point. However, to draw a complex array pattern, one needed to be comprehensive and not make a single mistake. Sometimes, just a slight deviation from the hand during the drawing could cause the entire array to lose its effectiveness.","So even though Huang Yueli had successfully broken through the starry sky array earlier, but she was unable to set it up in its original state.","Huang Yueli had racked her brains just now and could only forcefully remember the position of the stars. She planned to leave this place and go back to think of a way to slowly research and calculate.","This was an ancient array formation, and it was even an array formation driven by Devil Qi. He did not know how long he would need to study it before he could achieve small success.","However, all these worries were gone now.","In the illusion left behind by King Xiang, the scene of the array patterns ‘arrangement actually began to appear automatically...","It seemed that King Xiang had left behind this illusion not only to prevent his descendants from obtaining the Empyrean Devil Crystal, but also to find a successor for him.","Thinking of this made Huang Yueli even more excited.","She knew that with her and Li Moying’s luck, they would definitely not return empty-handed after entering the treasure mountain!","Now, wasn’t the opportunity here?","However, even though the opportunity was right in front of him, it was not easy to grab it. He had to be 120% alert and deal with it carefully.","Huang Yueli took in a deep breath and calmed down very quickly. Sitting cross-legged on the ground, her pair of clear eyes didn’t blink as she stared at the changing trajectory of the stars in the sky, afraid to miss a single detail! Her efforts were indeed not in vain.","The stars left a few trails in the sky before quickly disappearing. When they reappeared, they had already shown a completely different trajectory.","It was obvious that King Xiang only intended to show these drawing methods once!","The second time it appeared, it was already a variation of these arrays.","In a short fifteen minutes, the stars in the sky flashed over ten times. In other words, at least ten over array patterns were drawn in front of Huang Yueli.","The amount of information was too much!","If it was someone else, it would be too difficult to remember one. They might even feel dizzy, headache, or even want to vomit because they had learned too much and could not accept it.","Huang Yueli also felt a little dizzy.","However, she still forced herself to remember all of these contents.","Not only did she remember it, but she also had a faint realization in her heart.","It seemed that the array patterns driven by the Devil Qi were not much different from the ordinary array techniques of the God Clan. There was only a slight difference in the direction of the flow of energy.","This was something she had not expected.","Before entering this cave abode, she thought that the Devil Clan could only set up those low-level array formations in the lower realm! Now, it seemed that she was really too ignorant..."]},{"number":4585,"title":"Chapter 4585: King Xiang’s Trial (9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4585: King Xiang’s Trial (9)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Fifteen minutes later, the starry sky suddenly darkened again.","Huang Yueli immediately sat up straight as she anxiously waited for the next change in the illusion.","Not long after, the sky lit up again.","Countless stars once again filled the sky, forming array patterns.","However, these stars stopped moving again, just like when she first entered the illusion array.","Huang Yueli was startled and immediately understood,” In that case, the trial left behind by King Xiang wasn’t just one but several! This... Was this the second trial? Looks like I have to crack these array formations again...”","Huang Yueli’s expression was solemn as she quietly observed the flickering star map in the night sky. Not long after, her eyes lit up.","“This... Wasn’t it too simple? Didn’t King Xiang already demonstrate it once just now? Can this be considered a trial?”","Huang Yueli’s anxious mood relaxed a lot.","In terms of complexity, these array patterns were naturally much more difficult than the previous trial.","However, just now, the will left behind by King Xiang had already shown her the method to draw those array patterns in the night sky.","Initially Huang Yueli knew very little about the Devil Clan’s array and it was rather difficult to decipher those array patterns but now that she had grasped the basic pattern, looking at these array patterns, it seemed much simpler and shallow.","Huang Yueli’s lips curled up slightly as she suddenly stretched out her finger and started to draw in mid-air.","Her slender and beautiful fingers seemed to be glowing under the dark starry sky.","Evil energy flowed from her fingertips and gently pressed on a few points in the starry sky.","With a rumble, the formation in the starry sky collapsed again!","Following the collapse of the array, countless rays of starlight once again shot towards Huang Yueli’s head.","But this time around, Huang Yueli wasn’t that panic-stricken.","Although she didn’t know the exact reason, she was already very clear that this energy wouldn’t immediately affect her body. It was just quietly hidden in her dantian.","No matter what would happen in the future, at least his life was not in danger now. There was no point in worrying about it now. It was better to focus on passing King Xiang’s trial as soon as possible and leave this place before making plans.","Similar to the previous trial, after Huang Yueli passed it, other than obtaining the energy from the starlight, she also saw the process of drawing the previous array pattern.","However, this time, the speed at which the starlight flowed became even faster, and the time King Xiang gave her to prepare was even shorter.","Huang Yueli felt that after a short while, her eyes were still a little blurry when the next trial’s array appeared in front of her.","Just like that, Huang Yueli sat upright on the spot and unknowingly, she had already passed the eight trials and entered the ninth.","As the trials continued, the formation patterns formed by the stars in the sky became more and more complicated.","By the time of the ninth trial, the array in the sky had already reached the complexity of the celestial array in the god clan.","Heaven grade array, because of its huge scale, even Huang Yueli was unable to complete it alone at this stage and required a large number of Array Masters to work together to draw it.","She was even more confused when faced with this Heaven Rank array formation driven by Devil Qi.","Even though King Xiang had been showing her the process of drawing the array patterns, she was unable to completely comprehend it in such a short period of time..."]},{"number":4586,"title":"Chapter 4586: King Xiang’s Trial (10)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4586: King Xiang’s Trial (10)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli sat under the ninth layer of array for at least ten hours and tried over ten times but she still couldn’t fully comprehend it.","As time passed, she suddenly felt something and frowned.","“The light of these stars seems to be...lt’s much dimmer than it was at the beginning...","She had passed the first few trials too quickly and had broken the array in just two hours.","This period of time was too short, so she had not realized that the brightness of these stars would change.","It wasn’t until the ninth layer that she realized that the starlight was dimming bit by bit. Moreover, every time she failed to break the array, the starlight would obviously dim.","Obviously, maintaining this illusion array required a large amount of energy. If she failed to break the array, it would also consume the energy of the illusion.","If she could not pass this trial before the starlight completely dimmed, she should have failed...","It was still unknown whether there would be any punishment after failure.","But at the very least, she would never be able to obtain the Empyrean Devil Crystal.","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli’s heart was bleeding.","That was...Her baby!","He was only a layer away from her and could reach her with a stretch of his hand. In the end, he actually didn’t get it!","It hurt, it hurt too much!","Under the drive of this depressed feeling, Huang Yueli’s mind suddenly had a flash of inspiration as she thought of something. The complicated array patterns in the sky seemed to merge into one in front of her eyes...","She suddenly pointed her finger forward, and an evil aura flew out from her fingertip!","“Boom!”","The ninth star map collapsed before her eyes!","Countless streams of light fell, and starlight shone continuously, forming a dazzling light screen that made it difficult for her to even open her eyes.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but cover her eyes.","After an unknown period of time, the dazzling light gradually dimmed.","Huang Yueli hurriedly opened her eyes, afraid that she would miss the Devilstration of the ninth array.","However, this time, she could not see the stars flowing in the sky.","Under the pitch-black night sky, a tall figure stood in the air.","This was a very handsome man. His long and narrow phoenix eyes were slightly raised, and he looked awe-inspiring. His thin lips were slightly pursed, and the slight wrinkles between his brows revealed his dignified character.","The man’s eyes were slightly red, as if there was fire flowing in them. His hair was also dark with a hint of red.","This... It was the symbol of the pure bloodline of the Sacred Phoenix Race.","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment before she blurted out: ” King Xiang!","Almost in a split second, Huang Yueli understood that this should be the legendary Armament Master King Xiang’s illusion formed from a thought.","King Xiang frowned slightly and lowered his head to look at her.” It was you who passed the trial I left behind? How is that possible?”","Huang Yueli’s lips sobered up as she propped herself up from the ground and cupped her hands towards the other party to give a big bow,” King Xiang, junior Huang Yueli, it was me who passed the trial you left behind. Many thanks for King Xiang’s guidance.”","The pressure from King Xiang was extremely strong and even if it was just a remnant of his consciousness, it was much stronger than all the top powers that Huang Yueli had seen in the God Realm.","It could be seen that King Xiang was at least an expert in the Profound Life Realm back then, and it was even possible that he was far more powerful. But this wasn’t the reason for Huang Yueli to give him such a huge bow.."]},{"number":4587,"title":"Chapter 4587: This is all... God’s will!(l)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4587: This is all... God’s will!(l)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli had never been the type to easily lower her head to the strong. Moreover, no matter how powerful King Xiang was, he had already passed away for many years so she didn’t need to be so respectful.","However, the method of drawing the devil formation patterns that King Xiang had left behind in the illusionary realm was truly too helpful to her.","If she had not come into contact with it here, she might not have been able to find a second chance in her life.","His guidance and explanation could be considered as half a teacher to her. Huang Yueli felt grateful from the bottom of her heart which was why her attitude was so respectful.","King Xiang had obviously been in a high position for a long time and when he saw Huang Yueli bow, his heart didn’t waver at all. Instead, he revealed a doubtful expression as his brows furrowed even tighter.","“That’s not right. How can you pass my trial? This... This is impossible...’","He muttered to himself for a while before his expression suddenly changed. A trace of viciousness flashed in his eyes as the aura on his body suddenly exploded and a powerful fire attributed Profound Energy swept towards her.","“Damned junior, what method did you use to pretend to pass the trial to deceive this king? Swindling Empyrean Devil Crystals from this king? You’re simply courting death!”","Following King Xiang’s extremely cold question, his attack also erupted.","Huang Yueli only felt two peerlessly powerful Profound Energies shooting towards her chest. That pressure was so strong that she was almost unable to move and every breath she took was scalding hot.","She hurriedly retreated, using almost all of her strength to barely dodge the two attacks.","This was all thanks to the fact that before she entered the illusion array, she had specially changed into a set of magic equipment-level armor in order to guard against possible dangers.","And now, these armors were almost scrapped. He did not know if they could be repaired in the future...","Huang Yueli rolled on the ground and dodged the attack as she immediately cried out to defend herself,” King Xiang, you...What are you doing? Why are you attacking me? When did I use any tricks to pretend to pass the trial? I didn’t. I just broke through layer after layer of array formations, a total of nine layers, before I could reach you!”","She was still confused and did not know what mistake she had made.","Why did King Xiang’s will suddenly attack her?","Logically speaking, she had already passed the nine trials. It was impossible for her to be killed by the owner of the mechanism.","Moreover, from the stone inscriptions in the karst cave and the way King Xiang had demonstrated the drawing techniques of the array patterns in the environment, King Xiang himself should not be a bloodthirsty person with a deep sense of evil...","What went wrong?","Just as Huang Yueli was feeling puzzled, King Xiang’s attack had stopped.","However, the cold killing intent in his eyes did not weaken. Instead, he let out a cold snort. The trial I left behind can only be passed by the Devil Clan’s cultivators. As for you... you have the pure bloodline of the God Clan, and it’s even my own race...Eh?”","He sensed the aura on Huang Yueli’s body and his face couldn’t help but reveal a trace of surprise,” Your innate bloodline is so strong that it’s extremely rare. It’s not much worse than when I was young. Eh, you’re actually a god-grade genius!”","Perceiving Huang Yueli’s shocking innate talent, although King Xiang’s anger had not dissipated, but his killing intent had obviously diminished a little.","However, the gaze he gave Huang Yueli was still rather unfriendly,” You have a god grade innate talent and in the future you will at least be a Life Profound Realm expert.. Your position in the clan must not be low, so why are you doing such a lowly thing?”"]},{"number":4588,"title":"Chapter 4588: This is all... God’s will!(2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4588: This is all... God’s will!(2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli saw that King Xiang didn’t have any intention of attacking her and felt slightly relieved.","She took a step back and quickly explained, “King Xiang, you’ve really misunderstood. I really didn’t use any shameful methods to deceive you.","Besides, your attainments in mechanisms and array techniques are so high. Even if I have this intention, how can I have the ability to deceive you?”","Hearing this, King Xiang was clearly stunned.","Then, he frowned.” What you said makes sense. How can a young girl like you, who is not even twenty years old, have such superb methods? How can there be a smokescreen in the world that I can’t see through? So, you really passed the nine trials? How is that possible?”","Huang Yueli replied: ” Although Junior is not talented, but I have been practicing array techniques since young. I have some attainments in array techniques...”","“No, this is not a matter of the level of the array technique, but...Instead...The","Profound Energy in your body is simply impossible to crack these arrays!” King Xiang couldn’t wait to hear her finish and interrupted her,” To tell you the truth, these formations are unique to the Devil Clan. Whether it’s activating the formation or cracking the formation, only the Devil Clan can do it.”","Of course, it was not impossible to break it with absolute power.","However, if one didn’t know the weakness of the array pattern or the method to break it, and only used brute force to break the array, then the cultivation of the person who broke the array must be at least one major realm higher than the person who set up the array.","For a complicated high-level array, no matter how strong the person who broke the array was, it was impossible to break it by force.","And Huang Yueli was obviously at the Heart Profound Realm so it was absolutely impossible to break the array set up by a Life Profound Realm expert like him with brute force.","King Xiang’s brows creased as he stared at Huang Yueli, his eyes flashing with a dark and gloomy light. Clearly, he was pondering, unable to decide if he should believe Huang Yueli’s words.","Huang Yueli hesitated for a moment and finally gritted her teeth and decided to tell the truth.","“King Xiang, actually...I can break these array formations because there’s Evil Qi in my body. I... Not only did I cultivate the Sacred Phoenix Race’s cultivation technique, I even took a Life Profound Realm evil cultivator as my master and cultivated an evil cultivation technique. I accidentally discovered that evil qi and Devil Qi seem to have the same origin to a certain extent and can replace each other. Therefore, I tried to use evil qi to break the array formation you left behind. In the end, I actually succeeded...”","Huang Yueli was initially still hesitant, not knowing if she should tell the truth.","After all, in the current twelve continents of the God Clan, evil cultivators were publicly recognized as heretics. As long as they were discovered, they would inevitably be punished, imprisoned, or even hunted down.","So after she and Li Moying acknowledged Saint Iniquitous Shadow as their master, they had been extremely cautious and had never exposed any signs of this.","However, now that she was facing King Xiang, even if it was just a trace of the will left behind by this ancient peerless expert, it was not something that she could easily deceive with lies.","Moreover, since King Xiang was able to befriend the Devil King of the Devil Clan, perhaps he was not as disgusted with evil cultivators as the other god races?","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli decided to take a gamble.","However, King Xiang’s reply made Huang Yueli feel surprised,” What’s a heretic practitioner?”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment as she couldn’t come back to her senses,” Uh, King Xiang, you mean...You don’t know about the Evil Cultivators?”"]},{"number":4589,"title":"Chapter 4589: This is all... God’s will!(3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4589: This is all... God’s will!(3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","King Xiang frowned slightly as he stared at Huang Yueli’s face, his eyes filled with doubt and probing.","“That’s right. This king has never heard of the evil cultivators you mentioned! You said that the Evil Qi cultivated by the evil cultivators had something in common with the Devil Qi in the Devils ‘bodies and could even replace each other. What kind of statement was that? Are you trying to deceive this king?” Huang Yueli hurriedly shook her head,” Of course not! I’m telling the truth!”","Huang Yueli thought for a moment and understood.","After all, King Xiang was a person from ancient times. This wisp of consciousness was probably sealed in this cave abode billions of years ago.","The evil cultivation method might have been a new cultivation method that came into being after the end of the ancient dynasty. It was very normal that King Xiang, an ancient person, had never heard of it.","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli roused her spirits and quickly explained to King Xiang about the origins of the heretic practitioner as well as the process of her cultivating the Wicked Shadow Secret Manual.","In order to win the trust of King Xiang, she even extended her right hand and slowly released a portion of the evil energy in her body.","King Xiang originally had a cold and stern expression but following Huang Yueli’s explanation and Devilstration, the astonishment in his eyes became more and more obvious. In the end, he couldn’t help but take a step forward and grabbed Huang Yueli’s wrist, directly probing her meridians.","Huang Yueli’s vital point was suddenly grabbed by someone and her first reaction was to dodge.","However, she tried a few times and was unable to shake off King Xiang’s hand.","Instead, after a few breaths, King Xiang took the initiative to let go of her hand.","“King Xiang, you are...” Huang Yueli immediately took a few steps back as a trace of vigilance appeared on her face.","However, King Xiang’s stern expression changed. He sighed deeply and let out a heartfelt praise. This so-called evil cultivation technique was invented by some god clan genius in the future. It was really... He was simply too talented!","When I was young, I also thought of creating such a cultivation technique. However, after trying for tens of thousands of years, I did not succeed. It turns out that... So it’s like this. This king was wrong...”","King Xiang kept muttering to himself and Huang Yueli who was standing not far away from him was totally confused.","However, she could at least hear that King Xiang did not have any intention of rejecting the evil cultivation method on her body. From his tone, it seemed that he quite admired it?","Therefore, he should have believed her words.","She should be safe now, right?","Huang Yueli didn’t think wrongly. After King Xiang sighed for quite a while, he finally stopped. The malicious aura on his face had completely disappeared and when he looked at Huang Yueli again, he even had a smile on his face as he waved at her.","“Little girl, come here. This king has something to ask you.”","Huang Yueli heaved a sigh of relief as she knew that she was safe now. Without any hesitation, she quickly walked to the front of King Xiang and stopped a few steps away from him as she bowed slightly,” King Xiang, if you have any questions, this junior will tell you everything I know.”","” What’s the name of the warrior who created the evil cultivation method?” King Xiang asked.","“Huh?”","Huang Yueli had never expected that King Xiang would suddenly ask such a question and was instantly stumped.","“Cough cough, this... This... I really don’t know.”","King Xiang’s brows instantly furrowed.” How could you not know? To be able to create such a cultivation technique, you must be one of the most outstanding experts of the God Clan. You’re the object of worship for all people.. You even cultivate the evil path, but you actually don’t know who your Master is?”"]},{"number":4590,"title":"Chapter 4590: This is all... God’s will!(4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4590: This is all... God’s will!(4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When Huang Yueli heard that, she was stunned for a moment.","After a while, he said, “King Xiang, is there some misunderstanding?” I don’t deny that the senior who created the evil path is indeed a genius, enough to be recorded in the history books. However, in the eyes of the God Clan, he is definitely not the object of worship by the people. It’s more like he is a person who is despised by the people...”","King Xiang’s handsome brows suddenly raised.” What did you say? How was it possible for the people to despise him? Are you joking with this King?”","Huang Yueli hurriedly shook her head,” No no no, this is definitely not a joke! King Xiang, I don’t know how your era viewed evil cultivation techniques, but in the eyes of the current god race, evil cultivation techniques are heresy. They will only cause people to go berserk and even be assimilated by the Devil Clan. He had always been quick to kill! “To be honest, ever since I started cultivating evil cultivation techniques, I’ve been very careful and didn’t dare to tell anyone. I’m afraid that my identity as an evil cultivator will be exposed and it will cause great trouble...”","Huang Yueli said a few simple words and explained the situation of the heretic practitioner to King Xiang.","When King Xiang heard this, he was even more surprised. He frowned and thought for a while before letting out a disdainful sneer.","“Hehe, I understand now. It seems that after billions of years, the God Clan’s self-righteousness and blind arrogance have not changed at all. They are even more foolish and laughable than before! “Hehe, it’s really ridiculous. A genius who can create such a cultivation technique and a grandmaster who can let the god clan use Devil Qi to cultivate is actually treated as a heretic...”","The expression on King Xiang’s face changed unpredictably. One moment, he was angry, the next moment, he felt pity, and the next moment, he seemed to find it very funny.","Huang Yueli’s ears were pricked up as she listened carefully to his muttering. When she heard this, her expression suddenly changed as her eyes widened in astonishment.","“King Xiang, you...What did you just say? Evil cultivation techniques were...Was it a cultivation technique that allowed the god race to use Devil Qi to cultivate? This...","How is that possible?”","“What’s so strange about that?” King Xiang glanced at her and said indifferently. Don’t you feel it yourself? You just said that the Evil Qi in your body is of the same origin as the Devil Qi. Do you think this is a coincidence? This is only because the energy system you use when you cultivate comes from the same source. Otherwise, how could there be such a coincidence?”","He paused for a moment and explained,” The Devil Tribe uses Devil Qi to cultivate. Their progress is much faster than the Celestials who use Heaven and Earth Profound Qi to cultivate. Moreover, Devil Qi can also greatly strengthen the body and will of the Devil Tribe. The advantage is very obvious. “Therefore, before I was born, countless god clan experts wanted to create a cultivation technique that allowed the god clan to use Devil Qi. Unfortunately, they all ended in failure. I never thought that someone would succeed after the","Profound Qi of heaven and earth thinned in the future...”","Huang Yueli finally understood a little.","In fact, ever since she discovered that evil energy could be used as Devil Qi to a large extent, she had a similar guess.","However, he felt that this idea was too shocking and he could not convince himself.","He did not expect that after hearing what King Xiang said, there were more than one or two people who had such thoughts!","In ancient times, the God Race did not reject this cultivation method at all and even desperately researched in this direction...","“But, King Xiang, since the Devil Qi is cultivated from Devil Qi, why do I still feel uncomfortable all over when I come into contact with Devil Qi?” Huang Yueli thought of another suspicious point.."]},{"number":4591,"title":"Chapter 4591: This is all... God’s will!(5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4591: This is all... God’s will!(5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The Evil Qi in Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s bodies wasn’t obtained from them actively absorbing the Devil Qi from the outside world, but from the Evil Qi that was directly absorbed from Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s cave dwelling.","This kind of energy was still different from Devil Qi.","Furthermore, the evil energy that they absorbed was extremely large and Li Moying was even in a coma for a few months because of it, almost causing a huge war between Sacred Phoenix Clan and Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Their practice of the Wicked Shadow Canon was not so much refining the energy between heaven and earth as releasing the evil energy stored in their dantians.","To put it bluntly, they had never used Devil Qi to cultivate at all.","Moreover, Huang Yueli didn’t think that they could use the Devil Qi to cultivate.","At least when they entered Devil King Ruiying’s cave dwelling earlier, the Devil Qi invaded their bodies and they only felt uncomfortable. It was two extremes from the usual comfortable feeling when they absorbed heaven and earth profound qi.","When King Xiang heard Huang Yueli talk about his cultivation situation, he was stunned as a puzzled expression appeared on his face.","“This... This... After all, this King was not the one who invented this cultivation technique. In a short period of time, I would not be able to understand the key points. You said that when you cultivate, you need to absorb special evil qi, not Devil Qi? this King thinks that this evil qi is also transformed from Devil Qi, but how to transform it...This is probably the uniqueness of the person who invented the evil cultivation method. If this King knew, he wouldn’t have had the chance to invent this cultivation method...”","Huang Yueli thought for a moment and it was indeed reasonable.","When King Xiang was still alive, he had spent tens of thousands of years but was still unable to explore the path of evil cultivation. Now, he had passed away for so many years, but he had only left behind a thought. In such a short period of time, with the little clue she had given him, he could find the problem. That was a miracle!","“However... ”","Just as Huang Yueli was prepared to accept reality, King Xiang suddenly changed the topic.","“However, as you mentioned earlier, the biggest reason why evil cultivation methods are criticized by the God Race is that it is easy to go berserk when cultivating evil cultivation methods. It is also possible to be assimilated by the Devil Clan. This is probably because the body has absorbed too much Devil Qi. If the transformation is not complete, there may be such a side effect. The reason why this King failed back then was because he discovered that cultivating this cultivation method could not avoid Qi deviation...”","Seeing Huang Yueli’s thoughtful look, King Xiang scoffed slightly,” What’s wrong, little lass? Are you afraid of Qi deviation?”","Huang Yueli shook her head, ” I’m not afraid of that. The senior who taught me this cultivation technique was also a Profound Life Realm expert. Moreover, he didn’t die because he went berserk. This means that he had already found a way to restrain the Devil Qi from eroding his consciousness. I wasn’t thinking about that just now...”","“Then what are you thinking about?” King Xiang’s curiosity was piqued.","Huang Yueli replied: ” I was just thinking that if evil cultivation methods can only be cultivated by relying on a limited amount of Devil Qi, then it would be much slower than directly absorbing Devil Qi to cultivate. Furthermore, at most when one cultivates to Life Profound Realm, one would encounter a bottleneck. If only we could overcome this problem...”","Hearing this, even King Xiang was stunned.","He had never expected that Huang Yueli wasn’t afraid at all and instead was filled with ambition, wanting to improve on the current evil cultivation method!","In his tens of thousands of years of life, although he had seen many geniuses, he had rarely seen such a sharp display of talent.."]},{"number":4592,"title":"Chapter 4592: This is all... God’s will!(6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4592: This is all... God’s will!(6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","King Xiang stared at her for a while. In the end, he could not help but shake his head and sigh.” The Sacred Phoenix Race is truly lucky to have a genius like you. Although I don’t have much contact with the family, since we met, it’s fate. I’ll give you something.”","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes as a look of pleasant surprise appeared on her face,” Thank you King Xiang! ”","Although she did not know what King Xiang wanted to give her, she knew that something that could be found between the fingers of an ancient expert whose cultivation level was unknown would definitely be extraordinary.","” Yes.” King Xiang nodded. He did not take out the item immediately. Instead, he asked,” What are your thoughts on the formations in the previous nine trials?”","Huang Yueli didn’t expect King Xiang to change the topic so quickly. After thinking for a while, she said truthfully,” These arrays don’t look very complicated but within the simple array patterns, there’s still a very powerful energy hidden within. It can even allow Devil Qi to pass through. Although this is different from the array used by our God Clan, but there are many similarities. Because of this, I was able to easily pass through the nine trials. It can be considered to be an advantage!”","Upon hearing these words, King Xiang could not help but snort. However, the corners of his mouth revealed a trace of a smile.” Little girl, you’re quite self-aware. You know that you’ve taken advantage of others to pass the trial!” These arrays that King Xiang set up in the illusionary realm were originally used to trial the Devil Clan juniors.","Devil Clan Array Masters were very rare to begin with. To be able to reach such heights, there might not even be one in a few thousand years. Therefore, this trial itself should be as difficult as ascending to the heavens!","Before Huang Yueli’s arrival, in the past trillions of years, thousands of Devil Clan geniuses had come here and experienced the trial but none of them could pass it and at most they could only pass the sixth level.","But Huang Yueli wasn’t from the Devil Clan, but a God Clan!","With the God Clan’s comprehension ability, although it was not easy to crack the ninth array, it was not as difficult as ascending to the heavens. There could always be a few such genius array masters in each generation.","However, although the array masters of the God Clan could theoretically break the array, in practice, they could not break the array with a single finger and pass the trial because they did not have Devil Qi in their bodies.","Only someone like Huang Yueli who had the comprehension ability of the God Clan and the aura of the Devil Clan, under the combination of the two, was able to pass through the nine trials.","Moreover, from the looks of it, she had passed the nine trials quite easily. It might not be a problem for her to be a little more difficult.","In such a situation, if one had to pursue the matter, it could actually be said to be cheating.upda@te by new novel. o r g","But when King Xiang saw a genius practitioner like Huang Yueli who was also from the same clan, he naturally developed a heart of love for her so he considered her to have passed.","“Then do you know why there are so many similarities between the god clan’s array formation and the Devil clan’s array formation? Why would I use those formation patterns to form a formation?”","Hearing this question, Huang Yueli was slightly startled and for a moment, she actually couldn’t answer it.","When King Xiang asked her the question, she had been thinking about it when she was cracking the array in the illusion. However, she could not think of an answer.","“This... It should be those simple formation patterns that have a special effect?”","After thinking for quite a while, Huang Yueli hesitated and gave her answer.."]},{"number":4593,"title":"Chapter 4593: This is all... God’s will!(7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4593: This is all... God’s will!(7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli was originally very uncertain but she felt that the silence was a little awkward so she tried to voice out her guess.","Unexpectedly, when King Xiang heard this, he nodded his head. There was even a hint of gratification in his eyes.” It seems that I didn’t misjudge you. Although you took advantage of being a heretic practitioner, your talent in array techniques is still very high. You can see that these array patterns are unusual.”","‘ That’s right. These array patterns are very special. Not only can they resonate with the Profound Qi of Heaven and Earth, but they can also resonate with the Devil Qi. So, if you only use these array patterns to form a magic array, then whether you use Evil Qi or Profound Qi, you can drive or break the array.”","“Then just now...Why can’t I use Profound Energy to break the array when I’m in the illusion? I’ve tried, but I failed...” Huang Yueli’s brows creased in puzzlement.","King Xiang said indifferently,” That’s because other than these basic array patterns that can be used between the God Clan and the Devil Clan, I’ve also added some Devil Clan’s exclusive array patterns. After combining the two, relying on the God Clan’s Profound Energy will not be able to activate it.” King Xiang’s words were a brand new concept that Huang Yueli had never heard of before.","As a result, Huang Yueli thought for a long while before she opened her mouth again,” So King Xiang, what you mean is that array patterns should be divided into three types. One is the basic array pattern that you mentioned earlier which is effective towards Profound Qi and Devil Qi. The other is the array pattern that our God Clan usually uses and the last is the array pattern that the Devil Clan uses?”","King Xiang frowned slightly and glanced at her.” What you said is not completely correct. There might not be only three types of formation patterns!”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment and after pondering for a moment, she understood.","There were not only two races in the world, the Devil Clan and the God Clan. The energy they refined was not only Celestial Chi and Devil Qi. For example, the Devil Clan, which had been hiding in the world, used a different kind of Devilic power from the God Clan and the Devil Clan.","Since there were array patterns that could only be activated by Devil Qi, there would naturally be array patterns that could only react to Devilic power.","However, he did not know if the Devils could use the basic array patterns that King Xiang mentioned.","Huang Yueli’s heart was filled with doubts as she directly asked.","With a senior with such high attainments in array techniques like King Xiang in front of him, he had to hurry up and ask any questions he had. In the future, he would not have such a good teacher to answer his questions.","“Don’t you understand what I just said?” King Xiang snorted. Since it was called a basic array pattern, it was naturally able to sense all energy! Therefore, this kind of array pattern was very simple and could be drawn with just a few strokes. Because the Great Dao was extremely simple, the simpler the array pattern, the more powerful the energy contained! If you could only use complex array patterns to draw powerful array formations, it showed that your level... You’re still far from it!”","King Xiang’s words were extremely impolite and towards Huang Yueli’s array skills, it was already a blatant disdain.","However, when Huang Yueli heard these words, not only did she not feel humiliated, but she instead felt enlightened, as though she had seen the answer to the doubts in her heart for so many years.","Her eyes sparkled..” I understand! No wonder, no wonder the Array Talisman that you left behind to open the door had such simple array patterns engraved on it, but it could greatly increase the strength of a cultivator and could be used repeatedly...”"]},{"number":4594,"title":"Chapter 4594: This is all... God’s will!(8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4594: This is all... God’s will!(8)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“So this is the power of the basic array patterns...Most of the formation patterns on that Array Talisman are the basic formation patterns that I saw in the illusion earlier!”","Huang Yueli finally understood.","No wonder this Array Talisman left behind by King Xiang was so powerful. It still had such powerful might even after hundreds of millions of years!","As for the other talismans that were passed down in the Immortal Realm, they could only be used a few times to completely collapse.","This was because, in essence, the formation patterns used by the two were not the same at all. The principle of using the energy of heaven and earth was also different. In the end, the power of the Array Talisman was naturally worlds apart.","Only then did King Xiang show some satisfaction. He nodded slightly.” You’re right. The formation engraved on that Array Talisman was only completed after I studied the basic formation patterns. It’s just a pity that this formation only uses sixty percent of the basic formation patterns, and the remaining forty percent is drawn with the Devil Clan’s formation patterns. If it could be completely drawn with the basic formation patterns, its power would probably be doubled!”","Huang Yueli raised her head to look at him strangely,” Then...King Xiang, why don’t you try drawing all the basic array patterns...","“Little girl, why are you asking so many questions? Of course, I have my reasons for doing this. This is not something you should ask!”","Before Huang Yueli could finish her words, she was stopped by King Xiang’s stern voice.","Huang Yueli was slightly startled as she looked at King Xiang’s somewhat uncomfortable expression and almost laughed out loud.","She could finally tell that she had asked a stupid question just now. King Xiang did not completely use the basic array patterns. Of course, it was because with his attainments in array techniques, he was unable to do this. Therefore, he could only mix a portion of the Devil Clan’s array patterns.","However, for a peerless expert like King Xiang, he would naturally not be willing to admit that his strength was lacking in front of a junior from billions of years later.","Huang Yueli could only cough,” Cough cough, Junior understands.” This is the cave of Devil King Ruiying, the key to open the cave. Of course, it has to be driven by Devil Qi. I was too ignorant...”","How could King Xiang not see through her insincerity?","So he glared at Huang Yueli in a bad mood and was too lazy to talk to her anymore as he directly threw a yellow coloured scroll in front of her.S earch newn0vel. on google","“This King’s research on basic array patterns is almost all in this scroll. Originally, this was this King’s secret, and even if I died, I planned to bring it to my coffin. However, you little girl is still to my liking. Moreover, this King did something that let down the family many years ago and should make up for it.","Therefore, it’s easy for you.”","Huang Yueli’s movements were nimble as she caught the scroll.","When he heard King Xiang say that these were his own research notes, he was instantly pleasantly surprised.","She knew that her luck had always been good, but she did not expect it to be so good this time!","The research notes of such an ancient peerless expert and top-notch","Armament Master were definitely something that could only be encountered by chance, especially the basic array patterns that King Xiang had mentioned. This was completely unheard of in the current God Realm, indicating that it had long been lost for many years.","With this notebook in her hands, she might be the only person in the current God Realm who grasped this kind of array pattern!","In Huang Yueli’s mind, she had already thought of the various magical effects that could be produced after the basic array patterns were merged into the array.","However, just as she was about to open the scroll excitedly to see what was going on, she suddenly heard the last few words of King Xiang and could not help but be stunned.."]},{"number":4595,"title":"Chapter 4595: This is all... God’s will!(9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4595: This is all... God’s will!(9)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","King Xiang had already said it once earlier that he did not have many dealings with the Sacred Phoenix Race.","Now, he was saying that he had once done something that let his family down...","This seemed to be slightly different from the records she and Li Moying had seen in the ancient records.","Because King Xiang’s attainments in refining weapons were too high, he could be considered one of the top existences in the ancient times. Therefore, even in the present, where most of the ancient history was missing, the only remaining ancient books still mentioned King Xiang’s name.","According to the records in these ancient books, King Xiang was the Sacred Phoenix Race’s Patriarch in the past!","How could he not have a good relationship with the family?","Could it be that he was another person who had eloped for the sake of marriage?","Huang Yueli’s heart was filled with doubts but she didn’t dare to ask any random questions.","This was different from asking King Xiang about array formations, but it was related to King Xiang’s private matters. It was fine if he might not be willing to answer, but if he touched any of his reverse scales, it would be troublesome.","Huang Yueli pursed her lips and didn’t probe further. She only said: ” Many thanks, King Xiang. After receiving your notes, I can be considered half a disciple of yours. Please accept this junior’s bow.”","Huang Yueli kept the scroll and bent her knees, giving a respectful bow to King","Xiang.","King Xiang did not dodge and accepted it as a matter of course.","When Huang Yueli got up, he waved his sleeves,” Alright, this King is only a shadow here and I don’t have any other treasures on me. You don’t have to stay here for long, you can leave now.”","Huang Yueli took a few steps back as she hesitated, “Empyrean Devil Crystal...","King Xiang said,” Since you’ve already passed the trial, you can take the Empyrean Devil Crystal. However, as a member of the God Clan, it might not be a good thing for you to take the Empyrean Devil Crystal. If you inhale too much Devil Qi, you might go berserk. Even if you’re a so-called evil cultivator, I’m afraid you can’t avoid it.”","Huang Yueli smiled as she replied: ” Right now I am indeed unable to absorb the Devil Qi. But that is because the evil path cultivation method is not perfect enough. If one day I am able to completely perfect the cultivation method, wouldn’t it be useful?”","King Xiang narrowed his eyes and looked at her for a while. He sneered, “Ha, you’re indeed a little girl who still smells of milk. You dare to say anything! Do you know that in ancient times, there were so many talented experts who wanted to find a way to use Devil Qi, but they all had no results? Are you that confident?”","‘ If you don’t have confidence, how can you keep breaking through and become a true expert?” Huang Yueli calmly asked back.","King Xiang glanced at her and did not say anything else. Suddenly, he raised his right hand and pointed in the air.","Huang Yueli’s eyes suddenly burst out with a blinding light as a huge impact crashed into her chest, causing her breathing to stagnate as she almost vomited blood on the spot.","For a moment, she completely lost consciousness.","But not long after, she heard a familiar voice beside her ear,” Li ‘er, Lit er?! Wake up, how are you? Where are you hurt?”","Huang Yueli endured the dizziness in her head as she opened her eyes and saw Li Moying’s handsome face appearing in front of her.","The man frowned slightly, his jaw tensed. He was expressionless, but his eyes could not hide his anxiety.","Huang Yueli hurriedly sat up,” I’m fine, Moying, don’t worry! You definitely won’t be able to guess who I met and what kind of opportunity I obtained! Right, where’s my Empyrean Devil Crystal?”"]},{"number":4596,"title":"Chapter 4596: Food Reserve (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4596: Food Reserve (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Only then did Huang Yueli recall her initial objective of entering the illusory realm.","The transparent barrier that stood in the center of the palace was gone, and the glowing Empyrean Devil Crystal inside was gone.","“Disappeared? How did it disappear?” Huang Yueli’s eyes widened.","Li Moying saw her astonished look and frowned in puzzlement,” Li ‘er, what’s going on?”","Huang Yueli pointed at the transparent cover’s original position,” Where’s the","Empyrean Devil Crystal? Where did it go?”","Li Moying was startled,” Why? Don’t you have the Empyrean Devil Crystal? Just now, when your palm touched the cover, you disappeared. I guessed that you were teleported to the place where you were trialed, so you waited at the side. After more than ten hours, the Empyrean Devil Crystal suddenly disappeared before my eyes. I guessed that you had passed the trial and obtained the Empyrean Devil Crystal...”","He only gave a simple explanation and didn’t go into detail. After Huang Yueli disappeared from his eyes, he was completely devoid of energy and was in a terrifyingly quiet palace, feeling extremely anxious and restless, as if every day was like a year.","Especially after the Empyrean Devil Crystal was gone, he thought that Huang Yueli would come out of the illusion very quickly but he didn’t expect that after waiting for close to four hours, he still didn’t see her figure.","This was a little ridiculous.","Even though Li Moying had been persuading himself that perhaps after Li ‘er passed the trial, she had obtained a huge opportunity which was why she didn’t appear.","However, as the saying goes, concern causes chaos. He still could not calm himself down.","After Huang Yueli heard Li Moying’s explanation, her heart became even more puzzled. She looked left and right but still didn’t understand what was going on.","“This... Isn’t this too abnormal? I’ve clearly passed the trial, and King Xiang just said that I can take the Empyrean Devil Crystal if I want it! He already said so. There’s no need to lie to me, right?”","Huang Yueli wanted to turn around and return to the illusionary realm but she had to find King Xiang to ask him clearly.","Unfortunately, the transparent barrier protecting the Empyrean Devil Crystal was gone, so the entrance to the illusion had also disappeared. She had nowhere to go even if she wanted to.","Just as Huang Yueli was feeling extremely conflicted, Li Moying’s line of sight swept across the empty palace and suddenly, his expression changed slightly.","“You said...The Empyrean Devil Crystal can’t be there, right?”","“Where?” Huang Yueli had yet to react.","Li Moying’s figure flashed as he turned into a ray of light as he flew towards a certain corner,” Where did this devil come from, courting death! Put down the Empyrean Devil Crystal!”","With a cold shout, the pressure in his body was instantly released and spread throughout the palace.","Huang Yueli quickly followed over and only then did she see that at the corner of the white marble wall, there was a palm sized, translucent spherical object that was stuck on top of a rectangular box.","She blinked her eyes in shock.","Earlier when Li Moying said that it was some Devil Creature, she thought it was some extremely ferocious beast, like the extremely cold giant octopus that they met outside the karst cave. But who knew that it was actually such a small thing.","This little thing was too small. It looked as soft as tofu, as if it could explode with a finger.","Furthermore, because it felt Li Moying’s pressure, the little thing was obviously frightened out of its wits as its entire body was trembling non-stop, looking more like a piece of swaying tofu....."]},{"number":4597,"title":"Chapter 4597: Food Reserve (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4597: Food Reserve (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“This... What is this?” Huang Yueli was dumbfounded as she pointed at this little thing.","Li Moying’s lips curled up coldly,” Obviously, a little thief. That box should be your Empyrean Demon Crystal.”","Huang Yueli was just shocked for a moment but after a few breaths, she reacted.","She immediately rushed to the little thing and snatched the exquisite box from under it.","On the outside of this box, there was an ancient and simple array pattern that was rarely seen in the Divine Realm.","However, Huang Yueli had already obtained some of King Xiang’s true teachings so this level of array wasn’t difficult for her at all.","Her fingers gently brushed across the array patterns and changed a few hand seals. After a few breaths, she easily opened the box.","The moment the lid was opened, a puff of pitch-black smoke suddenly shot out from the gap. Thick demonic qi surged out and filled the entire palace in an instant.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were right in front of the box and immediately felt a suffocating pressure, almost spitting out blood.","Fortunately, Huang Yueli was already on guard before opening the box. The moment she realised that the situation wasn’t right, she immediately used all her strength to close the lid back.","With a clang, the box closed, and the demonic qi stopped flowing out.","The large amount of demonic qi that had been released was slowly expelled by the palace array.","Not long after, the surrounding energy aura became very weak. Presumably, it would not be long before the extremely pure environment from before would be restored.","Huang Yueli heaved a sigh of relief,” As expected of the Empyrean Demon Crystal, this demonic aura...lt was really too terrifying! Even if a Demon Race cultivator obtained it, they might not be able to use it to cultivate. No wonder","Demon King Rui Fu wanted to entrust Senior King Xiang to build this cave.”","To the Devil Race, the Devil Qi was equivalent to the Xuan Qi of Heaven and Earth to the Celestial Race.","For ordinary Celestials, being in an environment with rich Xuan Qi was naturally helpful for cultivation. However, once the Xuan Qi was rich to a certain extent, it would be counterproductive. The body might not be able to withstand the impact of such a huge energy. Not to mention cultivation, a","slight carelessness could even cause the body to explode and die!","The demonic energy of the Empyrean Demon Crystal had already reached this level.","“Looks like the box outside is very particular. It should have been specially refined by senior King Xiang to store the Empyrean Demon Crystal. It can isolate the demonic qi inside the box and prevent it from leaking out...This is truly an astonishing skill...”","Li Moying couldn’t help but sigh.","He could not be considered an Array Master but as the young master of the ancient god clan Cloudy Qilin Clan, he had to dabble in these skills.","He also had his own judgment of the strength of the array formation.","When Huang Yueli heard that, she nodded her head repeatedly,” Senior King Xiang’s attainments in array techniques are really too shocking. Not only is there not a single Array Master in the current Divine Realm who can compare to him, even in the ancient times, I believe that not many people could be compared to him!”","“Oh? Li ‘er, your evaluation of Senior King Xiang is so high? After you were teleported out just now, you must have received Senior King Xiang’s guidance?”","Huang Yueli nodded,” That’s right, Husband, let me tell you, earlier I...”","Just as the two of them were chatting happily, suddenly Huang Yueli raised her hand and an evil aura shot out, smashing towards the marble wall.."]},{"number":4598,"title":"Chapter 4598: Food Reserve (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4598: Food Reserve (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The snow-white wall was grazed by Huang Yueli’s extremely sharp energy and immediately left behind a striking scratch.","Under this disharmonious trace, a small spherical object was shaking as if it could fall apart at any time.","“Little thief, where are you going? You want to slip away after stealing my things? How could there be such a cheap thing in the world? Hmm?!”","Huang Yueli gave a cold laugh as she strode over and grabbed the little thing on the ground, lifting it up.","Just earlier when she was talking to Li Moying, this little thing was slowly moving towards the direction of the arched door, wanting to sneak out when the two of them weren’t paying attention.","Who knew that although Huang Yueli was anxious to share her gains with her husband, she had not let down her guard as her divine sense had been covering the entire palace. The moment the little thing moved, she had detected it.","Huang Yueli held the little thing in front of her eyes and carefully examined it for a while, as she couldn’t help but reveal a doubtful expression.","“What is this thing? It looked so weak, pitiful, and helpless. It didn’t look like any kind of beast. How did he appear in the palace? Husband, do you know what this thing is?”","Compared to Huang Yueli’s calmness, Li Moying seemed a little nervous.","His sharp brows creased up slightly,” Li ‘er, be careful. Don’t look at how small this thing is, but to be able to survive in such a place with dense Devil Qi, it’s very likely to be a very dangerous Devil Beast. You just stretched out your hand to grab it.... It’s better to just stab him to death!”","The moment Li Moying’s words left his mouth, that tiny spherical object seemed to be able to understand as it trembled once again.","Huang Yueli waved the little thing on her hand and didn’t think much of it,” It’s alright, Husband, you’re definitely worrying too much. The energy fluctuation on this little thing was very faint, even weaker than that of an ordinary Earth Devil! If it dares to be disobedient, I can crush it with one hand! However, do you know what it is?”S earch newn0vel’ on g00gle","Li Moying didn’t say anything as he stared at this little ball for quite a while.","Actually, when he told Huang Yueli earlier, he had already been thinking about this problem.","If it was a spirit beast hoarded by the God Clan, he would rarely not recognize it. However, this was obviously a fierce beast of the Devil Clan. He really could not recognize many of them. He recalled all the ancient books he had read before, but there was no fierce beast that could match this little thing.","“This... I really can’t think of anything. Could it be...This isn’t a beast?”","“If it’s not a beast, then what is it? It can’t be the reserve grain that King Xianz kept in the palace, right?” Huang Yueli’s imagination suddenly ran wild.","However, once she had this thought, when she looked at this little thing again, her thoughts could not help but go astray.","“Eh? Husband, this little thing looks delicious! Look at its body. It’s so elastic, and its head looks very tender. If you take a closer look, it looks like a cuttlefish. It’ll definitely be good to roast it...lt’s just a little small. If the two of us eat it, it’s probably enough for each of us. It’s best to raise it before eating. However, if you raise it too big, I’m worried that it won’t be so tender and won’t taste good...”","Huang Yueli stared at the little thing for a while and really felt that she was drooling.","Thinking about it carefully, she had not eaten a good meal for more than ten days since she had mixed into the Devil army.."]},{"number":4599,"title":"Chapter 4599: Food Reserve (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4599: Food Reserve (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","This was because the Devils had never paid attention to food, let alone cooking techniques. They basically ate it raw.","They judged whether something was delicious or not mainly by how much energy it contained and whether it was tender or not.","Therefore, the young genius warriors of the God Clan were considered very good ingredients for them.","If not for the fact that they were afraid that eating them directly would waste energy, the Devils might not even be able to wait to refine them into medicinal pills and would eat them raw...","Huang Yueli and Li Moying didn’t want to reveal any flaws so naturally they didn’t dare to eat anything.","Of course, they didn’t dare to eat the raw meat of the spirit beasts and could only secretly eat some of the rations that Huang Yueli had hidden in her space when they returned to the tent every day. It could be said that their lives were rather tough.","Huang Yueli wasn’t someone who would treat herself unfairly and it had been a long time since she had suffered this kind of hardship!","Now, when he recalled the delicious taste of the grilled cuttlefish, he immediately drooled. His gaze toward the little thing was even more strange.","That little thing was originally able to maintain its composure but after seeing Huang Yueli’s terrifying gaze, it was immediately scared out of its wits and couldn’t help but scream,” Don’t eat me, don’t eat me! I can’t eat it, it doesn’t taste good! Chirm chirm chirn!”","Suddenly hearing a sharp and thin voice, Huang Yueli got a shock.","Thinking carefully, she realised that it was sent by this little thing in her hand and she was instantly stunned as she turned around to exchange a glance with Li Moying, only to discover that Li Moying’s face was also filled with puzzlement.","How could the two of them have thought that such a small thing could actually speak!","“Ji ji ji, I can’t be eaten! Let go of me!”","The little thing was still screaming.","Huang Yueli immediately gave a cold snort: ” Stop making a fuss here. Since you dared to steal this Young Miss’s things and even landed in my hands, it’s only right for me to stew you. Since you know how to talk, I’ll let you choose. Do you like to fry, barbecue, or stew?”","When the little thing heard the beginning, it thought that Huang Yueli had decided to let it go and before it could rejoice, it heard Huang Yueli’s words change and she had actually thought of three ways to cook it. Instantly, it was so frightened that its entire body was trembling like a half-cooked egg, swaying back and forth in Huang Yueli’s palm.","“Don’t... Don’t eat me! Sob, sob, sob, I can... I can recognize you as my Master and help you...Help you fight, help you guard your treasures, you...Don’t eat me!” The little thing screamed loudly.","When Huang Yueli heard that, she couldn’t help but give a cold laugh,” You.. You still want to acknowledge me as your Master? You even said that you can help me fight and guard the treasure? Where did your confidence come from? I can fight a thousand of you alone!","What’s the use of having a piece of trash like you acknowledge me as your","Master? I think it’s more practical to have a barbecue...”","As she spoke, she started to look for seasonings.” Yes, I remember that I still have a bottle of barbecue sauce. Where did he put it? I spent a lot of money to buy it in the Sacred Phoenix Continent!”","“No, no, no...Don’t eat me! I... Although I’m very young now, that’s...That’s because I was injured and became an infant. When I grow up, 1...1 will be very powerful! It was true! You guys even fought with me just now!” The little thing was scared out of its wits so much that it started to desperately try to sell itself to Huang Yueli.."]},{"number":4600,"title":"Chapter 4600: Food Reserve (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4600: Food Reserve (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli frowned as her face was filled with disbelief,” Just a palm-sized little thing like you, how powerful can you become when you grow up? You even fought with us just now? Why don’t I remember such a thing happening? Do you think I’ll let go of the grilled cuttlefish that’s right in front of my mouth just because you made up a few words?”","“Ji ji ji, I’m real! I’m really amazing! I’m not lying. I just fought with you outside the cave. Don’t you remember? Your man even chopped off a few of my limbs. It hurts so much! Hurry up and think!”","The little thing was so scared that its colour turned from pink to pale white. It looked a little unpalatable.","Huang Yueli frowned,” When did my husband chop you? Just now, it was clearly...”","She suddenly stopped halfway through her sentence.","Because she suddenly recalled that outside the karst cave, she and Li Moying had indeed experienced a life and death battle.","At that time, the enemy they were facing was indeed very powerful and even with Li Moying’s ability, he was at a disadvantage in front of the other party. If it wasn’t for his thunder attributed Profound Energy which could restrain the other party, the two of them would have been dead by now.","However, their enemy back then was a huge creature that was nearly a hundred meters long. This little thing in front of them...But it was not much bigger than her palm! Could it really grow that big?","“You... You’re the Extreme Frost Giant Eye Octopus outside the karst cave?” Huang Yueli stared at the little fellow for a while and said hesitantly.u pd@te by newnovel.","When the little thing heard her call out her name, she immediately became agitated as her round body bulged out, wanting to make herself bigger to attract Huang Yueli’s attention.","“It’s me, it’s me, it’s me! I’m the awe-inspiring, powerful, and handsome Giant Eye Octopus! I’m really amazing, believe me... Even the experts of the ancient times liked to use my clansmen to guard their homes. You mustn’t miss it when you pass by! As long as you raise me, I...I’ll definitely be of great use. You won’t regret it! Really!”","The Extreme Frost Giant Eye Octopus desperately stated its advantages to Huang Yueli, afraid that if she wasn’t careful, Huang Yueli’s hands would tremble and it would be roasted.","Having lived for countless years, it had never been so afraid.","The Giant Eye Octopus was already a ferocious beast in the ancient times, and it had lived in the deep cold pool for countless years.","When it saw Huang Yueli and Li Moying, these two juniors of the God Clan, it had never thought that it would lose and even felt that these two extremely daring God Clan were just fresh ingredients to fill the gaps between its teeth!","She had never expected that not only did it not manage to eat the two of them, it had even fought with Li Moying for an entire night and lost a few limbs. When he wanted to escape, he was swept into the entrance of the cave.","Huang Yueli activated the array on the round door and a powerful Devil Qi instantly surged in, stirring up a huge whirlpool. The Giant Eye Octopus had already suffered quite a serious injury and was caught off guard and was heavily injured by the Devil Qi, almost losing its life on the spot.","Fortunately, its reaction was fast enough to cut off all its limbs in time, saving its life.","However, in this way, its strength was seriously damaged. In order to recover, its body automatically returned to its infancy. A dignified ancient ferocious beast suddenly became inferior to an Earth Devil.","With such a body, the Giant Eye Octopus had no way of leaving the karst cave.."]}]);
